[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:20:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dialog): a view sets where the dialog enters from and exits to (#36)\n\nA closed dialog at tablet width and below always moved to 100svb, so a\nview that set --kicl--components--dialog--translate--starting-style still\nsaw its dialog slide down on exit. The closed position now reads that\nvariable at every width, and 100svb is only the default.\n\n--kicl--components--dialog--block-size--starting-style sets the height\nthe dialog opens from. The sheet layout (full height, square bottom\ncorners, no bottom margin) now applies from tablet down instead of\nmobile, through variables a view can override.\n\nCardDescription uses grey-dark, which reads better on a see-through card.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca7e371c9e546839b7306a45c80988f5e62832c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/trees/ca7e371c9e546839b7306a45c80988f5e62832c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/commits/5f21a0e7bab490b8bfd87a4cac7346ea8fd8881f","verification":{"payload":"tree ca7e371c9e546839b7306a45c80988f5e62832c9\nparent a3f0168bbc3ce86aefa7fdb0d54b26f308b5f2a3\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791267636 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791267636 -0700\n\nfix(dialog): a view sets where the dialog enters from and exits to (#36)\n\nA closed dialog at tablet width and below always moved to 100svb, so a\nview that set --kicl--components--dialog--translate--starting-style still\nsaw its dialog slide down on exit. The closed position now reads that\nvariable at every width, and 100svb is only the default.\n\n--kicl--components--dialog--block-size--starting-style sets the height\nthe dialog opens from. The sheet layout (full height, square bottom\ncorners, no bo