6:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(widgets): Background, and a card footer that can be centred (#34)\n\nBackground is the dithered light from Ki.CL''s home page, moved here so\nthe profile and sign-in pages can use it too. It is a canvas that fills\nits nearest positioned ancestor. The class and custom properties are now\nkicl--widgets--background.\n\nCardFooter takes justifyContent. It hardcoded stretch, so a Layout around\nit could not centre its actions. The default is unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f305301efe93bf5207b9fe696b8d54533c58c44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/trees/6f305301efe93bf5207b9fe696b8d54533c58c44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/commits/a3f0168bbc3ce86aefa7fdb0d54b26f308b5f2a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f305301efe93bf5207b9fe696b8d54533c58c44\nparent 7326bf4ae819ac732e0fc4f62cbb8e8cf29845fe\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1791249993 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791249993 -0700\n\nfeat(widgets): Background, and a card footer that can be centred (#34)\n\nBackground is the dithered light from Ki.CL''s home page, moved here so\nthe profile and sign-in pages can use it too. It is a canvas that fills\nits nearest positioned ancestor. The class and custom properties are now\nkicl--widgets--background.\n\nCardFooter takes justifyContent. It hardcoded stretch, so a Layout around\nit could not centre its actions. The default is unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxE5JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoDYQAH/uyl5P3xe7DIBT3ifM+9ns\nHMCGolUPnttBb5mQfr8hZD3szwVLsL7za52x4MxAX11fc2rg8GGcTwmlBlzUQQhP\nQ1OhaGJZwHvsUDY3puzUuB0/xW+mWVIMYmDxMBETIvwcFpn8PJeJXD5G6KZyhTIV\n0nEUbu9Dgv7ecn0zEjptOdtmZK1gaUjhnsiUyVoqS/zt6vzTmBeW8/JouHMVQDWz\nW0MgJPELppJPfq3XsyQdkO1RvX0h