eived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commits/338cd8ad0ab8757281ca80de9f9cfec91f643f63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T02:23:57Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T02:23:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(dev): make run serves the remote with Vite, so the host hot-updates (#30)\n\nmake run used to build Design/dist once and serve it with Express, so a\nchange here needed a rebuild and a reload in Ki.CL. Vite''s dev server\nserves the remote, its types at /design/types.zip (regenerated on change)\nand an HMR socket the host proxies, so it replaces Express in\ndevelopment. Express stays for production.\n\nButton and HyperLink exported their class-name helpers from the\ncomponent file. Fast Refresh only hot-swaps a file that exports nothing\nbut components, so every edit there reloaded the host. The helpers now\nlive in class-names.ts; the barrel exports them as before.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eefc56376c5d435da7350c38985e94a9b0eec6ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/trees/eefc56376c5d435da7350c38985e94a9b0eec6ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/commits/338cd8ad0ab8757281ca80de9f9cfec91f643f63","verification":{"payload":"tree eefc56376c5d435da7350c38985e94a9b0eec6ee\nparent 5d6722c02ecbbdbcb13b480c072e54bac1825964\nauthor github-actio