ps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/657845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commits/63357b9d9e594cc6b23ff95414cddae5ad1d6b3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:25:01Z","email":"hello@ki-cl.com","name":"Keni Lam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:25:01Z","email":"hello@ki-cl.com","name":"Keni Lam"},"message":"fix(styles): type is inherited, so a button''s label matches the button\n\nThe `*` rule set the font family, weight, letter-spacing and line height on\nevery element, so nothing inherited them. The span `Button` wraps a label in\ngot the page line height of 1.5 instead of the button''s 1, which made a\nbutton with a label taller than one without.\n\n`body` now sets the type once and `*` inherits it. `Button` only wraps text\nin a span when it sits next to an icon or a spinner. `button` is out of the\nglobal `line-height: 1` rule; `Button`, the calendar buttons and the popover\nand select triggers carry `kicl-line-height-narrower` instead.\n\nThe legend''s description sits inside a `code` chip, so it now sets its own\nfont and weight to stay plain copy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8cb2b4107948081c5f4128088161a8a798ab2c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/trees/d8cb2b4107948081c5f4128088161a8a798ab2c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/commits/63357b9d9e594cc6b23ff95414cddae5ad1d6b3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/657845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commit/63357b9d9e594cc6b23ff95414cddae5ad1d6b3a","node_id":"C_kwDOU6qertoAKDYzMzU3YjlkOWU1OTRjYzZiMjNmZjk1NDE0Y2RkYWU1YWQxZDZiM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commit/811b026caa993e258e9f0c89308e0d5252e61f09","sha":"811b026caa993e258e9f0c89308e0d5252e61f09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commits/811b026caa993e258e9f0c89308e0d5252e61f09"}],"sha":"63357b9d9e594cc6b23ff95414cddae5ad1d6b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commits/63357b9d9e594cc6b23ff95414cddae5ad1d6b3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commits/811b026caa993e258e9f0c89308e0d5252e61f09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:59:46Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:59:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(text): code blocks wrap long lines (#25)\n\n* fix(text): a code block scrolls its own long lines\n\nA pre''s longest line was the narrowest the page could be, so on a phone the\nmoonshot introduction, with its git clone command, ran off the screen. The\npre now scrolls sideways itself and never grows past its container.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(text): a code block wraps long lines instead of scrolling\n\nWrapping, breaking anywhere, reads better on a phone than a sideways\nscroll. The pre and its code use pre-wrap with break-all, so line breaks\nand indentation in the code still hold.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00ea7b7c3e9580936d5b5119ca08cccf39b8f413","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/trees/00ea7b7c3e9580936d5b5119ca08cccf39b8f413"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/commits/811b026caa993e258e9f0c89308e0d5252e61f09","verification":{"payload":"tree 00ea7b7c3e9580936d5b5119ca08cccf39b8f413\nparent 99593bfe4652bc90224cfcb6b0d2a5467d5c69d3\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791151186 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791151186 -0700\n\nfix(text): code blocks wrap long lines (#25)\n\n* fix(text): a code block scrolls its own long lines\n\nA pre''s longest line was the narrowest the page could be, so on a phone the\nmoonshot introduction, with its git clone command, ran off the screen. The\npre now scrolls sideways itself and never grows past its container.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(text): a code block wraps long lines instead of scrolling\n\nWrapping, breaking anywhere, reads better on a phone than a sideways\nscroll. The pre and its code use pre-wrap with break-all, so line breaks\nand indentation in the code still hold.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwsxSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8tAQAHmrcN5MNKMZpHpoKxuIa7B/\nlfTolnbmmsnx8NAmWpCmiuVl6+FMfEKt/IDTcVNPndbW4OsVDp1k8/os8MsZwmkC\nxkqOGhCMhnIaLnrD7L9ssw2qlzj+WwO4RBQGwOOIWtZuZyjwhNrMVK7Ns6Ne