.CL-design-system/commits/99593bfe4652bc90224cfcb6b0d2a5467d5c69d3"}],"sha":"811b026caa993e258e9f0c89308e0d5252e61f09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commits/811b026caa993e258e9f0c89308e0d5252e61f09"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commits/99593bfe4652bc90224cfcb6b0d2a5467d5c69d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:48:08Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:48:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(input): before and after slots, truncation, and four input types (#23)\n\n* feat(input): before and after slots, truncation, and four input types\n\nInput takes `before` and `after` for content inside its border (an icon, a\nprefix, a button) and becomes an InputGroup when it has them; every other\nprop still reaches the <input>, so FormControl works unchanged. Long values\nand placeholders end in an ellipsis.\n\nOn top of it, after shadcn''s input-group examples: PasswordInput shows and\nhides what was typed, EmailInput has the mail icon and email keyboard,\nSearchInput clears itself (the button shows only with text, from CSS) and\nCopyInput copies its read-only value.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(input-group): tighter padding beside addons, wider gap, square inner input\n\nThe group''s inline padding narrows on the side that has an addon, the gap\nbetween addon and text widens, and the input inside drops its own radius.\nAn invalid group shows through the outline colour instead of the border.\n\nAlso ignores .history/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(input-group): a softer red border on invalid fields, in both themes\n\nAn invalid group''s border uses the error colour mixed half with transparent,\nso it reads as a hint rather than an alarm; the focus outline keeps the full\nerror colour. The theme rules set the border colour later at the same\nspecificity, so the invalid rule now covers dark and light both.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ceb4acb5afa664a12d58e489dae86de3fb792f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/trees/7ceb4acb5afa664a12d58e489dae86de3fb792f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/commits/99593bfe4652bc90224cfcb6b0d2a5467d5c69d3","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ceb4acb5afa664a12d58e489dae86de3fb792f4\nparent 4dffd6b1fc9b249496eb40e45c1223dcd04e6680\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791150488 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791150488 -0700\n\nfeat(input): before and after slots, truncation, and four input types (#23)\n\n* feat(input): before and after slots, truncation, and four input types\n\nInput takes `before` and `after` for content inside its border (an icon, a\nprefix, a button) and becomes an InputGroup when it has them; every other\nprop still reaches the <input>, so FormControl works unchanged. Long values\nand placeholders end in an ellipsis.\n\nOn top of it, after shadcn''s input-group examples: PasswordInput shows and\nhides what was typed, EmailInput has the mail icon and email keyboard,\nSearchInput clears itself (the button shows only with text, from CSS) and\nCopyInput copies its read-only value.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(input-group): tighter padding beside addons, wider gap, square inner input\n\nThe group''s inline padding narrows on the side that has an addon, the gap\nbetween addon and text widens, and the input inside drops its own radius.\nAn invalid group shows through the outline colour instead of the border.\n\nAlso ignores .history/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(input-group): a softer red border on invalid fields, in both themes\n\nAn invalid group''s border uses the error colour mixed half with transparent,\nso it reads as a hint rather than an alarm; the focus outline keeps the full\nerror colour. The theme rules set the border colour later at the same\nspecificity, so the invalid rule now covers dark and light both.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwsmYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFXEQAGQxorQXtvYFPsDfxEXeC3SS\nTVWPMJm2Jh3QbW+aj5yxjgGzoyL1TLKpXVf+oVNz0or7Gm1rxALUqRdxg8sjC3xr\ntTGcXs8NNY97zKWHSq6Tam08JIk59jrDVsR+nVvBqXhvVcl2BfN4EJtvmJGtEQd7\ndGihTaDUnrTNSBoOoHdhXhwz+dZEMQMhv/q+30