bot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/commits/3a0ffbae185db21bc66b4f3297b0eb743f2d6a9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:01:24Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:01:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: components the moonshot exercise needs (#17)\n\nPopover gets twelve placements, an offset, block and inline (portal) modes,\nan asChild trigger and PopoverHint, which opens on interest with\n`interestfor` instead of JS. Segmented can collapse into a popover or a\nscroll strip on small screens. Sheet is now a dialog: Escape closes it, and\nat tablet width and below it opens modal, with the page behind it locked.\n\nAlso: Text takes `is=''del''` and `is=''ins''` and draws `pre > code` as one\nblock, Card can be a dialog and outlines on `:target`, the theme button is a\nshared ThemeToggle widget with an optional variant, and there are\n`kicl-hidden-up-to-*` and `kicl-max-block-size-screen*` utilities.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39a3deb6e3509e6c98847bdaf2405728f798b3bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/trees/39a3deb6e3509e6c98847bdaf2405728f798b3bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-design-system/git/commits/3a0ffbae185db21bc66b4f3297b0eb743f2d6a9e","verification":{"payload":"tree 39a3deb6e3509e6c98847bdaf2405728f798b3bf\nparent 7eca7d38a1a52f693808158ed9eab5972fea0f17\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791104484 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791104484 -0700\n\nfeat: components the moonshot exercise needs (#17)\n\nPopover gets twelve placements, an offset, block and inline (portal) modes,\nan asChild trigger and PopoverHint, which opens on interest with\n`interestfor` instead of JS. Segmented can collapse into a popover or a\nscroll strip on small screens. Sheet is now a dialog: Escape closes it, and\nat tablet width and below it opens modal, with the page behind it locked.\n\nAlso: Text takes `is=''del''` and `is=''ins''` and draws `pre > code` as one\nblock, Card can be a dialog and outlines on `:target`, the theme button is a\nshared ThemeToggle widget with an optional variant, and there are\n`kicl-hidden-up-to-*` and `kicl-max-block-size-screen*` utilities.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwhXkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOjcQACWdYxdYEer1YV7dmH/GENaT\nlNT1l36/LwJ8km3Nztxk9a1kYROedSKoTBWZUvUch3+Zh/AbGeMGUdchVM+D5ZZv\n40yCwdgnvwMvGoCb01+LzhDdL3Fn3x2RTq3xzDYdS/ugob0ho318OFGB/lQlmn9u\nmQ8q38eJdb5zJSwjrL5LntqFmDtuKymemdcacmqyXqUY9L6DPpb2fe41RRyqs3sN\nUkkoews66kolOw7IHGxOc77IleXzLxqrnS1bi636wEr7clMuy8VM1qbzsPRN7/NZ\nVWTI7Ujlp9+0z93s16fEvzVg4y5bePnsw5+L9JBTA6shPY74Wm7wQdB4z/1OzJaD\nXYig1JzCi4lsb18X15iPbM6l2nyL6pFTk06IXMhzkH4ZfY9YI64nPb4NT+mkH832\ntwFpDadNiyeu1je54fojHzqJ11JYBQeJ2JVnEp9IKOLonEHFfEARcUO8/LLjaWlY\nFpOQ2nnp8apd0oKnptxisblFwV2Hx2lN08Zc0TOz1p2OejNKEGRvrJeRR5crAp68\n/9NJXZKYt4da8vmllaKY36tl0jEsyfCI0hECSNVi06+jvIEzs1dENMGPq5wDXry3\nz/V2W14iNQ+7oL/vo7KO8H65W75QijuD/1vjsn+1QGBvOAjiMkcJbh71iA5u0AR+\nqej5erMWKoavJ+ZzWNvp\n=7qxu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T09:01:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","grav