","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/commits/3e102d3e9f818ddbca1acb44c860351c4a7e9494/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:46:11Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:46:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(compose): arrow keys on the kind never move focus to the text (#24)\n\nThe kind tracked pointer presses with its own flag, set on pointer down and\ncleared only on a change. A click on the kind that was already chosen left\nit set, so the next arrow key sent focus to the textarea. Segmented now\nreports `{ pointer }` with each change, so the flag is gone.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8dc5734ebca8622d046534d86b3ddffececfe92c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/trees/8dc5734ebca8622d046534d86b3ddffececfe92c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/commits/3e102d3e9f818ddbca1acb44c860351c4a7e9494","verification":{"payload":"tree 8dc5734ebca8622d046534d86b3ddffececfe92c\nparent 85c2b322f72f2cc556a77d7936bde196c4226b87\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1791164771 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791164771 -0700\n\nfix(compose): arrow keys on the kind never move focus to the text (#24)\n\nThe kind tracked pointer presses with its own flag, set on pointer down and\ncleared only on a change. A click on the kind that