d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/commits/c2104a19f8317bbf1068afcf0fb39f8461fce4b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:38:57Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:38:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: tell the host when the session ends (#19)\n\nOn a 401 the module now fires kicl:session-ended, so Ki.CL''s portfolio\ngate shows its sign-in, and the standalone shell starts a new session once.\nThe server checks a session with Ki.CL-back every minute instead of every\nten, so a revoked one stops working soon after.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4fd3786e7a04157a011bd37818d24a181b88ef44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/trees/4fd3786e7a04157a011bd37818d24a181b88ef44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/commits/c2104a19f8317bbf1068afcf0fb39f8461fce4b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 4fd3786e7a04157a011bd37818d24a181b88ef44\nparent 96297e6f1c90f084e134fdca2207e59b928549a5\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791142737 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791142737 -0700\n\nfix: tell the host when the session ends (#19)\n\nOn a 401 the module now fires kicl:session-ended, so Ki.CL''s portfolio\ngate shows its sign-in, and the standalone shell starts a new session once.\nThe server checks a session with Ki.CL-back every minute instead of every\nten, so a revoked one stops working soon after.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwqtRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5ngQAEDzPN0b5DZWXj10/Tx6v+jg\nSd22qPxdWIV1dnrxRABylhSp4FSORE2Xd7U/cpoe858hq8ehr9bk0v67ubtvfT3M\nQCBjiPAsu5lP45kiSU9G4ABhj4Fr4hgmq4/qLTU9CpSrM5x/BSQ4qEEuqrhe6NTI\n1Rt1Y7IKAMKx5nsfezoPPSJTDkBhnUVAS6Ajm1BbbJrTvIcmMfGExTHFvpQ25gy2\nRVrS+yedthr5+lDhs8X2GXiadjWcjNz2uUToEOkk4beCfzN+hr8kYYOZpXeATF2Q\n7XYvKVj8TuV5L5D3qFXFVYQ64bSRNS2/1DTaRam6IErNDQMt6C1ZLzlKalAcKBQs\nHpB2Ueh8q7GFUEBtkxcHbKy4+YiIPNtDCq7U74tK1rd40aBnQAdmn/WllAxZWkiv\nlLoAQmNOlgcDeU9yMuvnR7burt9sbE6nbE1Nth5v4dI9fG8yJ90xvP/mHt0JQgA2\nHSBwi5qNqH2UnZ8UqyKjveH+CRcPzzKi81H8cFtGtqkyAWnK/mxdtPvdqS/ATLPe\njqx8PrT8BeN8QdL5Gvh6tZLvHRik2yUjhinJtzRAek6O8tMoypH2IXNmUJSvHUTq\nSatPCCGqQP8JD9aDT8CStuBlIUE60/yzBtkc30r5CBoVt9sRQxqZlF5duAy+4IKN\nfI9q3dZLgYiEV0yKQ2eg\n=YzFe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T19:38:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/commit/c2104a19f8317bbf1068afcf0fb39f8461fce4b2","node_id":"C_kwDOU6uKFtoAKGMyMTA0YTE5ZjgzMTdiYmYxMDY4YWZjZjBmYjM5Zjg0NjFmY2U0YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/commit/96297e6f1c90f084e134fdca2207e59b928549a5","sha":"96297e6f1c90f084e134fdca2207e59b928549a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/commits/96297e6f1c90f084e134fdca2207e59b928549a5"}],"sha":"c2104a19f8317bbf1068afcf0fb39f8461fce4b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/commits/c2104a19f8317bbf1068afcf0fb39f8461fce4b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/commits/96297e6f1c90f084e134fdca2207e59b928549a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T18:55:31Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T18:55:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: drop the api remote and Apollo (#14)\n\n* refactor: drop the api remote and Apollo\n\nSessions are the host''s job. Inside Ki.CL the module only needs the cookie,\nso it no longer renews sessions itself: on a 401 it asks the visitor to\nreload, and the host restores the session on load. The standalone shell,\nwhich stands in for Ki.CL, starts its session with one fetch to Ki.CL-back''s\nExchangeToken instead of loading the api remote''s Apollo client.\n\nThat removes the api remote, its types download, its proxy routes, and\n@apollo/client and graphql from the client.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(standalone): start the session with POST /api/session\n\nKi.CL-back now serves ExchangeToken as a plain request, so the shell no\nlonger holds a GraphQL operation or reads the x-api-key cookie. The proxy\nnarrows from /api to /api/session.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de6832371d1835553292540e84430300cab87bda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/trees/de6832371d1835553292540e84430300cab87bda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/commits/96297e6f1c90f084e134fdca2207e59b928549a5","verification":{"payload":"tree de6832371d1835553292540e84430300cab87bda\nparent f06de2e4f5c0616bc3f5ca79b970dc8a7b262548\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791140131 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791140131 -0700\n\nrefactor: drop the api remote and Apollo (#14)\n\n* refactor: drop the api remote and Apollo\n\nSessions are the host''s job. Inside Ki.CL the module only needs the cookie,\nso it no longer renews sessions itself: on a 401 it asks the visitor to\nreload, and the host restores the session on load. The standalone shell,\nwhich stands in for Ki.CL, starts its session with one fetch to Ki.CL-back''s\nExchangeToken instead of loading the api remote''s Apollo client.\n\nThat removes the api remote, its types download, its proxy routes, and\n@apollo/client and graphql from the client.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(standalone): start the session with POST /api/session\n\nKi.CL-back now serves ExchangeToken as a plain request, so the shell no\nlonger holds a GraphQL operation or reads the x-api-key cookie. The proxy\nnarrows from /api to /api/session.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwqEjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYZAQAEEVFznyrT1sCuys702qBuki\nnCzXX8pp0W04ktxwhK5C/2UxGXw47bnNMqBa3B2Q7bBR8snZBV9iwvKQtNfDURQ4\nN64U18b3ZYCV+HkR9IgVlmVRN/fsc/2bfdBAs3WqfhetKHXh0iZIvuN51mgHiiSZ\nyR7PYwS4IaEQncO1anfoJCMr03EIYcAVxN0YrVeFMy9UPmQuxg4azy4Z2GYZOVNI\njtnQqdXs9Jj3G87H2c3ajXQ4v4EoWOglfBnAtMzeY9rpxsO0BxgFm6ugprTdEYJ1\nrT36DW8dGU04q41IrJBZYWGFttt4DdYq8wt0CGz5PSm6pd73MJby31b/8Gk8OffK\nPptWlR51ysqMFvkVs3hFsYchUPZ8EV1GMlv0eC2Ox+YL1jQE4+/LMi956YB829J0\nHOmWWTjQL37I+SG84ZsWK7ZrwqgJ0ydQ3bLOejYexNM0SGbm3vvsnBZhqlGpdoNG\nTzLtqSoDIx+RMzMEIrWL89Kg2P+DPq9qZzeZ+VIJcPXoTx6/79gZIWbeRHRWuyLg\nGipAI61gYIGMEY7YrLtqzgf9/sNl2lH8Js2LhX+FxP6h4Q17Tn1ukI3WIDY0R9lI\nTN61I+RatdCrtjLbGTuxzmTSzr0x7skotTKmatIgzc1Uc4RzGQ5PuMiecxX5U0un\n+X+WXL5z31q7ljJKXcGN\n=tusp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T18:55:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow