","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/commits/f06de2e4f5c0616bc3f5ca79b970dc8a7b262548/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T10:13:26Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T10:13:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: set up .env before the first start, and warn without a token (#10)\n\nThe README and the introduction page said to run make start and then add\nthe client token, but make start downloads the types and starts the dev\nserver straight away, so a reviewer''s first start failed against\ndev.ki-cl.com''s password page. Both now copy .env and set the token first.\n\nThe README also covers the Turnstile key for a local Ki.CL-back and running\nthe module inside a local Ki.CL, which needs make run.server and a build.\n\nmake run and make types now warn when requests will go to the deployment\nwithout a token.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52c4aade81e20db3d13ca7d8be791605de7f4063","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/trees/52c4aade81e20db3d13ca7d8be791605de7f4063"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/commits/f06de2e4f5c0616bc3f5ca79b970dc8a7b262548","v