.com> 1791106795 -0700\n\nci: the same workflows as Ki.CL and the design system (#7)\n\n* ci: the same workflows as Ki.CL and the design system\n\nCI on every push (lint, typecheck, tests, build), a pull request opened on\nthe first push of a branch, a Dev to Prod pull request once the develop\ndeploy on Cloud Build succeeds, and a Prod to Dev sync after each release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: typecheck the server only\n\nThe client''s types come from the remotes, which a runner can''t download\nwithout a client token.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwh7rCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeQ8QAGFvLw2qQWaP3rxAPGVqDLZH\niimP6XCZnHvI7I6VPaWvjsuh0lMexSaLlrExx9Tfp9aaU/VjFzb+XmZOOAb1vQM3\nU3Q1KoOtixB7ms9+gVOcAm22TdAIHRNmnuNDxGnjCJctBZWCOOpJ6P7AUucKtasy\nKcAf+77aRzzoR0u9ps+UoAJACZ6I6qFMxf/O53zQ328EXyYuXPfFrxWsxjxUZQhC\nGRUfww7gBrdqgCii+/ej3yvyN8uQP37e5iKLZaPGP6PfTX4Tt3Y1Fbo9hs5R9iIR\nRRsxtPvlPIxGW1LMfL3Beyb9VoTku6dSR9j9d7j3iyRs2OQISq8OPKP9bgUoMBm1\npPVpXAuKnjokBk4vyRwNQ49QTPZJ5XumA1c1KO7M26jrjXbRHCwKdt6+AfyHk0bx\ndAJ0IgoKh+Wi+99ipNa71CvsMaAp47ZtQYzUD+ZRhy72qKJx2Gjvm/ZXxHlaZ+4Q\nOu48VVHTCVIlT609QZdLL2fGuVYRWRZTuqqd1u4lvQqFTBKFfgniZCeooD3lGjzr\nc2/CIk8yY7CZnB/dc1luyVGaKwbfF3AnmMNLhgHP/KrXNqeljMYwR6Ge8nyFXInI\nu9Gf+NoRpu1VTOfTSPO1pk2Vfcs4AbuEnsbFzf0z69wtarT5+8mwQ/iZZkGHHgzv\nmQa+Yo76+taDLV7kKHmV\n=buu1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T09:39:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"http