//api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/commits/4db72ebf84593b8081a2b1ece71f2ee87d6eac4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:30:55Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:30:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(store): retry the Mongo connection after a failure (#3)\n\nThe store connected once in its constructor and kept the promise, so one\nfailed connection made every request fail for as long as the instance\nlived. On dev that happened before the network had a NAT, and the instance\nkept answering 500 after it was added. It now connects on first use and\ndrops a failed attempt, so the next request tries again.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2dd0cd43a70782aa077caadf0dbbcec7863a1a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/trees/a2dd0cd43a70782aa077caadf0dbbcec7863a1a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-moonshot-exercise/git/commits/4db72ebf84593b8081a2b1ece71f2ee87d6eac4e","verification":{"payload":"tree a2dd0cd43a70782aa077caadf0dbbcec7863a1a8\nparent 721fcae6b8c410c37d2ce3801301a48d067082e5\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1791106255 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791106255 -0700\n\nfix(store): retry the Mongo connection after a failure (#3)\n\nThe store connected once in its constructor and kept the promise, so one\nfailed connection made every request fail for as long as the instance\nlived. On dev that happened before the network had a NAT, and the instance\nkept answering 500 after it was added. It now connects on first use and\ndrops a failed attempt, so the next request tries again.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>