efas com progresso REAL\n\n- schema: modelo TaskEvent + Task ganha conversationId (db push, nao-destrutivo)\n- service de tarefas: createTask/addEvent/setStatus/getTask/listTasks/cancelTask\n- chat /send cria Task para planos complexos e registra eventos REAIS\n  (agent_start/agent_end/tool_end/validacao) conforme o backend executa\n- rotas GET /api/tasks, GET /api/tasks/:id, POST /api/tasks/:id/cancel\n- frontend: painel de progresso real no chat (TaskPanel) + eventos ao vivo\n- nunca cria progresso ficticio; FK garante integridade; web/dist recompilado","tree":{"sha":"ecdb0ad961cccbc4e331b3f4e53b40646d48f7de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggmaxtest/sempre-com-voce/git/trees/ecdb0ad961cccbc4e331b3f4e53b40646d48f7de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggmaxtest/sempre-com-voce/git/commits/703b190ecdd02971b45f41254750c55539cedb26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/310730?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiro","id":310730,"login":"kiro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDczMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ggmaxtest/sempre-com-voce/commit/703b190ecdd02971b45f41254750c55539cedb26","node_id":"C_kwDOU6uhIdoAKDcwM2IxOTBlY2RkMDI