:"msarwara","node_id":"U_kgDOBztn2Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msarwara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msarwara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msarwara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msarwara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msarwara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msarwara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msarwara/uiserver/commits/0c863000909e596921751a2dd9bbc33d1a749e40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:44:06Z","email":"manmohan.sarwara@gmail.com","name":"msarwara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:44:06Z","email":"manmohan.sarwara@gmail.com","name":"msarwara"},"message":"Add SQLite-backed Configurator, RBAC, and a generic Web API\n\n- Configurator: a built-in page to rename/add/remove resource fields and\n  create/delete whole resources at runtime, via real ALTER/CREATE/DROP\n  TABLE statements so renames migrate data instead of losing it. Select\n  fields get an inline, Enter-delimited options editor, shown only for\n  Select/Checkbox types.\n- Persistence: resource schemas and data move from in-memory maps to\n  SQLite (modernc.org/sqlite), auto-provisioned per resource via the new\n  SQLProvider; MemoryProvider remains for the no-DB/no-persistence case.\n- RBAC: Admin/Editor/User roles (plus any custom role), with per-resource\n  view/create/edit/delete grants and per-user grant/deny overrides on top\n  of the role, managed from a new Users & Permissions wizard.\n- Web API: every resource is also reachable at /api/{resource} as JSON,\n  authenticated by a bearer token independent of the browser session and\n  governed by the same permission grants as the UI, with field metadata\n  and paging in every list response.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7dcbaa