:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:58:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Re-point the IAP negative matrix at the refusals the verifier actually raises (#11)\n\nThe module skipped wherever google-auth was absent, which is every SDK-free gate, so\nnothing had compared its expectations against the adapter in a long time. Run with the\nruntime lockfile installed it was 10 failed, 12 passed -- every failure a stale regex,\nnot a security hole: each cell rejected its assertion, with a more specific reason than\nthe generic \"verification failed\" the test still demanded.\n\nThe replacements are narrower than what they replace. Each cell now names the exact\nrefusal it exists to prove, so a refusal for the wrong reason fails the cell instead of\nsatisfying it: \"declares alg ''none'', which means it is UNSIGNED\" is a different property\nfrom \"unparseable\", and \"missing required claim(s): sub\" is a different property from\n\"missing required claim(s): email\".\n\n22 passed after the change, in all 31 repositories.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"29ef2f5a1b9f571cf2878633c940f4615e41a948","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-centers/git/trees/29ef2f5a1b9f571cf2878633c940f4615e41a948"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-centers/git/commits/40bc1bb6adbc44281f60196a4af6a07f76bdab57","verification":{"payload":"tree 29ef2f5a1b9f571cf2878633c940f4615e41a948\nparent 5870b6a2afc76f9717c98bf4383f5c3cec8a0452\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787644684 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787644684 +0800\n\nRe-point the IAP negative matrix at the refusals the verifier actually raises (#11)\n\nThe module skipped wherever google-auth was absent, which is every SDK-free gate, so\nnothing had compared its expectations against the adapter in a long time. Run with the\nruntime lockfile installed it was 10 failed, 12 passed -- every failure a stale regex,\nnot a security hole: each cell rejected its assertion, with a more specific reason than\nthe generic \"verification failed\" the test still demanded.\n\nThe replacements are narrower than what they replace. Each cell now names the exact\nrefusal it exists to prove, so a refusal for the wrong reason fails the cell instead of\nsatisfying it: \"declares alg ''none'', which means it is UNSIGNED\" is a different property\nfrom \"unparseable\", and \"missing required claim(s): sub\" is a different property from\n\"missing required claim(s): email\".\n\n22 passed after the change, in all 31 repositories.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjUsMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgBUQADQRuFvQfgxOD5u5IqMMktje\nBzv7GNYYYqpYJD2a6TymlLofE4btJFkiLpTaajGovZfqRE9sxsuuqm85PvY5ITBq\n0c5gJL0/lvsE/1MJ0dA77cbrFNYlqy9KS43nwENu7DmGUIt1ezI6nCZPvQNh8zu8\ni1CitoJkOaVWcxMgw7In9TqAiyjaSjgT0ik5kSkT+DI188Ocn8rGPooHl5IPx0fl\noPoM8Cq9xRWwB5br56tHRSlb9ogmXsug2kXUDKiPi77CN6jozCxbECZWzJKzp9cp\nZUzYogIehGG3ZAAwsG5F/VvqYpLBbNIp7Y7kk3Nv48SPI8+8q/JQiaRCPTuQ4Zhh\nZK2+pwfjngy7KLLA2CeC8kiirMtnwSSXztcJYtuwSAuCHv1N/At7xRW/fDxxBNIL\nbIZ1/p+DSy2CmOlTO1fgEiFxiVL/KixHSW6BLyEWHUfhos+kSNporv+hQubzxkTb\n3r4vY9paW8KvsP2t7493KYokWsg39g0I+Q+KeLDg9PJF31ydrxEVmIWblyYy7vCk\ngdWhnwk5gRIaCP9CkvwjULUHgkUHbDBpxMg5ETXMXjLI29Lj6UUd5Mx++yzX17Tx\nUPm39H2Knx57kwF62gHmBGrZ4QwEHhv+fm4rF4yvKfqlm66yHrvqnyLV27YYpPyT\nM+F2tCHBGhZAyJ/wJlM6\n=uOdd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T08:00:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_