kmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"message":"feat(production): harden security, dynamicize paths, align deployment manifests, and prune non-production artifacts\n\n- Enforce cryptographic JWT role verification and remove development bypasses in deps_auth.py\n- Remove hardcoded default admin credentials, requiring ADMIN_INITIAL_PASSWORD in production\n- Default biometric face recognition to disabled via SECOPS_BIOMETRIC_ENABLED\n- Convert all hardcoded absolute Windows paths in model registry to dynamic relative paths\n- Fix camera watchdog null heartbeat queries, bounded cache capacity, and WebSocket shutdown\n- Align Dockerfile.frontend and nginx.conf with Next.js 16 SSR architecture\n- Prune offline training modules, redundant model checkpoints, and exclude test folders from production git tracking","tree":{"sha":"5718d78a16271cb434ea81cb52209cde8d0fc2c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/trees/5718d78a16271cb434ea81cb52209cde8d0fc2c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/commits/251b16db6af191ae16223fced9d1fe1f870e35be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/251b16db6af191ae16223fced9d1fe1f870e35be","node_id":"C_kwDOU7IS4NoAKDI1MWIxNmRiNmFmMTkxYWUxNjIyM2ZjZWQ5ZDFmZTFmODcwZTM1YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/01ee07487606a9b4f36ea89ca2dd23b25831faa2","sha":"01ee07487606a9b4f36ea89ca2dd23b25831faa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/01ee07487606a9b4f36ea89ca2dd23b25831faa2"}],"sha":"251b16db6af191ae16223fced9d1fe1f870e35be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/251b16db6af191ae16223fced9d1fe1f870e35be"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commi