s\n- Implement distributed Redis Pub/Sub multi-pod fanout with local resilience fallback\n- Replace fictitious WebRTC stream URL with authentic RTSP stream URL\n- Add 100% passing test suites for zero-fake policy and phase-2 configuration","tree":{"sha":"52a2c9249210f993a7930a7017159cb0b636212c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/trees/52a2c9249210f993a7930a7017159cb0b636212c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/commits/b211a08c5769ef1f983d1768078510b2a303b912","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/b211a08c5769ef1f983d1768078510b2a303b912","node_id":"C_kwDOU7IS4NoAKGIyMTFhMDhjNTc2OWVmMWY5ODNkMTc2ODA3ODUxMGIyYTMwM2I5MTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/ed0d995e2f32b366ff01a9af07c74d60c7c4d43b","sha":"ed0d995e2f32b366ff01a9af07c74d60c7c4d43b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/ed0d995e2f32b366ff01a9af07c74d60c7c4d43b"}],"sha":"b211a08c5769ef1f983d1768078510b2a303b912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/b211a08c5769ef1f983d1768078510b2a303b912"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/ed0d995e2f32b366ff01a9af07c74d60c7c4d43b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:54:13Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:54:13Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"message":"fix(security, cache, config): resolve cache import, make admin seed env-configurable, clean dead scaffold, remove hardcoded console URLs","tree":{"sha":"0c3ccf8d73db2627a5ac34f6352e274ebd51995a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/trees/0c