e":"2026-10-03T18:36:50Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"message":"feat(ml): Upgrade CV Engine to ByteTrack Tracking\n- Implemented lightweight ByteTrack (IoU + Hungarian Matching).\n- Solved BUG-0004: Occlusion Defect by persisting track_ids across frames.\n- Replaced stateless track sequence generation with temporal tracker instances.","tree":{"sha":"806275b7200fffd4ad926ad5c021044bcb55acc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/trees/806275b7200fffd4ad926ad5c021044bcb55acc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/commits/2bfd116b14c35a3e28222fbbf4c8693fbecb19ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/2bfd116b14c35a3e28222fbbf4c8693fbecb19ad","node_id":"C_kwDOU7IS4NoAKDJiZmQxMTZiMTRjMzVhM2UyODIyMmZiYmY0Yzg2OTNmYmVjYjE5YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/cfa7a18eaf903b9b9b5db4c716962ff4ec54be80","sha":"cfa7a18eaf903b9b9b5db4c716962ff4ec54be80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/cfa7a18eaf903b9b9b5db4c716962ff4ec54be80"}],"sha":"2bfd116b14c35a3e28222fbbf4c8693fbecb19ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/2bfd116b14c35a3e28222fbbf4c8693fbecb19ad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/cfa7a18eaf903b9b9b5db4c716962ff4ec54be80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:26:18Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:26:18Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"message":"feat(enterprise): V8 100% production readiness upgrade\n\n- Destroyed legacy retail-exit-console prototype (React/Vite).\n- Bootstrapped fully modern retail-exit-nextjs application (App Router, Tailwind).\n- Removed raw SQLite init logic, instantiated Postgres integration.\n- Configured dynamic .env loading and removed all hardcoded configuration.\n- Implemented core JWT authentication layer & RBAC across critical APIs.\n- Configured backend Dockerfile and docker-compose.yml for orchestration.\n- Scaffolded comprehensive Pytest suite and confirmed 100% passing.\n- Restructured README and deleted obsolete prototype code.","tree":{"sha":"bb61e16d28e1084899bd285b89f82326255bdfd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/trees/bb61e16d28e1084899bd285b89f82326255bdfd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/commits/cfa7a18eaf903b9b9b5db4c716962ff4ec54be80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/cfa7a18eaf903b9b9b5db4c716962ff4ec54be80","node_id":"C_kwDOU7IS4NoAKGNmYTdhMThlYWY5MDNiOWI5YjVkYjRjNzE2OTYyZmY0ZWM1NGJlODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/5c0877fd21cae3ec2415d37a2b8ea5ab78feb92c","sha":"5c0877fd21cae3ec2415d37a2b8ea5ab78feb92c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/5c0877fd21cae3ec2415d37a2b8ea5ab78feb92c"}],"sha":"cfa7a18eaf903b9b9b5db4c716962ff4ec54be80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/cfa7a18eaf903b9b9b5db4c716962ff4ec54be80"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/5c0877fd21cae3ec2415d37a2b8ea5ab78feb92c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:19:49Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:20:00Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"message":"docs: Add Mermaid diagra