"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/88f8effe1365ee690719edd289bcc6cef32d85f0","node_id":"C_kwDOU7IS4NoAKDg4ZjhlZmZlMTM2NWVlNjkwNzE5ZWRkMjg5YmNjNmNlZjMyZDg1ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/64df144db6020bf1688ccf40d02b4cf94899988e","sha":"64df144db6020bf1688ccf40d02b4cf94899988e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/64df144db6020bf1688ccf40d02b4cf94899988e"}],"sha":"88f8effe1365ee690719edd289bcc6cef32d85f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/88f8effe1365ee690719edd289bcc6cef32d85f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/64df144db6020bf1688ccf40d02b4cf94899988e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:41:56Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:41:56Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"message":"feat(v8): Enterprise VMS Hikvision-Parity Upgrade (Phase 1 to 12)\n\nThis commit enforces the massive V8 Architectural upgrade without\nbreaking V7 legacy behaviors (290/290 tests passing).\n\nPhase 1/2: Generated 20 mandated V8 Audit Governance documents into docs/v8_audit.\nPhase 3: Codebase Surgery. Extracted ML training/dataset prep from the production\nruntime src/ API directory to a top-level /ml folder.\nPhase 5: Granular Camera Diagnostics (FPS drop, packet loss, codec mismatches).\nPhase 8: Smart Wall engine (1/4/9 grid layout configuration APIs).\nPhase 9/12: Unified Forensic Search (Re-ID embeddings + structured SQL), plus\nEvidence chain-of-custody tracking with cryptographic hashing.\nPhase 10: Integrations API for ANPR (Vehicle plates) and Access Control (Doors).\nPhase 12: OpenTelemetry/Prometheus metrics instrumentation.","tree":{"sha":"7d31d25b558289b3c0323fb4cf774a70b1cd5fbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/trees/7d31d25b558289b3c0323fb4cf774a70b1cd5fbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/commits/64df144db6020bf1688ccf40d02b4cf94899988e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/64df144db6020bf1688ccf40d02b4cf94899988e","node_id":"C_kwDOU7IS4NoAKDY0ZGYxNDRkYjYwMjBiZjE2ODhjY2Y0MGQwMmI0Y2Y5NDg5OTk4OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/67201962e9b08e1a230b9c5fa0f301821112daaf","sha":"67201962e9b08e1a230b9c5fa0f301821112daaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/67201962e9b08e1a230b9c5fa0f301821112daaf"}],"sha":"64df144db6020bf1688ccf40d02b4cf94899988e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/64df144db6020bf1688ccf40d02b4cf94899988e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commits/67201962e9b08e1a230b9c5fa0f301821112daaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:10:08Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:10:08Z","email":"kunalpramanikmindstar@gmail.com","name":"Kunal Pramanik"},"message":"feat(v7): H.265 codec checkpoint, dense shelf NMS config, over-carry identity gate, and V7 verification tests\n\nPart AA.4 - stream_manager.py: After successfully opening an RTSP capture,\ninspect CAP_PROP_FOURCC for H.265/HEVC (HEVC, H265, HVC1, HEV1, X265).\nEmit a WARNING-level log with a prescriptive MediaMTX transcoding advisory\nbecause MediaMTX WebRTC only supports H.264/VP8/VP9/AV1.\n\nPart AA.4 - cameras.py: In the DECODE_FAILED diagnostic path for RTSP test\nconnections, perform the same FOURCC inspection and embed the H.265 codec\nalert directly in the error_message returned to the frontend operator.\n\nPart Y - scene_object_detector.py: Expose DENSE_SHELF_NMS_IOU_THRESHOLD=0.45\nand STANDARD_NMS_IOU_THRESHOLD=0.35 as explicit class constants on\nSceneObjectDetector, matching the system architecture specification and\nmaking the values discoverable without hunting through call sites.\n\nPart Z - dispatch_engine.py: Apply zero-exception identity confidence gate\nto over-carry and dispatch discrepancy alerts. carrier_employee_id values\nof '''', ''UNKNOWN_PERSON'', ''UNKNOWN'', or ''UNVERIFIED'' are anonymised to\nUNKNOWN_PERSON in the alert resolution_note. Non-sentinel values (set via\nthe verified biometric path only) pass through unchanged.\n\nPart X - codebase scan confirmed: the 0.65 cosine floor is correctly\nenforced across journey_engine.py (line 72), tripwire_engine.py (lines\n208, 211), and camera_worker.py (lines 1262, 1310, 1375). No silent\nbypasses found in Parts T, U, or W modules.\n\ntests/test_v7_verification.py: 23 new tests (23/23 passing green):\n  4 Part-Y NMS threshold config tests\n  3 Part-Z bookshelf-as-fixture non-suppression tests\n  5 Part-Z over-carry identity gate logic tests\n  11 Part-AA.4 H.265 FOURCC detection tests\n\nFull suite: 290/290 passed (0 regressions).","tree":{"sha":"840a9486d47dfe55d8d07ea49ffb2b5d3a21c54c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/trees/840a9486d47dfe55d8d07ea49ffb2b5d3a21c54c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/git/commits/67201962e9b08e1a230b9c5fa0f301821112daaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/67201962e9b08e1a230b9c5fa0f301821112daaf","node_id":"C_kwDOU7IS4NoAKDY3MjAxOTYyZTliMDhlMWEyMzBiOWM1ZmEwZjMwMTgyMTExMmRhYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KunalPramanik/RETAIL_MONITORING/commit/e33a417203ae57150f0f5ffc2cc7