 close the chain; verdict colours locked in embeds\n\nReview must-fix 3 and 4 from the app builder review.\n\n- GitHub (pull_request_review, merged pull_request; HMAC-verified) and GitLab\n  (approved/unapproved/merge; token-verified) webhooks, plus POST /approvals\n- PRs link to their session through an ''agent-authority-session:'' marker\n  (SDK: handle.pr_marker); approvals become ''approval'' runs under the session\n  and join its integrity chain\n- Chain of authority for side-effecting tools now ends at the human approver;\n  review-required changes without approval are flagged\n- Policy denials read as Review (the guardrail worked), not Unaccountable\n- Two-layer tokens (ui/src/tokens.css): brand tokens the host may override,\n  meaning tokens re-declared inside the shadow root so hosts can''t recolour\n  verdicts; light-theme meaning colours raised to WCAG AA 4.5:1\n- Audit record: approver shown per action, de-duplicated data touched\n- Docs: integration guide (webhooks, OIDC, anchors, tokens), README, roadmap\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwwfjriKzDyZE7WmkscXQc","tree":{"sha":"f8c8b6737c71ac3bf49bd221c6bdbd75b4be7cc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swar00pduthks/agent-authority/git/trees/f8c8b6737c71ac3bf49bd221c6bdbd75b4be7cc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swar00pduthks/agent-authority/git/commits/a1f77dc0d1be107aafef9fc4b63dfc0abc646cd3","verification":{"payload":"tree f8c8b6737c71ac3bf49bd221c6bdbd75b4be7cc5\nparent aaac7281f31e16b3f6dfd8b7c1f37bf35d73d6be\nauthor Swaroop <swaroopduthks@gmail.com> 1791128283 +0100\ncommitter Swaroop <swaroopduthks@gmail.com> 1791128283 +0100\n\nfeat: human approvals close the chain; verdict colours locked in embeds\n\nReview must-fix 3 and 4 from the app builder review.\n\n- GitHub (pull_request_review, merged pull_request; HMAC-verified) and GitLab\n  (approved/unapproved/merge; token-verified) webhooks, plus POST /approvals\n- PRs link to their session through an ''agent-authority-session:'' marker\n  (SDK: handle.pr_marker); approvals become ''approval'' runs under the session\n  and join its integrity chain\n- Chain of authority for side-effecting tools now ends at the human approver;\n  review-required changes without approval are flagged\n- Policy denials read as Review (the guardrail worked), not Unaccountable\n- Two-layer tokens (ui/src/tokens.css): brand tokens the host may override,\n  meaning tokens re-declared inside the shadow root so hosts can''t recolour\n  verdicts; light-theme meaning colours raised to WCAG AA 4.5:1\n- Audit record: approver shown per action, de-duplicated data touched\n- Docs: integration guide (webhooks, OIDC, anchors, tokens), README, roadmap\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwwfjriKzDyZE7WmkscXQc\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPD5c1eJ\nRJZ/37ntAJgxnwyYcyJtYrzOhFalWNzIXBgGgTXczqPF9yWS0LK8sWEMyf6WlZU2/IdFnp8WmhET\ngA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37598817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swar00pduthks/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swar00pduthks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swar00pduthks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swar00pduthks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/swar00pduthks","id":37598817,"login":"swar00pduthks","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTk4ODE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swar00pduthks/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swar00pduthks/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swar00pduthks/