rity/commits/aaac7281f31e16b3f6dfd8b7c1f37bf35d73d6be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:29:56Z","email":"swaroopduthks@gmail.com","name":"Swaroop"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:29:56Z","email":"swaroopduthks@gmail.com","name":"Swaroop"},"message":"feat(security): OIDC/Entra auth and tamper-evident audit record\n\nReview must-fix 1 and 2 from the app builder review.\n\n- OIDC bearer-token validation (JWKS discovery, issuer, audience, expiry,\n  optional app roles for read and ingest); static API key still accepted\n  for emitters that can''t get tokens; health stays public; /me endpoint\n- Embed retries once after a 401 and emits agent-authority:token-expired\n- Per-session SHA-256 hash chain over every stored event, with facet and\n  payload blobs checked against their content addresses\n- Chain heads anchored after each flush to a sink the database operator\n  can''t rewrite: append-only files on WORM storage, or an Azure append\n  blob in an immutable container (experimental)\n- /sessions/{id}/integrity detects edits, rewritten chains (via the\n  anchor), truncation and altered blobs; Record intact badge on the\n  Audit record screen\n- Kafka seeding keyed by session root so one collector owns each chain\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwwfjriKzDyZE7WmkscXQc","tree":{"sha":"b3cfc8027486ec447e6ddb4f82663aa0e5862eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swar00pduthks/agent-authority/git/trees/b3cfc8027486ec447e6ddb4f82663aa0e5862eb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swar00pduthks/agent-authority/git/commits/aaac7281f31e16b3f6dfd8b7c1f37bf35d73d6be","verification":{"payload":"tree b3cfc8027486ec447e6ddb4f82663aa0e5862eb1\nparent e512f995113596513bd92393f92ddcdfc00b5b94\nauthor Swaroop <swaroopduthks@gmail.com> 1791127796 +0100\ncommitter Swaroop <swaroopduthks@gmail.com> 1791127796 +0100\n\nfeat(security): OIDC/Entra auth and tamper-evident audit 