ive to the board''s\n\nsay.sh --volume -20 / +10 and POST /keryx/say {\"volume_delta\": n}, as set_volume.sh takes +n / -n.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2126af282256aee60a4aa2dd6f61b3baeec57766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/trees/2126af282256aee60a4aa2dd6f61b3baeec57766"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/commits/874196ec21483e48a230e109fefa606133f203dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/874196ec21483e48a230e109fefa606133f203dd","node_id":"C_kwDOU7erIdoAKDg3NDE5NmVjMjE0ODNlNDhhMjMwZTEwOWZlZmE2MDYxMzNmMjAzZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/aaa59ea8a7bd71fddc2f0abda98dfb5a75c3ba8f","sha":"aaa59ea8a7bd71fddc2f0abda98dfb5a75c3ba8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/aaa59ea8a7bd71fddc2f0abda98dfb5a75c3ba8f"}],"sha":"874196ec21483e48a230e109fefa606133f203dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/874196ec21483e48a230e109fefa606133f203dd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/aaa59ea8a7bd71fddc2f0abda98dfb5a75c3ba8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:44:47Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:44:47Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"message":"✨ Let say speak at a volume of its own, for Hermes at night\n\nsay.sh --volume N, keryx-bridge say --volume N and POST /keryx/say {\"volume\": N}: below the board''s volume the\nbridge turns the speech down itself, so the board''s volume and ring stay as they are; above it the board''s volume\ngoes up for the phrase and back. Hermes is told to use a low one at night or when asked to be quiet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"efee9e0932197b6c41cc9edc71b833bcffa50e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/trees/efee9e0932197b6c41cc9edc71b833bcffa50e95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/commits/aaa59ea8a7bd71fddc2f0abda98dfb5a75c3ba8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/aaa59ea8a7bd71fddc2f0abda98dfb5a75c3ba8f","node_id":"C_kwDOU7erIdoAKGFhYTU5ZWE4YTdiZDcxZmRkYzJmMGFiZGE5OGRmYjVhNzVjM2JhOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/6586909bebb0521ea00921be79659c42f5414c2a","sha":"6586909bebb0521ea00921be79659c42f5414c2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/6586909bebb0521ea00921be79659c42f5414c2a"}],"sha":"aaa59ea8a7bd71fddc2f0abda98dfb5a75c3ba8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/aaa59ea8a7bd71fddc2f0abda98dfb5a75c3ba8f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/6586909bebb0521ea00921be79659c42f5414c2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:44:47Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:44:47Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"message":"🥅 Show how the last update went in `ota`\n\nAn update''s lines went to the serial port only, so over Wi-Fi a failed `ota update` left no trace; `ota` now shows\nthe last result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2fef09feb06b563f0a411888d0fae6c816c023c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/trees/a2fef09feb06b563f0a411888d0fae6c816c023c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/commits/6586909bebb0521ea00921be79659c42f5414c2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/6586909bebb0521ea00921be79659c42f5414c2a","node_id":"C_kwDOU7erIdoAKDY1ODY5MDliZWJiMDUyMWVhMDA5MjFiZTc5NjU5YzQyZjU0MTRjMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/f1c94246d871dc846508008be043744e8dbccdb7","sha":"f1c94246d871dc846508008be043744e8dbccdb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/f1c94246d871dc846508008be043744e8dbccdb7"}],"sha":"6586909bebb0521ea00921be79659c42f5414c2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/6586909bebb0521ea00921be79659c42f5414c2a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/f1c94246d871dc846508008be043744e8dbccdb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:34:03Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:34:03Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"message":"📦 Release 975d330\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28b015bf3a675f61569f292cae07b443c77f7333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/trees/28b015bf3a675f61569f292cae07b443c77f7333"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/commits/f1c94246d871dc846508008be043744e8dbccdb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/f1c94246d871dc846508008be043744e8dbccdb7","node_id":"C_kwDOU7erIdoAKGYxYzk0MjQ2ZDg3MWRjODQ2NTA4MDA4YmUwNDM3NDRlOGRiY2NkYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/975d330e82c5aba92a91c3bf9bd3312df40aeb91","sha":"975d330e82c5aba92a91c3bf9bd3312df40aeb91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/975d330e82c5aba92a91c3bf9bd3312df40aeb91"}],"sha":"f1c94246d871dc846508008be043744e8dbccdb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/f1c94246d871dc846508008be043744e8dbccdb7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/975d330e82c5aba92a91c3bf9bd3312df40aeb91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:31:11Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:31:11Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"message":"💄 Clock marks amber by day, yellow at night\n\nBy day the yellow marks looked green: amber (R 12 G 6 at 10 %). At a night''s 2 % the eye takes R 2 G 1 for red, the\nsame as the marks of mute: yellow there (R 2 G 2).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b47fa97794fa7b2bfb82bd0133910484b7f25288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/trees/b47fa97794fa7b2bfb82bd0133910484b7f25288"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/commits/975d330e82c5aba92a91c3bf9bd3312df40aeb91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/975d330e82c5aba92a91c3bf9bd3312df40aeb91","node_id":"C_kwDOU7erIdoAKDk3NWQzMzBlODJjNWFiYTkyYTkxYzNiZjliZDMzMTJkZjQwYWViOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/ab37e1112bdb30f527ca246626a0d3976e273deb","sha":"ab37e1112bdb30f527ca246626a0d3976e273deb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/ab37e1112bdb30f527ca246626a0d3976e273deb"}],"sha":"975d330e82c5aba92a91c3bf9bd3312df40aeb91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/975d330e82c5aba92a91c3bf9bd3312df40aeb91"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/ab37e1112bdb30f527ca246626a0d3976e273deb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:23:37Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:23:37Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"message":"💄 Clock: yellow marks, hands over them, dimmer hands\n\nThe amber marks and the red ones of mute looked the same at a night''s 2 %: green rounded to 0. The marks are yellow\nnow, a colour''s weak share never rounds below 1, the hands cover the marks (the minute hand the hour hand) instead\nof mixing with them, and the hands are dimmer: G 4 / B 4 G 1 at 2 %, five times that at 10 %.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fed05fbf6959532d81e5dec5136d82f441dc1d10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/trees/fed05fbf6959532d81e5dec5136d82f441dc1d10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/commits/ab37e1112bdb30f527ca246626a0d3976e273deb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/ab37e1112bdb30f527ca246626a0d3976e273deb","node_id":"C_kwDOU7erIdoAKGFiMzdlMTExMmJkYjMwZjUyN2NhMjQ2NjI2YTBkMzk3NmUyNzNkZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Flopsstuff/keryx/commit/e70e5090d97e8c1e488f49909cabd55d0960ef7e","sha":"e70e5090d97e8c1e488f49909cabd55d0960ef7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/e70e5090d97e8c1e488f49909cabd55d0960ef7e"}],"sha":"ab37e1112bdb30f527ca246626a0d3976e273deb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/ab37e1112bdb30f527ca246626a0d3976e273deb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/commits/e70e5090d97e8c1e488f49909cabd55d0960ef7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:54:13Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:54:13Z","email":"flopspm@gmail.com","name":"FlopBut"},"message":"🔧 Add watch_board.sh: USB, ping and bridge, once a second\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ee17fe80bf9b1e30fffd1fdb068f825bfd93a13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flopsstuff/keryx/git/trees/7ee17fe80bf9b1e30fffd1fdb068f825bfd93a13"},"url":"https:/