l/npwd/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0194uzGX1B7xskZNNBGC7SS1","tree":{"sha":"ea2ea859165721d53ea07a0279a8c96c262ad406","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/trees/ea2ea859165721d53ea07a0279a8c96c262ad406"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/commits/fb714e3735a4b58519595a18f722bb89efe964b6","verification":{"payload":"tree ea2ea859165721d53ea07a0279a8c96c262ad406\nparent 296c8bf692936f635683abc09a447183de8409c5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791399239 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791399239 +0000\n\nfix(npwd): build ESM via Vite vers html/npwd/ avec listing explicite\n\n- Build Module Federation via @originjs/vite-plugin-federation (ESM)\n  au lieu de webpack (UMD) pour compatibilité avec @module-federation/runtime\n  de NPWD 3.15 (qui utilise from: \"vite\" → dynamic import())\n- Sortie dans html/npwd/ (plat, sans hash) au lieu de npwd_app/dist/assets/\n  car FiveM sert fiablement les fichiers du dossier html/\n- fxmanifest.lua : liste explicite des 12 fichiers html/npwd/\n- vite.config.ts : outDir ../html/npwd, assetsDir '''', base https://agenda/html/npwd/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0194uzGX1B7xskZNNBGC7SS1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNFaYAWe\nspQFHQM+0YdinBlPBUCQS6I5+eHrEqbt7CGOmk8NchKzpPqztk7tRInT+vaDSF4Gr2rDI23tFPR1\n6g4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T18:54:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us