er}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/commits/296c8bf692936f635683abc09a447183de8409c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:42:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:42:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(npwd_app): rebuild avec Vite + @originjs/vite-plugin-federation (ESM)\n\nNPWD 3.15 utilise @module-federation/runtime avec from:''vite'' qui fait\nun import() ESM. Le bundle webpack UMD (var agenda = ...) était incompatible.\n\n- vite.config.ts : Vite + @originjs/vite-plugin-federation, expose ./config\n- dist/ remplacé : tous les chunks webpack supprimés, nouveau dist/assets/\n- fxmanifest.lua : ''npwd_app/dist/assets/*'' pour servir les fichiers ESM\n- remoteEntry.js est maintenant un vrai ES module (export { get, init })\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0194uzGX1B7xskZNNBGC7SS1","tree":{"sha":"f180d361474167396e7524dab19a7530891a7f7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/trees/f180d361474167396e7524dab19a7530891a7f7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/commits/296c8bf692936f635683abc09a447183de8409c5","verification":{"payload":"tree f180d361474167396e7524dab19a7530891a7f7d\nparent f6087bc9b9075d9ea63be808e993deb004007262\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791398578 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791398578 +0000\n\nfix(npwd_app): rebuild avec Vite + @originjs/vite-plugin-federation (ESM)\n\nNPWD 3.15 utilise @module-federation/runtime avec from:''vite'' qui fait\nun import() ESM. Le bundle webpack UMD (var agenda = ...) était incompatible.\n\n- vite.config.ts : Vite + @originjs/vite-plugin-federation, expose ./config\