"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/commits/523594edc4ed69a688921a441e1833db3df80270/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:13:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:13:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: audit pass — bugs, sécurité et redesign Doctolib agenda\n\nAgenda (DA Doctolib):\n- Refonte complète HTML/CSS/JS avec Inter, tokens design, cards Doctolib\n- Booking atomique : UPDATE WHERE status=''free'' supprime la race condition TOCTOU\n- reminded table : purge auto des entrées > 2h pour éviter la fuite mémoire\n- Suppression double notification ESX+NPWD dans Framework.Notify\n\nnova_medical/server:\n- MonitoredPatients déclaré au top (avant esx:playerDropped) au lieu de ligne 655\n- requestPatientData : vérification job EMS avant de renvoyer les données patient\n- addInjury export : ne plus passer par TriggerEvent (source=0) — applique l''injury directement avec le src correct\n- startCarry / stopCarry / loadPatient / unloadPatient : auth EMS requise\n- debugInjure : suppression TriggerEvent mort sans arguments\n\nnova_medical/client:\n- enterDead / revived : nil-check sur myMedical avant accès .state\n- examSession : devient global (retiré ''local'') pour être visible par monitoring.lua\n- Thread anim : Wait(0) remplacé par Wait(50) quand pendingAnim est nil\n- startExam : guard examInProgress pour empêcher les exams concurrents\n- temp eval : ordre corrigé — disease modifier appliqué avant le calcul de l''évaluation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0194uzGX1B7xskZNNBGC7SS1","tree":{"sha":"d33edaf4c423df4f60335770a338e2697f40f8ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/trees/d33edaf4c423df4f60335770a338e2697f40f8ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/commits/523594edc4ed69a688921a441e1833db3df80270","verification":{"payload":"tree d33edaf4c423df4f60335770a338e2697f40f8ab\nparent 761b90f6f390fa5d3f9f521063b33f0537fd79e6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791382401 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791382401 +0000\n\nfix: audit pass — bugs, sécurité et redesign Doctolib agenda\n\nAgenda (DA Doctolib):\n- Refonte complète HTML/CSS/JS avec Inter, tokens design, cards Doctolib\n- Booking atomique : UPDATE WHERE status=''free'' supprime la race condition TOCTOU\n- reminded table : purge auto des entrées > 2h pour éviter la fuite mémoire\n- Suppression double notification ESX+NPWD dans Framework.Notify\n\nnova_medical/server:\n- MonitoredPatients déclaré au top (avant esx:playerDropped) au lieu de ligne 655\n- requestPatientData : vérification job EMS avant de renvoyer les données patient\n- addInjury export : ne plus passer par TriggerEvent (source=0) — applique l''injury directement avec le src correct\n- startCarry / stopCarry / loadPatient / unloadPatient : auth EMS requise\n- debugInjure : suppression TriggerEvent mort sans arguments\n\nnova_medical/client:\n- enterDead / revived : nil-check sur myMedical avant accès .state\n- examSession : devient global (retiré ''local'') pour être visible par monitoring.lua\n- Thread anim : Wait(0) remplacé par Wait(50) quand pendingAnim est nil\n- startExam : guard examInProgress pour empêcher les exams concurrents\n- temp eval : ordre corrigé — disease modifier appliqué avant le calcul de l''évaluation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0194uzGX1B7xskZNNBGC7SS1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHqSOKfK\nGBk3fJo2U+zTjuSb5f5/0gUeII/h+lPIK3CJjLN2i53as6fotF9/1QEll9WY6cGjkRaAgESX6vbh\ngAE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T14:13:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ariion/Script-EMS/commit/523594edc4ed69a688921a441e1833db3df80270","node_id":"C_kwDOU7k3gNoAKDUyMzU5NGVkYzRlZDY5YTY4ODkyMWE0NDFlMTgzM2RiM2RmODAyNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ariion/Script-EMS/commit/761b90f6f390fa5d3f9f521063b33f0537fd79e6","sha":"761b90f6f390fa5d3f9f521063b33f0537fd79e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/commits/761b90f6f390fa5d3f9f521063b33f0537fd79e6"}],"sha":"523594edc4ed69a688921a441e1833db3df80270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/commits/523594edc4ed69a688921a441e1833db3df80270"},{"autho