ummary overlay with star rating after all ops complete\n\nDiagnostic:\n- 2 new scenarios: cardiac (bpm 42, STEMI) + overdose (bpm 38, airway crisis)\n- Web Audio SND — ECG beep on each QRS, double-beep alert on critical values\n- Critical alert overlay flashes on bradycardie sévère (< 45 bpm) or SpO₂ < 85%\n\nImagerie:\n- 2 new scenarios: cardiac + overdose with 3 modalities each (xray/ct/echo)\n- ⚡ AUTO button auto-generates a formatted report from current scan findings\n- Sound feedback (3-tone chime) on scan completion\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0194uzGX1B7xskZNNBGC7SS1","tree":{"sha":"8afc573ed8670d279e05e8eb988f17c809374275","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/trees/8afc573ed8670d279e05e8eb988f17c809374275"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/commits/45234c14bf8ff3922b5c13eb30937d3e66509914","verification":{"payload":"tree 8afc573ed8670d279e05e8eb988f17c809374275\nparent 30f720cae2fdd0aede6bc5f94b556444851d2c66\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791326854 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791326854 +0000\n\nfeat: MEGA MAJ — 2 new scenarios, new games, sound, auto-report, post-op summary\n\nChirurgie:\n- 2 new mini-games: intubation (timing) + défibrillation (charge+sync)\n- 2 new scenarios: cardiac (fibrillation ventriculaire) + overdose (dépression respiratoire)\n- Web Audio sound system (SND) — beep on ECG, alert on fail, success fanfare\n- Post-op summary overlay with star rating after all ops complete\n\nDiagnostic:\n- 2 new scenarios: cardiac (bpm 42, STEMI) + overdose (bpm 38, airway crisis)\n- Web Audio SND — ECG beep on each QRS, double-beep alert on critical values\n- Critical alert overlay flashes on bradycardie sévère (< 45 bpm) or SpO₂ < 85%\n\nImagerie:\n- 2 new scenarios: cardiac + overdose with 3 modalities each (xray/ct/echo)\n- ⚡ AUTO button auto-generates a formatted report from current scan finding