h scenario and jump to Chirurgie\n- applyScenario() writes nova_scenario + ariion_scenario to localStorage so\n  any subsequent page picks up the same patient\n- diagnostic debug panel: added → Imagerie shortcut button\n- Results use scenario-specific findings instead of random generation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0194uzGX1B7xskZNNBGC7SS1","tree":{"sha":"2e968218a65b019f96765209ff206f60f0d63048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/trees/2e968218a65b019f96765209ff206f60f0d63048"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/commits/2975321d09dc25b18dc47f2287450f1dd320f73c","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e968218a65b019f96765209ff206f60f0d63048\nparent 4ab0a3dfee7e11a4ec2c1f46eddcc44f9ad3522b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791204774 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791204774 +0000\n\nImagerie: fix layout, add scenarios + cross-module navigation\n\n- Viewer layout: side-by-side body SVG + prep steps (no more overflow)\n- Body SVG constrained to max-height:290px in flex row with steps on right\n- Scenarios: full set matching diagnostic (gunshot/accident/stab/fall/fire/minor)\n  - each scenario carries name/age/état and mode-specific findings (xray/ct/echo)\n  - reads nova_scenario key from localStorage on load, stays in sync with diag\n- Hidden debug panel (⚙ bottom-right) to switch scenario and jump to Chirurgie\n- applyScenario() writes nova_scenario + ariion_scenario to localStorage so\n  any subsequent page picks up the same patient\n- diagnostic debug panel: added → Imagerie shortcut button\n- Results use scenario-specific findings instead of random generation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0194uzGX1B7xskZNNBGC7SS1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1U