arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/commits/205baeae2ff418dc78016fe1e1a7d186efa86c0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:24:23Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:24:23Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add realistic vital signs drift in diagnostic interface\n\nBPM fluctuates ±8 around baseline (simulates HRV) and SpO₂ ±2%\naround baseline — both with a mean-reversion pull so values don''t\ndrift far. Temperature, BP, pain and consciousness stay fixed (they\ndon''t visibly change during a short exam). Drift starts when BPM is\nmeasured, auto-syncs to the monitoring strip if active, stops on\nscenario reset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0194uzGX1B7xskZNNBGC7SS1","tree":{"sha":"a579e69966ecdc1d85963460fa3740d726f9f541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/trees/a579e69966ecdc1d85963460fa3740d726f9f541"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ariion/Script-EMS/git/commits/205baeae2ff418dc78016fe1e1a7d186efa86c0a","verification":{"payload":"tree a579e69966ecdc1d85963460fa3740d726f9f541\nparent 281701e8a62433feb7ec1ebfeeb589b909303a93\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791203063 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791203063 +0000\n\nAdd realistic vital signs drift in diagnostic interface\n\nBPM fluctuates ±8 around baseline (simulates HRV) and SpO₂ ±2%\naround baseline — both with a mean-reversion pull so values don''t\ndrift far. Temperature, BP, pain and consciousness stay fixed (they\ndon''t visibly change during a short exam). Drift starts when BPM is\nmeasured, auto-syncs to the monitoring strip if active, stops on\nscenario reset.\n\nCo-Au