ills\nnames.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: install and import @module-federation/mcp instead of\n@module-federation/federated-skills; subpaths are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"4a254f742f6fb083d594b08957e8224aa619d782","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/trees/4a254f742f6fb083d594b08957e8224aa619d782"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/commits/2d9fe5cf92c45ccb35a912acac7764aee082715a","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a254f742f6fb083d594b08957e8224aa619d782\nparent f5eed25dbc3561aa7b5a9c4293d981f1be7471a7\nauthor Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791181313 +0200\ncommitter Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791181313 +0200\n\nrefactor!: rename the package to @module-federation/mcp\n\nUpdate imports, the raw types reference, docs and examples, and\nrefresh the description: the default server is the official MCP SDK\nnow, not Effect.\n\nThe CLI binary, plugin names (pluginFederatedSkills,\nSkillsProviderPlugin) and log prefixes keep their federated-skills\nnames.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: install and import @module-federation/mcp instead of\n@module-federation/federated-skills; subpaths are unchanged.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQTUZdKnwfE6tfELWufa6WTO8fTsFwUCasNCAhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ2ulkzvH07BfC/QD/dUAEia1n1B+tqNMa01zB\ncgFtuJAenW7Mt/HM1rNENvABAPhNIfCB3PENkjIjw8S+dFrKarBXpxeomcx32NHa\nMc0C\n=LIOC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T06:21:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23436531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt","id":23436531,"login":"Nsttt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM2NTMx","organizations_url":"http