ed-skills/commits/f5eed25dbc3561aa7b5a9c4293d981f1be7471a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:45:24Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:45:24Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"message":"docs(examples): model a company with several teams shipping skills\n\nAcme''s Release Engineering, Billing and Support Tools teams each ship\nskills from their own project, and the Platform team serves them all\nthrough one gateway.\n\n- support: a new Rspack provider (SkillsProviderPlugin) with a refund\n  skill that uses Billing''s quote_price, zod validation with a refine,\n  a destructive tool with an outputSchema, and requestedBy from the\n  tool context.\n- Every skill is namespaced under acme/<team>/ and declares owner,\n  contact and allowed tools in its frontmatter.\n- gateway: a team registry with dev and prod URLs, optional providers,\n  a list_teams tool, an audit log that wraps catalog.callTool, stdio and\n  Streamable HTTP (with origin checks), and a CI check for load\n  failures, name clashes and ownership metadata.\n- demo walks through skills/list, list_teams, skills/get, tool hints,\n  a refund across two teams'' tools, a validation error, and the audit log.","tree":{"sha":"7731078e068c93e8f12099913a7fdc5b70c2225e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/trees/7731078e068c93e8f12099913a7fdc5b70c2225e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/commits/f5eed25dbc3561aa7b5a9c4293d981f1be7471a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 7731078e068c93e8f12099913a7fdc5b70c2225e\nparent d9eeff5c806a084ac5040ed8640a6470e26941eb\nauthor Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791179124 +0200\ncommitter Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791179124 +0200\n\ndocs(examples): model a company with several teams shipping skills\n\nAcme''s Release Engineering, Billing and Support Tools teams each ship\nskills from their own project, and the Platform team serves them all\nthrough one gateway.\n\n- support: a new Rspack provider (SkillsProviderPlugin) with a refund\n  skill that uses Billing''s quote_price, zod validation with a refine,\n  a destructive tool with an outputSchema, and requestedBy from the\n  tool context.\n- Every skill is namespaced under acme/<team>/ and declares owner,\n  contact and allowed tools in its frontmatter.\n- gateway: a team registry with dev and prod URLs, optional providers,\n  a list_teams tool, an audit log that wraps catalog.callTool, stdio and\n  Streamable HTTP (with origin checks), and a CI check for load\n  failures, name clashes and ownership metadata.\n- demo walks through skills/list, list_teams, skills/get, tool hints,\n  a refund across two teams'' tools, a validation error, and the audit log.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQTUZdKnwfE6tfELWufa6WTO8fTsFwUCasM5dBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ2ulkzvH07BfRCQD/QmczemTiUKc8O6IQJmLM\nHruTygg0NK4p++obXaM7f6AA/0Ke/nh2h4rubzyDfTWb395LKg2PjfDFN9eB49DO\njVEH\n=9CUg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T05:45:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23436531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt","id":23436531,"login":"Nsttt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM2NTMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt/federated-skills/commit/f5eed25dbc3561aa7b5a9c4293d981f1be7471a7","node_id":"C_kwDOU7k7NdoAKGY1ZWVkMjVkYmMzNTYxYWE3YjVhOWM0MjkzZDk4MWYxYmU3NDcxYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt/federated-skills/commit/d9eeff5c806a084ac5040ed8640a6470e26941eb","sha":"d9eeff5c806a084ac5040ed8640a6470e26941eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/commits/d9eeff5c806a084ac5040ed8640a6470e26941eb"}],"sha":"f5eed25dbc3561aa7b5a9c4293d981f1be7471a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/commits/f5eed25dbc3561aa7b5a9c4293d981f1be7471a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23436531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt","id":23436531,"login":"Nsttt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM2NTMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/commits/d9eeff5c806a084ac5040ed8640a6470e26941eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:19:34Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:19:34Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"message":"feat!: serve the skills catalog from any MCP server\n\nThe catalog now carries everything a server needs: listTools, callTool\n(argument validation, result conversion, error results) and readResource.\nAdapters register it on a server the user owns:\n\n- ./mcp: registerSkills(server, catalog) for the official MCP SDK\n  (@modelcontextprotocol/server), plus createSkillsServer and the ready-made\n  createSkillsGateway, which the CLI now uses.\n- ./effect: the Effect McpServer gateway and layers, moved from ./server.\n- ./server: loaders, skillsDirectory, loadSkillsCatalog and\n  defaultInstructions, with no MCP SDK or Effect dependency.\n\n./protocol schemas are zod instead of Effect Schema. effect and\n@effect/platform-node become optional peers; @modelcontextprotocol/server\nand zod become dependencies.\n\nBuild with Rslib instead of tsdown, and lint with Rslint. Lint fixes:\npluginFederatedSkills returns the inner plugin''s setup promise, and a\nmalformed URL in the provider middleware goes to the error handler\ninstead of becoming an unhandled rejection.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: createSkillsGateway, createGatewayFromCatalog,\nmakeSkillsGateway, withSkillsExtension and allProtocols moved from\n./server to ./effect (createSkillsGateway also lives in ./mcp). The\n./protocol Effect Schemas (ListSkillsResult, ...) are replaced by zod\nschemas with the same *Schema names.","tree":{"sha":"1cacecc7493fb6f8d65319fc5ac760683d8b6f35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/trees/1cacecc7493fb6f8d65319fc5ac760683d8b6f35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/commits/d9eeff5c806a084ac5040ed8640a6470e26941eb","verification":{"payload":"tree 1cacecc7493fb6f8d65319fc5ac760683d8b6f35\nparent 612fa76732eb77108fe52344a5c6395192477cac\nauthor Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791177574 +0200\ncommitter Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791177574 +0200\n\nfeat!: serve the skills catalog from any MCP server\n\nThe catalog now carries everything a server needs: listTools, callTool\n(argument validation, result conversion, error results) and readResource.\nAdapters register it on a server the user owns:\n\n- ./mcp: registerSkills(server, catalog) for the official MCP SDK\n  (@modelcontextprotocol/server), plus createSkillsServer and the ready-made\n  createSkillsGateway, which the CLI now uses.\n- ./effect: the Effect McpServer gateway and layers, moved from ./server.\n- ./server: loaders, skillsDirectory, loadSkillsCatalog and\n  defaultInstructions, with no MCP SDK or Effect dependency.\n\n./protocol schemas are zod instead of Effect Schema. effect and\n@effect/platform-node become optional peers; @modelcontextprotocol/server\nand zod become dependencies.\n\nBuild with Rslib instead of tsdown, and lint with Rslint. Lint fixes:\npluginFederatedSkills returns the inner plugin''s setup promise, and a\nmalformed URL in the provider middleware goes to the error handler\ninstead of becoming an unhandled rejection.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: createSkillsGateway, createGatewayFromCatalog,\nmakeSkillsGateway, withSkillsExtension and allProtocols moved from\n./server to ./effect (createSkillsGateway also lives in ./mcp). The\n./protocol Effect Schemas (ListSkillsResult, ...) are replaced by zod\nschemas with the same *Schema names.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQTUZdKnwfE6tfELWufa6WTO8fTsFwUCasMzZhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ2ulkzvH07BeLKAEAzZo8nlFHzIgJygh/B5dC\ndsyXrQQzhtS/NoYgVjtEnuABAKOFZSSKK0K0F4l3xbQvy/GtndrKX5uu87jVcFgy\nYioL\n=wVrN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T05:38:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23436531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt","id":23436531,