type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/commits/612fa76732eb77108fe52344a5c6395192477cac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:32:49Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:32:49Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"message":"docs: add runnable examples\n\nexamples/ is a pnpm workspace with two Rsbuild skills providers and a\ngateway:\n\n- releases: a project that only ships skills (SKILL.md with a reference\n  file, an inline skill, two zod tools), built with pluginFederatedSkills.\n- billing: an existing web remote (pluginModuleFederation) that also ships\n  skills from dist/skills/; its tool reuses the UI''s pricing code.\n- gateway: createSkillsGateway over stdio loading both remotes (optional)\n  plus a local skills/ folder, and a demo client that lists, reads and\n  calls through it.\n\nAlso: under a sub-path, the provider''s dev/preview middleware now answers\n404 for a missing file instead of falling through to the app''s HTML\nfallback, which surfaced as \"Unexpected token ''<''\" in the gateway.","tree":{"sha":"62428f66c7302b588749c774def16c9ba86c7b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/trees/62428f66c7302b588749c774def16c9ba86c7b2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/commits/612fa76732eb77108fe52344a5c6395192477cac","verification":{"payload":"tree 62428f66c7302b588749c774def16c9ba86c7b2a\nparent 77fb5cc68bdd6d32059e6e28830944cca1c8eab4\nauthor Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791135169 +0200\ncommitter Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791135169 +0200\n\ndocs: add runnable examples\n\nexamples/ is a pnpm workspace with two Rsbuild skills providers and a\ngateway:\n\n- releases: a project that only ships skills (SKILL.md with a reference\n  file, an inline skill, two zod tools), built with pluginFederatedSkills.\n- billing: an existing web remote (pluginModuleFederation) that also ships\n  skills from dist/skills/; its tool reuses the UI''s pricing code.\n- gateway: createSkillsGateway over stdio loading both remotes (optional)\n  plus a local skills/ folder, and a demo client that lists, reads and\n  calls through it.\n\nAlso: under a sub-path, the provider''s dev/preview middleware now answers\n404 for a missing file instead of falling through to the app''s HTML\nfallback, which surfaced as \"Unexpected token ''<''\" in the gateway.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQTUZdKnwfE6tfELWufa6WTO8fTsFwUCasKNwRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ2ulkzvH07Bc09AEAxaFKvwfYaA08EYlpECNe\n9tdhDiKblW0F3ahHRc1bgasBAOhp5qa/TwzdTR5dISzAl7Zox7BorSRCRgXiTok7\nWY4A\n=AY2e\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T17:35:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23436531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt","id":23436531,"login":"Nsttt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM2NTMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt/federated-skills/commit/612fa76732eb77108fe52344a5c6395192477cac","node_id":"C_kwDOU7k7NdoAKDYxMmZhNzY3MzJlYjc3MTA4ZmU1MjM0NGE1YzYzOTUxOTI0NzdjYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt/federated-skills/commit/77fb5cc68bdd6d32059e6e28830944cca1c8eab4","sha":"77fb5cc68bdd6d32059e6e28830944cca1c8eab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/commits/77fb5cc68bdd6d32059e6e28830944cca1c8eab4"}],"sha":"612fa76732eb77108fe52344a5c6395192477cac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/commits/612fa76732eb77108fe52344a5c6395192477cac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23436531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt","id":23436531,"login":"Nsttt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM2NTMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/commits/77fb5cc68bdd6d32059e6e28830944cca1c8eab4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:51:15Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:51:15Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"message":"feat(rsbuild): build providers on @module-federation/rsbuild-plugin\n\nRsbuild is now the primary way to build a skills provider.\n\n- pluginFederatedSkills adds a Node environment and builds the provider with\n  the official pluginModuleFederation (target: ''node''). On its own the\n  provider is the whole build in dist/. Next to an app or a web remote that\n  build is untouched, the provider goes to dist/<environment>/, and it takes\n  the app''s remote name when `name` is omitted.\n- `rsbuild dev` and `rsbuild preview` serve the provider environment, which\n  Rsbuild''s servers otherwise skip because it targets Node.\n- The gateway resolves a root-relative manifest publicPath (Rsbuild''s default\n  `/`) against the manifest URL instead of producing `https:/...`, so remotes\n  built with pluginModuleFederation and Rsbuild defaults load as-is.\n- ES module remotes fail with an error that explains the\n  --experimental-vm-modules requirement and how to build a CommonJS remote.\n- README leads with Rsbuild; rspack/webpack is the secondary path.\n- Tests cover the standalone plugin, the plugin next to a web remote (build\n  and dev server), the official plugin with Rsbuild defaults, rspack CJS, and\n  ESM remotes with and without vm.SourceTextModule.","tree":{"sha":"80bec9b65c09ea8a9c73cea060f556f0df85f84e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/trees/80bec9b65c09ea8a9c73cea060f556f0df85f84e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/commits/77fb5cc68bdd6d32059e6e28830944cca1c8eab4","verification":{"payload":"tree 80bec9b65c09ea8a9c73cea060f556f0df85f84e\nparent e5e140a15376c050086e73efe403df8cb4c7c9c2\nauthor Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791132675 +0200\ncommitter Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791132675 +0200\n\nfeat(rsbuild): build providers on @module-federation/rsbuild-plugin\n\nRsbuild is now the primary way to build a skills provider.\n\n- pluginFederatedSkills adds a Node environment and builds the provider with\n  the official pluginModuleFederation (target: ''node''). On its own the\n  provider is the whole build in dist/. Next to an app or a web remote that\n  build is untouched, the provider goes to dist/<environment>/, and it takes\n  the app''s remote name when `name` is omitted.\n- `rsbuild dev` and `rsbuild preview` serve the provider environment, which\n  Rsbuild''s servers otherwise skip because it targets Node.\n- The gateway resolves a root-relative manifest publicPath (Rsbuild''s default\n  `/`) against the manifest URL instead of producing `https:/...`, so remotes\n  built with pluginModuleFederation and Rsbuild defaults load as-is.\n- ES module remotes fail with an error that explains the\n  --experimental-vm-modules requirement and how to build a CommonJS remote.\n- README leads with Rsbuild; rspack/webpack is the secondary path.\n- Tests cover the standalone plugin, the plugin next to a web remote (build\n  and dev server), the official plugin with Rsbuild defaults, rspack CJS, and\n  ESM remotes with and without vm.SourceTextModule.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQTUZdKnwfE6tfELWufa6WTO8fTsFwUCasKEAxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ2ulkzvH07BdC4gEAyZ/5rIVN2mMQ0z6e87fP\nJhgcBqyvfyFERpKAWDMKfY0BAJ7wW9fkQrwuqMRwv0IIxisQ8SGxgIoj1KPntAfc\naMQF\n=KiHw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T17:00:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23436531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt","id":23436531,"login":"Nsttt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM2NTMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt/federated-skills/commit/77