e-federation/federated-skills/rsbuild plugin sets CommonJS output,\nan auto asset prefix and the async-node target, and drops the redundant\nentry bundle.\n\nAdds an integration test that builds a provider with Rsbuild and Rspack,\nserves it over HTTP and calls its tool through the gateway.","tree":{"sha":"0ea2703cc2a375fd637ac9f1d1095ef3c0c13bea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/trees/0ea2703cc2a375fd637ac9f1d1095ef3c0c13bea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/commits/e5e140a15376c050086e73efe403df8cb4c7c9c2","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ea2703cc2a375fd637ac9f1d1095ef3c0c13bea\nparent f804c18df4eda6d838d1b8eb2077ef921b530219\nauthor Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791131751 +0200\ncommitter Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791131751 +0200\n\nfeat: add Rsbuild support with pluginFederatedSkills\n\nRsbuild''s defaults (ESM output for Node, ''/'' asset prefix, a required\nentry) produce remotes the gateway can''t load. The new\n@module-federation/federated-skills/rsbuild plugin sets CommonJS output,\nan auto asset prefix and the async-node target, and drops the redundant\nentry bundle.\n\nAdds an integration test that builds a provider with Rsbuild and Rspack,\nserves it over HTTP and calls its tool through the gateway.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQTUZdKnwfE6tfELWufa6WTO8fTsFwUCasKAZxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ2ulkzvH07Bdk4QD/b9yo2faYohVExMvtCFwh\n4F0Na43ackxAKET3kAtdCpoA/0zhJqrMZ1T7na+APU69iTUYjwS3wuNlGm55q0KS\nwYgP\n=aCrw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T17:00:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23436531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/gists{/g