riptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/commits/f804c18df4eda6d838d1b8eb2077ef921b530219/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:57:03Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:57:03Z","email":"nestor@nstlopez.com","name":"Néstor"},"message":"feat!: rename to @module-federation/federated-skills and serve over Effect McpServer\n\n- Package renamed to @module-federation/federated-skills; CLI is now\n  `federated-skills`.\n- The gateway runs on Effect''s McpServer (effect/ai) and serves every MCP\n  revision Effect supports. skills/list and skills/get are added to each\n  protocol adapter; the Skills capability is advertised on 2026-07-28.\n- New transports: toWebHandler(), layerStdio(), layerHttp(), plus\n  gateway.layer / serverOptions / makeSkillsGateway for Effect users.\n- Invalid tool arguments and thrown errors now return isError results.\n- Wire schemas are Effect Schemas, with Standard Schema exports for other\n  clients. Drops @modelcontextprotocol/server and zod as dependencies.\n- Provider authoring (defineSkill/defineTool/defineSkillsProvider) is\n  unchanged and stays free of Effect.","tree":{"sha":"badb7445d52a0a88b62bb2c3a14a472cc0c233ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/trees/badb7445d52a0a88b62bb2c3a14a472cc0c233ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nsttt/federated-skills/git/commits/f804c18df4eda6d838d1b8eb2077ef921b530219","verification":{"payload":"tree badb7445d52a0a88b62bb2c3a14a472cc0c233ca\nparent 7f2fc40f381e1b325bcd86fc0958658d3bd1ca97\nauthor Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791129423 +0200\ncommitter Néstor <nestor@nstlopez.com> 1791129423 +0200\n\nfeat!: rename to @module-federation/federated-skills and serve over Effect McpServer\n\n- Package renamed to @module-federation/federated-skills; CLI is now\n  `federated-skills`.\n- The gateway runs on Effect''s McpServer (effect/ai) and serves every MCP\n  revision Effect supports. skills/list and skills/get are added to each\n  protocol adapter; the Skills capability is advertised on 2026-07-28.\n- New transports: toWebHandler(), layerStdio(), layerHttp(), plus\n  gateway.layer / serverOptions / makeSkillsGateway for Effect users.\n- Invalid tool arguments and thrown errors now return isError results.\n- Wire schemas are Effect Schemas, with Standard Schema exports for other\n  clients. Drops @modelcontextprotocol/server and zod as dependencies.\n- Provider authoring (defineSkill/defineTool/defineSkillsProvider) is\n  unchanged and stays free of Effect.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQTUZdKnwfE6tfELWufa6WTO8fTsFwUCasJ3TxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ2ulkzvH07Bc5XgD/XLhYuPUX35xn0IefWdeh\nnx9gonpHInxq12/GqMPC+EAA/3fBHcpM4zyM6eOEjHZSl7v6QQ4PlE5M4m6Ecgnh\nTrIE\n=uYmn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T17:00:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23436531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nsttt","id":23436531,"login":"Nsttt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM2NTMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nsttt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nstt