ep"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T11:34:21Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T11:34:21Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:56:50.366Z","repositoryId":1405202234,"sha":"f389f705bdc95cb47c6e5159e54b7bcbf9682e35"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T09:41:07Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T09:41:07Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:56:50.366Z","repositoryId":1405202234,"sha":"eb6822b6b09bb34be8fe3babec931af9eaed351f"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T05:56:38Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T05:56:38Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:56:50.366Z","repositoryId":1405202234,"sha":"d3e57da136c44ca05985a4bfcc2f3e2e494c793c"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:56:50.366Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-mfe-admin/commits/175e888d4d534c60d2d7c470a4bb8d87ec8cdf2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:27:41Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep Lodhi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:27:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: the speech models on the admin page - scores, the gold set, evaluations, the default (#5)\n\n## What changes\n\nA Speech models section on /admin:\n- every model with its latest error rates (script and Hinglish word error rate, lower is better) and which one is the default; Make default asks first;\n- Evaluate scores a model on the gold set (disabled until the gold set has a call); the evaluations list follows a running one and opens each to its recordings'' scores;\n- the gold set (add a recording by id, remove) with its size and audio, and the training data people''s corrections have given.\nWeb SDK 0.11.0-rc.1.\n\n## How it was checked\n\npnpm lint, typecheck, build; pnpm test 8 passed, among them: the models with their scores, Evaluate starts an evaluation of the chosen model, Make default changes the default; Evaluate is disabled while the gold set is empty.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3a7b242d32ac363c04ba5323962bfc28f199f03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-mfe-admin/git/trees/e3a7b242d32ac363c04ba5323962bfc28f199f03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-mfe-admin/git/commits/175e888d4d534c60d2d7c470a4bb8d87ec8cdf2b","verification":{"payload":"tree e3a7b242d32ac363c04ba5323962bfc28f199f03\nparent cb52b0d959a23543286c8939df92090ed3a8c6eb\nauthor Sandeep Lodhi <sandeep@softechproducts.com> 1791372461 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791372461 +0530\n\nfeat: the speech models on the admin page - scores, the gold set, evaluations, the default (#5)\n\n## What changes\n\nA Speech models section on /admin:\n- every model with its latest error rates (script and Hinglish word error rate, lower is better) and which one is the default; Make default asks first;\n- Evaluate scores a model on the gold set (disabled until the gold set has a call); the evaluations list follows a running one and opens each to its recordings'' scores;\n- the gold set (add a recording by id, remove) with its size and audio, and the training data people''s corrections have given.\nWeb SDK 0.11.0-rc.1.\n\n## How it was checked\n\npnpm lint, typecheck, build; pnpm test 8 passed, among them: the models with their scores, Evaluate starts an evaluation of the chosen model, Make default changes the default; Evaluate is disabled while the gold set is empty.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxiytCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAmIQAE29DnxbQgF6qYMNspwIHGmy\nLnWV98CiMeOXvxS0IHndPFDY/USyd