ncy (#391)\n\nAdd react-dom 18.x to peerDependencies in the metadata export and reports apps.\n\nThe app shell provides react-dom through module federation, but the\nOpenMRS rspack config only shares the dependencies an app lists in\npeerDependencies. Without react-dom listed there, the app loads the\ncopy of react-dom bundled into its own build instead of the shell''s.","tree":{"sha":"89ce0c9bd13c8b60a5ef57f0186872bba7d58a36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-release-sandbox/git/trees/89ce0c9bd13c8b60a5ef57f0186872bba7d58a36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-release-sandbox/git/commits/e7b618c8853787677ac28a20580d588eb2b1c6c0","verification":{"payload":"tree 89ce0c9bd13c8b60a5ef57f0186872bba7d58a36\nparent 0650119730a5eb0bc35f02f514cdfd0f0204165a\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1790636137 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790636137 -0400\n\n(fix) Declare react-dom as a peer dependency (#391)\n\nAdd react-dom 18.x to peerDependencies in the metadata export and reports apps.\n\nThe app shell provides react-dom through module federation, but the\nOpenMRS rspack config only shares the dependencies an app lists in\npeerDependencies. Without react-dom listed there, the app loads the\ncopy of react-dom bundled into its own build instead of the shell''s.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquvBpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7QAQAAJ8EltnLZ+1AoFlXUsRcKgm\npDUA99fmhQN71UVIxpW/6zIH3AC0VSfJXql62LMNtTQUPk2mVtEsExRT7Renv5Ws\n01WYifUiNGwnDVt16bmd9OvGfEzbR7kLpyAOYBSMyTkfSI2xqJc6ixaNQQYLkdSc\namCJmPcMB/LsCfS6wM6JDAuX0zxMu/bYG8mtfmt77hLMlQ5KJ38d4BfPdvmA1FKd\nPcijaIztIIjgiersYWM9UCa8JRiINbEbo8oFaKby1fHvvbKcfkAOLtFs48VhrPAJ\n53eAJ94+hzTbM6aWL8uUSpFKiPXy/f3u5CbfUXRr01MmZB6g3yV398C//k3dk4By\nz429P5tH8Gf/z3iWzAevgeLxUVV5vwlLGpbthYyb1wsDYg8vXWN4G1Mzkdk42gwR\njycOuCqnENwluINYsXtjEHHruBGCZtT81O3onwBwjuisggkTfSEZTGmuaD4YQNpl\nlYTRczBIJsb+rwtxwYgaLzNfmDqH5jginsUdFBSyBW8gEnsqcbRNJ7ScBpyHK2lX\ndyfO