"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Developerr86","id":138863457,"login":"Developerr86","node_id":"U_kgDOCEbjYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/ca798d580cfdb1be578faa5d4352ac889a116f10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:15:58Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:15:58Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"message":"Fix the restore path and complete the backup drill\n\nThe first real restore drill reported success while restoring nothing. Two\ndefects caused it. The target database was passed both in the connection\nstring and in --nsTo, so mongorestore filtered the archive to a name it never\ncontained and matched no namespaces. And the script inferred success from\nmongorestore''s exit code rather than from what actually arrived, so an empty\ndatabase was reported as a verified backup -- the worst possible failure for\nthis tooling.\n\nStrip the URI to the cluster before mongorestore sees it. Record the source\ncollection and document counts in the backup manifest, and refuse to report\nsuccess unless the restored database is non-empty and its document count\nmatches what the archive was taken from. The guard is extracted as a pure\nfunction and covered by tests, including the empty and short-restore cases.\n\nThe re-run drill passed against real Atlas on the disposable development\ncluster: 17 collections and 162 documents out and back, every business total\nmatching, all three unique indexes recreated, drill database then dropped.\n\nSecure the development project per M-25: 0.0.0.0/0 removed after registering\nthe administrator device, and its database user downgraded from atlasAdmin to\nreadWrite on the two databases that exist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"408f5708ce0292872583c778d39dd9f07265f71e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/trees/408f5708ce0292872583c778d39dd9f07265f71e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/commits/ca798d580cfdb1be578faa5d4352ac889a116f10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Developerr86","id":138863457,"login":"Developerr86","node_id":"U_kgDOCEbjYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commit/ca798d580cfdb1be578faa5d4352ac889a116f10","node_id":"C_kwDOU9IAJNoAKGNhNzk4ZDU4MGNmZGIxYmU1NzhmYWE1ZDQzNTJhYzg4OWExMTZmMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commit/3fd598db7d78de2ebd2f7d014871aea6c88531b6","sha":"3fd598db7d78de2ebd2f7d014871aea6c88531b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/3fd598db7d78de2ebd2f7d014871aea6c88531b6"}],"sha":"ca798d580cfdb1be578faa5d4352ac889a116f10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/ca798d580cfdb1be578faa5d4352ac889a116f10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Developerr86","id":138863457,"login":"Developerr86","node_id":"U_kgDOCEbjYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/3fd598db7d78de2ebd2f7d014871aea6c88531b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:09:49Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:09:49Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"message":"Rewrite Phase 8 as a clean start\n\nThe owner confirmed the pharmacy''s records were never digitised and the\nsystem has not been handed over, so production starts empty and there is no\nmigration. Rewrite Phase 8 accordingly, keeping the audit of the two\ndevelopment databases as the evidence for why neither is migrated, and\nlisting the migration-only steps as explicitly not applicable rather than\nleaving them to look forgotten.\n\nCorrect the \"approximately 250 customer records\" assumption in the task list\nand the handoff; there are none. Replace the two go/no-go gate items that\ndepended on a migration with ones that check an empty database, a single\nowner account, and the unique indexes.\n\nRecord that the backup tooling was exercised against real Atlas on the\ndisposable development cluster: dump, encrypt, decrypt to an exact byte\nmatch, and a clean mongorestore --dryRun. A real restore with count\ncomparison is still required.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7984c0c3e1eeed17dfb62523b4c16526f52ab7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/trees/b7984c0c3e1eeed17dfb62523b4c16526f52ab7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/commits/3fd598db7d78de2ebd2f7d014871aea6c88531b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Developerr86","id":138863457,"login":"Developerr86","node_id":"U_kgDOCEbjYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commit/3fd598db7d78de2ebd2f7d014871aea6c88531b6","node_id":"C_kwDOU9IAJNoAKDNmZDU5OGRiN2Q3OGRlMmViZDJmN2QwMTQ4NzFhZWE2Yzg4NTMxYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commit/9ed1ae80da3a31d3d1f6238e2a69bcef21fdd461","sha":"9ed1ae80da3a31d3d1f6238e2a69bcef21fdd461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/9ed1ae80da3a31d3d1f6238e2a69bcef21fdd461"}],"sha":"3fd598db7d78de2ebd2f7d014871aea6c88531b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/3fd598db7d78de2ebd2f7d014871aea6c88531b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Developerr86","id":138863457,"login":"Developerr86","node_id":"U_kgDOCEbjYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/9ed1ae80da3a31d3d1f6238e2a69bcef21fdd461/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:04:20Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:04:20Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"message":"Audit the candidate source databases\n\nCorrect the audit''s business totals: stock is currentStock and payments use\namountPaid, not quantity and amount. Three totals had been reading a\nconfident zero against fields that do not exist in these schemas. Totals now\nreport how many documents actually carried a numeric value and raise a\nfinding when none did, so a misnamed field can no longer masquerade as a\nreal zero. Add inventory value at cost and at sale, and outstanding balance.\n\nLet the audit run without a database in the URI path, in which case it lists\nthe cluster''s databases and their sizes rather than requiring the name to be\nknown in advance. This surfaced that the source cluster holds two databases,\nthe larger of which is named medical_stock_system=Cluster0 -- a malformed\nconnection string having leaked into the database name.\n\nRecord the Phase 8 findings: neither candidate is plausibly the pharmacy''s\nlive record, both carry staff and second-administrator accounts that must not\nsurvive into a single-owner deployment, and no plaintext credential or\nprovider token is present in either.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e373c6c2d85fc077e33663beaee178e80d960c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/trees/7e373c6c2d85fc077e33663beaee178e80d960c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/commits/9ed1ae80da3a31d3d1f6238e2a69bcef21fdd461","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Developerr86","id":138863457,"login":"Developerr86","node_id":"U_kgDOCEbjYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commit/9ed1ae80da3a31d3d1f6238e2a69bcef21fdd461","node_id":"C_kwDOU9IAJNoAKDllZDFhZTgwZGEzYTMxZDNkMWY2MjM4ZTJhNjliY2VmMjFmZGQ0NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commit/f6997437a3fd94394541b8b81701127b04418a51","sha":"f6997437a3fd94394541b8b81701127b04418a51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/f6997437a3fd94394541b8b81701127b04418a51"}],"sha":"9ed1ae80da3a31d3d1f6238e2a69bcef21fdd461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/9ed1ae80da3a31d3d1f6238e2a69bcef21fdd461"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Developerr86","id":138863457,"login":"Developerr86","node_id":"U_kgDOCEbjYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/f6997437a3fd94394541b8b81701127b04418a51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:38:11Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:38:11Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"message":"Verify and correct the Atlas production project\n\nPhase 7 was reported complete; a direct read with the Atlas CLI showed four\nof five console items did not hold. Corrected with the user''s approval:\ntammewar_app dropped from readWriteAnyDatabase to readWrite on the\napplication database, the stray atlasAdmin user deleted, and 0.0.0.0/0\nremoved from the network allowlist after registering the trusted device.\nTermination protection cannot be set on a Free cluster; Atlas rejects every\npublic-API update to M0. Organization-wide Require MFA is still off and is\nleft for the console.\n\nCorrect an earlier claim in the same documents: the Atlas monitoring\nlistDatabases endpoint reports nothing for any Free cluster, so its zero is\nnot evidence that the production database was empty.\n\nAdd scripts/auditDatabase.js for Phase 8: a read-only inventory reporting\ncollection counts, indexes and uniqueness, the business totals to reconcile\nafter migration, demo-looking records, and plaintext credential fields. Its\ndetectors are unit-tested, including the false-positive cases a pharmacy\ncatalogue would otherwise trip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5abea76d14e8c912495f28b52e95bf0303c026bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/trees/5abea76d14e8c912495f28b52e95bf0303c026bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/commits/f6997437a3fd94394541b8b81701127b04418a51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Developerr86","id":138863457,"login":"Developerr86","node_id":"U_kgDOCEbjYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commit/f6997437a3fd94394541b8b81701127b04418a51","node_id":"C_kwDOU9IAJNoAKGY2OTk3NDM3YTNmZDk0Mzk0NTQxYjhiODE3MDExMjdiMDQ0MThhNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commit/fb98421d4338c56231d952a631e7a0ddf17b0b18","sha":"fb98421d4338c56231d952a631e7a0ddf17b0b18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/fb98421d4338c56231d952a631e7a0ddf17b0b18"}],"sha":"f6997437a3fd94394541b8b81701127b04418a51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/f6997437a3fd94394541b8b81701127b04418a51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Developerr86","id":138863457,"login":"Developerr86","node_id":"U_kgDOCEbjYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/commits/fb98421d4338c56231d952a631e7a0ddf17b0b18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T16:12:14Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T16:12:14Z","email":"developerrr86@gmail.com","name":"Developerr86"},"message":"Harden owner account, hosting config, and backups\n\nPhase 13: record passwordChangedAt so rotating the password ends every\nsession opened before it; add the missing change-password UI; add a\ncontrolled one-time owner:create that never echoes the password; log\nadministrator authentication events with redaction.\n\nPhases 10-12: add render.yaml, generate Cloudflare Pages _headers,\n_redirects, and robots.txt from VITE_API_BASE_URL so the CSP cannot drift\nfrom the API, and refuse wildcard, http, localhost, or path-bearing CORS\norigins at startup.\n\nPhase 9: add encrypted mongodump/mongorestore tooling. AES-256-GCM with a\nscrypt key, a manifest digest, 7/4/3 retention, and a restore path that\nrefuses to target the production database.\n\nPhase 14: add 58 security regression tests covering authentication,\nauthorization, request hardening, rate limiting, production configuration,\ndata exposure, archive encryption, and retention.\n\nFix a stored-XSS sink found during the sweep: the expense receipt viewer\ninterpolated a stored value into document.write markup and passed it to\nwindow.open. Receipts are now constrained to base64 image/PDF data URIs by\nthe schema and re-checked before every render, download, and open.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b5ee0dcaffe1e637b72a04ce6c6b0ac49e9ce73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/trees/8b5ee0dcaffe1e637b72a04ce6c6b0ac49e9ce73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shitalkalekar/Store-Management-System/git/commits/fb98421d4338c56231d952a631e7a0ddf17b0b18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138863457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Developerr86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gi