nt":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:57:14.429Z","repositoryId":1406350518,"sha":"43f2988982010cfd934d9c46951bab075b1d5d03"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T21:21:39Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T21:21:39Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:57:14.429Z","repositoryId":1406350518,"sha":"07fb232b282b72eab785bc80b5e55c5ffdb24a45"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T21:07:51Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T21:07:51Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:57:14.429Z","repositoryId":1406350518,"sha":"343a6feba8910818ccb83428822a399f7ac5bd73"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T20:59:05Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T20:59:05Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:57:14.429Z","repositoryId":1406350518,"sha":"a92114a5e23a9699e9cf910cab47e6d8ddc282ee"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T20:40:36Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T20:40:36Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:57:14.429Z","repositoryId":1406350518,"sha":"86464e4e81009d228d4a5a0dc6851538076d6fac"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T20:26:15Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T20:26:39Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"kyf778","providerType":"User"},"email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:57:14.429Z","repositoryId":1406350518,"sha":"37bff2ee52e8b00b5f6a997cc7b0d9019305ef50"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:57:14.429Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/a5153f15b1c91d5190714145bbc320b4a82ee42d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:17:03Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:17:03Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"message":"v3.4.0：豆瓣 ID 后台自动补齐\n\n此前新片入库后必须手动跑 tools/fetch_douban_ids.py，否则详情页豆瓣链接\n一直回退到搜索页。原因是硬性的：nfo 里没有 <doubanid>（实测 0/50），\nMoviePilot 的豆瓣接口返回 douban_id 为 null，只能走豆瓣网页搜索，而豆瓣\n反爬严格（高频即回「搜索访问太频繁」）。\n\n改动（plugins.v3/mylibrary/__init__.py）：\n\n1. 新增后台补齐线程，生命周期挂 init_plugin / stop_service：\n   - init_plugin 先停旧线程再按配置启新的，配置反复保存不会堆线程\n   - 线程用 Event 等待，stop 时立刻唤醒退出，不做无谓 join 等待\n2. 补齐策略（针对豆瓣的反爬逐条设计）：\n   - 只取「有 nfo 但缓存里没有 ID」的目录，已缓存条目永不重复请求\n   - 每部间隔 1.2 秒串行请求，与手动脚本一致\n   - 识别限流页（error_info / 访问太频繁）后冷却 30 分钟再继续\n   - 没有待补条目时完全不发请求，每 5 分钟复查一次新片\n   - 同一进程内查不到/匹配度不足的条目标记跳过，不反复骚扰豆瓣\n3. 写入 .douban_ids.json 采用「重读 + 临时文件原子替换」：\n   不会写坏缓存，也不会覆盖外部脚本同时写入的内容。\n4. 匹配与解析逻辑从 tools/fetch_douban_ids.py 移植为可测的纯函数：\n   _douban_parse_dirname / _douban_normalize / _douban_parse_search /\n   _douban_is_rate_limited / _douban_pick（阈值 35：宁可留空也不挂错链接）。\n   网络入口单独隔离为 _douban_http_get，便于测试替换。\n5. 设置页新增「自动补齐豆瓣 ID」开关（douban_auto，默认开）。\n   老配置没有该键时按开启处理，即升级后直接生效。\n6. dist 重新构建（Config 组件变更）。\n\n测试：新增 TestDoubanAutoFetch 21 项——目录名解析、标题归一化、搜索页解析、\n限流识别、候选挑选（含「无关候选必须拒绝」）、缺漏检测（缓存/无 nfo/隐藏\n目录/本次失败）、落盘合并与损坏恢复、写入格式与只读解析互通、限流不落盘、\n线程生命周期（禁用不启动、重复 init 不堆线程、stop 后死亡、无待补条目时\n零网络请求）。测试全程不联网，网络入口用 mock 替换。\n\n文档同步：README、docs/MyLibrary.md、插件 README 由「手动脚本」改为\n说明自动补齐的行为与限流策略，脚本保留为可选手段（缓存格式互通）。\n\n验证：preflight 全绿（版本三处一致、联邦 CSS 隔离、隐私扫描、文档链接、\n38 项单测通过）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e6af1899d081fb9e4a9d06b427e90feea90f12f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/1e6af1899d081fb9e4a9d06b427e90feea90f12f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/a5153f15b1c91d5190714145bbc320b4a82ee42d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/a5153f15b1c91d5190714145bbc320b4a82ee42d","node_id":"C_kwDOU9M0ttoAKGE1MTUzZjE1YjFjOTFkNTE5MDcxNDE0NWJiYzMyMGI0YTgyZWU0MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/34e929e331cea176dd5f69c3beffb3ce0551ed37","sha":"34e929e331cea176dd5f69c3beffb3ce0551ed37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/34e929e331cea176dd5f69c3beffb3ce0551ed37"}],"sha":"a5153f15b1c91d5190714145bbc320b4a82ee42d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/a5153f15b1c91d5190714145bbc320b4a82ee42d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/34e929e331cea176dd5f69c3beffb3ce0551ed37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:30:19Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:30:19Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"message":"补插件文档，并加固隐私扫描与文档链接检查\n\n1. docs/MyLibrary.md：功能、目录结构、豆瓣缓存脚本用法、常见问题。\n   文中脚本参数已与 tools/fetch_douban_ids.py 的实际 argparse 定义核对。\n\n2. 隐私扫描规则加固（抓出 6 处此前漏掉的真实泄漏）\n   旧规则只写死 /vol2/1000/，换个卷号就漏。改为：\n   - 匹配所有 /vol<数字>/<数字>/ 卷挂载点，不限具体卷号\n   - 补充 10.x 内网段、/mnt/<盘符>/ 挂载路径、邮箱地址\n   - 扫描范围从 py/md/json/vue/js/css 扩到 yml/yaml/sh/txt\n     （此前 .github/ 下的 shell 脚本根本没被扫过）\n   扫描后实际报出 6 处泄漏（README ×2、插件 README、脚本 ×3），\n   已全部替换为中性示例路径 /media/Videos/电影。\n\n3. 新增文档链接检查\n   Markdown 内部链接必须指向真实存在的文件。首次运行即抓出两处坏链：\n   - docs/MyLibrary.md 的 CONTRIBUTING 链接多了一级 ../\n   - issue/PR 模板里用了 ../blob/main/...，GitHub 会解析到 .github/\n     目录而非仓库根，改为绝对 URL\n   已分别用正常与故意造坏链两种情况验证该检查有效。\n\n4. README 同步三索引结构、tests/run.py、Release 工作流与 docs/。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9b95b0853725b08218c74ae43a787cc56a4da5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/f9b95b0853725b08218c74ae43a787cc56a4da5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/34e929e331cea176dd5f69c3beffb3ce0551ed37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/34e929e331cea176dd5f69c3beffb3ce0551ed37","node_id":"C_kwDOU9M0ttoAKDM0ZTkyOWUzMzFjZWExNzZkZDVmNjljM2JlZmZiM2NlMDU1MWVkMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/94fcf7aef2103143041d0886959c3b8968bb9bd5","sha":"94fcf7aef2103143041d0886959c3b8968bb9bd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/94fcf7aef2103143041d0886959c3b8968bb9bd5"}],"sha":"34e929e331cea176dd5f69c3beffb3ce0551ed37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/34e929e331cea176dd5f69c3beffb3ce0551ed37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/94fcf7aef2103143041d0886959c3b8968bb9bd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:27:05Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:27:05Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"message":"补贡献指南与 issue / PR 模板\n\n- CONTRIBUTING.md：开发流程、硬性规则表（含大版本跃迁、Vuetify 样式禁令\n  及其原因）、版本号三处同步说明、测试约定与提交要求。\n- .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml、feature_request.yml：\n  按官方模板结构编写，已用 GitHub 官方 issue form JSON Schema\n  （json.schemastore.org/github-issue-forms.json）校验通过。\n- .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml：禁用空白 issue，引导至\n  MoviePilot 官方讨论区与 Telegram 群。\n- .github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md：改动类型、自检清单（版本同步、\n  dist 产物、无凭据泄漏）。\n\n模板里的运行环境选项在本仓库场景下补了 fnOS/Linux，\n其余沿用官方结构，未改变字段语义。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e7510dccefcd857264cfd7462bdea3d5691efa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/3e7510dccefcd857264cfd7462bdea3d5691efa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/94fcf7aef2103143041d0886959c3b8968bb9bd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/94fcf7aef2103143041d0886959c3b8968bb9bd5","node_id":"C_kwDOU9M0ttoAKDk0ZmNmN2FlZjIxMDMxNDMwNDFkMDg4Njk1OWMzYjg5NjhiYjliZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/50627c0ff4ebd493f7258e5a41190a58d8f52b83","sha":"50627c0ff4ebd493f7258e5a41190a58d8f52b83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/50627c0ff4ebd493f7258e5a41190a58d8f52b83"}],"sha":"94fcf7aef2103143041d0886959c3b8968bb9bd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/94fcf7aef2103143041d0886959c3b8968bb9bd5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/50627c0ff4ebd493f7258e5a41190a58d8f52b83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:24:35Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:24:35Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"message":"补测试回归入口与 V2 代索引占位\n\n- tests/run.py：按官方 tests/run.py 的结构实现，按代际分独立子进程运行\n  pytest。本仓库目前只有 V3 插件，保留同样的 GENERATIONS 结构便于扩展。\n  已实测：有 pytest 时 12 个用例通过。\n- package.v2.json：新增 V2 代索引占位，条目标 v3=false 排除，\n  版本 2.0.0 以满足官方「V3 主版本 = 旧代主版本 + 1」的大版本跃迁规则。\n  官方 check_plugin_versions.py 对三个索引全部通过。\n- preflight 的单元测试改为走 tests/run.py，优先 pytest；未安装 pytest 时\n  自动回退 unittest discover。两条路径都已实测（分别用正常环境和\n  屏蔽 pytest 的 PYTHONPATH 验证）。\n- CI 版本门禁改为同时检查三个索引。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ea7f9bc9023f134f1cc0a902f8b5277f2db4eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/1ea7f9bc9023f134f1cc0a902f8b5277f2db4eb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/50627c0ff4ebd493f7258e5a41190a58d8f52b83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/50627c0ff4ebd493f7258e5a41190a58d8f52b83","node_id":"C_kwDOU9M0ttoAKDUwNjI3YzBmZjRlYmQ0OTNmNzI1OGU1YTQxMTkwYTU4ZDhmNTJiODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/43f2988982010cfd934d9c46951bab075b1d5d03","sha":"43f2988982010cfd934d9c46951bab075b1d5d03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/43f2988982010cfd934d9c46951bab075b1d5d03"}],"sha":"50627c0ff4ebd493f7258e5a41190a58d8f52b83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/50627c0ff4ebd493f7258e5a41190a58d8f52b83"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/43f2988982010cfd934d9c46951bab075b1d5d03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:22:37Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:22:37Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"message":"补 Release 工作流，插件目录可打包下载\n\n照搬官方 release.yml 的实现要点：\n- 仅在 package.v3.json 变更或手动触发时运行\n- 只打包索引中显式标记 release=true 的条目\n- tag 格式 MyLibrary_v<version>，发布说明取自该版本 history\n- 目录自上次打标签以来无变化则跳过，避免每次推送重复打包\n- 重跑同一版本时删除既有 Release 后重建，替换资产\n\n同时 vendor 官方 select_plugin_release_dir.sh，用于从 package 文件名\n推导插件目录（package.v3.json -> plugins.v3/<id>）。\n\n联邦插件必须在索引中设置 release: true，否则不会被正式发布工作流\n纳入资产打包——这正是官方 check_federation_css.py 的门禁项之一。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>"