ub.com/users/kyf778/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/37bff2ee52e8b00b5f6a997cc7b0d9019305ef50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:26:15Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:26:39Z","email":"694982318@qq.com","name":"kyf"},"message":"MyLibrary 3.3.0: MoviePilot V3 媒体库海报墙插件\n\n- 左侧导航栏入口（Vue 联邦模块），海报墙对齐官方 MediaCard：\n  纯海报卡 + 悬停渐变详情层、类型/评分角标按分数配色\n- 详情弹窗对齐官方 MediaDetailView：横版背景(landscape.jpg) + 四边渐隐、\n  左下竖版海报、官方主创名单布局\n- 后端用标准库 ElementTree 解析 NFO，提取导演/演职员/时长/清晰度/\n  文件清单等 25 个字段，不依赖宿主内部实现\n- 豆瓣链接：预抓 id 落盘缓存（tools/fetch_douban_ids.py），避免实时请求反爬\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"894d47063c9439b0e2c1ee70a139ff80b853f7f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/894d47063c9439b0e2c1ee70a139ff80b853f7f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kyf778/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/37bff2ee52e8b00b5f6a997cc7b0d9019305ef50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185041789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyf778","id":185041789,"login":"kyf778","node_id":"U_kgDOCweDfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyf778/repos","site_admin":false,"starred