s/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/9bbeb071d6d1b79294971ac575ff54c447cc09e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:16:16Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:41:43Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(terminal): ADR-0017 决定 3 的余下半边——26 个节点里的 x 前缀残留与 defineNode 的 effect 缝消费者跟上\n\n第一条只量到 check:cliface 能看见的那 8 颗（bin 与屏上不同字）。把这决定做完要连帮助文案、README 与单测断言一起收，尺看不见那些：bitv crashu encodb formatv linku rawfilter smartzip bandia cleanf enginev 等包的 src 与 tests 与 README 里还有 117 处 x 形字面串（bin 本身早已是裸名，所以 cliface 早就绿了，红的是屏上教使用者敲一条不存在的命令）。本轮跳过 src/cli-support.ts——那是 26 份逐字同的 vendored 件，动它要同批改 26 份并记进保真台账，不属于这一刀。\n\n第二件是上一条批次带进 defineNode 的 ctx.effect 缝（yvm 那条提交里 node-sdk 那一半）：生产侧改了，16 份节点包的测试替身没有 effect 成员，defineNode 一跑就 TypeError。按仓内已有的正典形状补上（packages/node-sdk/tests/define-node.spec.ts:67 那份：回调立即执行，返回的函数收作注销器），共 24 处替身。\n\n读数：check:cliregistry rc=0（26 条与盘上逐字同），check:cliface rc=0（每一条真跑得起来），check:vendored rc=0（26 份 cli-support 一致——本轮没碰它），check:vocab rc=0，test:contract rc=0；盘上 x 前缀的 bin 声明现读为 0。17 个受影响包的 test:unit 里 15 个 rc=0，两处仍红：bitv tests/definition.spec.ts:337 与 cleanf :326 都在断 bindInputs 把省略的布尔折成 false（G8），拿到的是 undefined。这两处不在本提交的路径上，判据在此：bindInputs 那段代码在 node-ui-config-carrier 与本分支 tip 上 git diff 为空，清单里 dryRun 绑定两边键集相同（别人未提交的改动只加了 icon 与 category），而 packages/node-sdk/src/define-node.ts 此刻正被并发那一侧改着——所以这条红归搬运那一刀收口，我不替它决定 G8 是新语义还是旧断言。","tree":{"sha":"9547f6a1e4c13c7f805c0e41966cf0e1baa40e25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/9547f6a1e4c13c7f805c0e41966cf0e1baa40e25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/9bbeb071d6d1b79294971ac575ff54c447cc09e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/9bbeb071d6d1b79294971ac575ff54c447cc09e1","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDliYmViMDcxZDZkMWI3OTI5NDk3MWFjNTc1ZmY1NGM0NDdjYzA5ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/d5164c48d86a2b7b72ddf7071d1b835e67a0458a","sha":"d5164c48d86a2b7b72ddf7071d1b835e67a0458a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/d5164c48d86a2b7b72ddf7071d1b835e67a0458a"}],"sha":"9bbeb071d6d1b79294971ac575ff54c447cc09e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/9bbeb071d6d1b79294971ac575ff54c447cc09e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/d5164c48d86a2b7b72ddf7071d1b835e67a0458a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:02:05Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:41:43Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(terminal): 按 ADR-0017 决定 3 把 8 颗 bin 的 x 前缀收掉，脚手架那侧的根因一起改\n\n红的是什么：check:cliface 量到 classf classq marku migratef mvz nameu repacku trename 八条 no-name（rc=1，尺自己 rc=0，其余 18 条 ok）——package.json 的 bin 写着 xclassf，而各自 --help 屏上第一行印的是 classf。ADR-0017 决定 3 明写 bin 由 x 加 id 改成裸 id、nodeCliName 返回裸 id、帮助文案与用例与单测断言同步；26 份 vendored cli-support 与 packages/cli-runtime 的 NODE_CLI_PREFIX 早就是裸名，这 8 颗是漏网的。\n\n根因在脚手架，不在那 8 个包：packages/create-xaihi-plugin 的 binNameOf 写的是 x 加 nodeId，而同一份模板生成的 cli.ts 用的是 nodeCliName（裸名）——脚手架产出的包天生 bin 与屏上不同字，这 8 颗就是这么来的。binNameOf 改成返回裸 id；它的头注释原本还声称沿用 nodeCliName 并写着 x 前缀，那句与被调函数相反，一并改口。scaffold.spec.ts 的期望是从 binNameOf 推的，所以它自动跟着，不需要改断言。\n\n改动面：8 份 package.json 只挑我那条 bin hunk（同一文件里别人的 icon 与 category 那条 hunk 我没提，留在未提交区），加 26 份 src 与 tests 与 README 里那 130 处 x 形字面串与说明文案（含 classf 的 help.ts 与 trename 的 cli.ts 里把 xclassf 当现行事实叙述的注释，改后才与代码一致）。packages/cli-runtime 的 index.test.ts 两条断言原先就是红的（nodeCliName 早返回裸名，用例还钉 xrepacku），改成钉裸名，并把退役掉的 x 形钉成不再被 normalize 收——这条是 ADR-0017 的后果，不留别名。\n\n读数（只跑相关档，全仓 test 归因不了因为有并发 lane 在写）：gen-cli-registry 现读 26 条与盘上逐字相同、表里 x 前缀命中 0、26 条 bin 与 package.json 零失配；check:cliregistry rc=0；check:cliface rc=0（八条 no-name 全转 ok，含新入表的 kisaki）。诚实交代没过的部分：这 8 个包的 test:unit 仍红（marku 2 红 55 绿），红点不是本提交，是上一条批次带进 defineNode 的 ctx.effect 缝——那 8 份测试替身没有 effect，实为生产改了消费者没跟上，单独记。","tree":{"sha":"ff004425aa4c3ef220be51f5cf23162811759a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/ff004425aa4c3ef220be51f5cf23162811759a74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/d5164c48d86a2b7b72ddf7071d1b835e67a0458a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/d5164c48d86a2b7b72ddf7071d1b835e67a0458a","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKGQ1MTY0YzQ4ZDg2YTJiN2I3MmRkZjcwNzFkMWI4MzVlNjdhMDQ1OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/6c80ff60606b217477306018cb609bcd74fd0a1f","sha":"6c80ff60606b217477306018cb609bcd74fd0a1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/6c80ff60606b217477306018cb609bcd74fd0a1f"}],"sha":"d5164c48d86a2b7b72ddf7071d1b835e67a0458a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/d5164c48d86a2b7b72ddf7071d1b835e67a0458a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/6c80ff60606b217477306018cb609bcd74fd0a1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:43:19Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:41:43Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"docs(adr): 0007/0008/0019 落纸，0001 记修订，路线图与终端面台账跟上这一批\n\n新增三份 ADR：0007 组件放置四层落点（决定 1–5 有效，决定 6 方案甲被 0008 取代并整节留痕）；0008 L2 的共享机制与 L4 边界（DSH 有两条跨包共享路，Xaihi 走 MF2 shared，L1+L2 同包、L4 每节点各自成包）；0019 多工作空间退役、塌缩成单例。docs/adr/0001 补一节修订，把曾被 0007 决定 6 收窄成只发一个 remote 的适用面改回 1 个宿主容器 + N 个节点 remote。\n\nroadmap：R1 措辞澄清（撤的是自建组件层，不是共享控件出口这个位置）、R10/R11 前置改指 0007/0008、新增 R13 品牌收口与 R14 desktop/ 壳这一层，并把 R8 拆成官方桌面端与自家壳两条腿且明写不许拿一条替另一条签字。\n\n两份 2026-10-07 台账：terminal-face-ledger（各节点三面落点与只在下游/只在本仓的差集）、help-workflows（上游 54 块工作流帮助的分派）；vocab-baseline.json 的词表棘轮跟着改口径。新增 examples/profile-patches/xaihi-slim.patch.yml——把 xaihi 开发宿主里 DSH 自己的界面与出站数据面按行关掉那份精简补丁，判据写在文件头上。技能 xaihi-migration 的顺序那一节补上终端面移出未搬清单、UI 与批次的对应改指 0006/0007。","tree":{"sha":"ea9433ed774ba7fbd8f7fca5253b1e306ecf5c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/ea9433ed774ba7fbd8f7fca5253b1e306ecf5c74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/6c80ff60606b217477306018cb609bcd74fd0a1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/6c80ff60606b217477306018cb609bcd74fd0a1f","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDZjODBmZjYwNjA2YjIxNzQ3NzMwNjAxOGNiNjA5YmNkNzRmZDBhMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/d97901e569f02caa11d67dfa6358ecc626fe503f","sha":"d97901e569f02caa11d67dfa6358ecc626fe503f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/d97901e569f02caa11d67dfa6358ecc626fe503f"}],"sha":"6c80ff60606b217477306018cb609bcd74fd0a1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/6c80ff60606b217477306018cb609bcd74fd0a1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/d97901e569f02caa11d67dfa6358ecc626fe503f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:41:56Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:41:43Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"feat(ui-host): 工作台界面与节点面板接上注册表，设计语言入口改由 lib/design-theme 驱动\n\nworkspace 那一排：TopBar 不再挂那个独立的 DesignLanguagePicker（连同该文件一起删），改读 lib/design-theme 的 AppDesignThemeId 与 DESIGN_THEME_ENTRIES，六套语言仍是候选而不是默认值；BackendStatusBanner、AppMenuRoot、AppConfigSync、WorkspaceUrlState、WorkspaceWindowFrameSync 跟上文档面与适配器那两条形状；新增 componentWindowSizeStore.ts 把组件窗尺寸按节点持久化，对应壳侧 0009 那条带 width/height 的 open。\n\nviews 侧 NodeOperationMonitor、UsageDashboard、DataSection、RuntimeSection 与 Webview2ExperimentsPanel 换到设置面与运行账本的读回口径（配置走 DSH 标准面，ADR-0013）；新增 lib/nodeRunProgress.ts 一份进度形状，pie-menu 的 hooks 与 primitive 跟着改。classf、encodeb、recycleu、sleept、smartzip 五份节点面板补齐控件与测试。\n\n补 plugins/classf/src/deletion-history.ts（69 行），是 ADR-0009 那条 (2) 纯移植欠账的落点：两个导出名与入参形状照上游（analyzeClassfDeletionHistory、suggestClassfBlacklistKeywords），只拖同目录的 blacklist.ts。这一份不是逐字搬——CSV 解析是文件内自带的 parseCsvRows，没有引上游用的 csv-parse（那个包在全仓只声明在 packages/shared，@xiranite/* 那份按实测不能当 workspace 依赖引）。所以它是按接口重写的一份，别按 check-verbatim 的口径读它，也别让 blame 把它当成上游移植。不补这一格的话界面那个历史分析面板是空返回，画得出来而算错。\n\ni18n 两份词表与 package.json 的清单跟着这次改名与新增文件对齐；新增五份接线尺（app-config-sections、css-scope、document-bridge-wiring、node-host-wiring、run-progress-wiring），theme.spec.ts 与两份 settings 测试改口径。","tree":{"sha":"202aad098dfe8328e232d09d6bfeb7e1a0d909fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/202aad098dfe8328e232d09d6bfeb7e1a0d909fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/d97901e569f02caa11d67dfa6358ecc626fe503f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/d97901e569f02caa11d67dfa6358ecc626fe503f","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKGQ5NzkwMWU1NjlmMDJjYWExMWQ2N2RmYTYzNThlY2M2MjZmZTUwM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/a4a011e379a80db2f56c37083d203cd38359cb71","sha":"a4a011e379a80db2f56c37083d203cd38359cb71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/a4a011e379a80db2f56c37083d203cd38359cb71"}],"sha":"d97901e569f02caa11d67dfa6358ecc626fe503f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/d97901e569f02caa11d67dfa6358ecc626fe503f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/a4a011e379a80db2f56c37083d203cd38359cb71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:41:33Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:41:43Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"feat(ui-host): 文档入口起 realm、桥下沉进 provider，构建与状态这一层接通\n\n入口 src/document/main.tsx 两条立场：通信只走 DSH 插件标准面（startRealm 按容器选载体，被嵌在槽里是 postMessage、自家顶层窗是同源 POST /xaihi/host，桥交给 DocumentBridgeProvider），因此不再往 window 上塞那份 __XIRANITE_BACKEND__ = { baseUrl: /api } 的 REST 兜底（ADR-0013）；拿不到启动信息不算崩——window.__XAIHI_UI__ 没写就让 startRealm 回 null，界面照常挂载并把退化读回来（ADR-0011 决定 4）。同批 src/document/{realm,bridge-context,settings-face}.ts 与 src/client/{document-host,node-host-bridge,node-mount,workspace}.tsx 跟上这份形状。\n\n删掉两处只服务于已退役通路的文件：src/client/theme/material-you.ts（那条走的是自带后端的 overrideTokens，设计语言现在是唯一颜色来源）与 src/config/webview2.ts（连同 src/config/ 那一层），对应界面侧 DesignLanguagePicker 的移除在下一条。\n\nstore/workspace 那一层补上 migratedCustomThemes 与 backendSlice/workspaceSlice/types/constants 的读回；hooks 新增 useHostConnection（连接状态是读得回的一格，不是控制台里的一行），useWindowControls 改吃上一条那个适配器。\n\n构建侧要点名一条：src/vendor/xyflow-stub.tsx 与它的 css 是 @xyflow/react 的**本地降级垫片**，靠 rspack.document.mjs 里的别名把 marku 的 WorkflowEditor 那条边接住。ADR-0009 记的方案是钉 12.11.2 装真包，这里换成桩是为了先让 build:document 落成——桩能让界面编译并挂载，但工作流那张图的真行为没有，属于画得出来而算不准那一类，要么装真依赖要么让那一格显式拒绝，这条留给使用者拍。新增 vite.config.ts 与 vitest.browser.config.ts（含浏览器档），tsdown/vitest/rspack.document/index.html 跟着改。","tree":{"sha":"b4cfad3c6e27ea6ff8d50c33a03817930d542b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/b4cfad3c6e27ea6ff8d50c33a03817930d542b2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/a4a011e379a80db2f56c37083d203cd38359cb71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/event