s/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/a6c918b9ee6808aa760af3b6b236de68f7ad42e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:40:16Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:41:43Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"feat(ui-host): 后端半边换成 DSH 桌面适配器，tauri 那一整块退役\n\n新增 src/backend/adapters/dshDesktop.ts：读的是壳上那份 window.dshDesktop.xaihiWindow，动词按 desktop/patches 落地的形状逐个可选（open / getCapabilities / controlMain / controlComponent / openDevTools / startDragging / focus / close / getBounds / setBounds / subscribeFrameChanges），缺的那一格由上层判成 stock-shell 并显示出来，不伪造（ADR-0011 决定 4 的退化可读）。\n\n删除 5 个文件：adapters/tauri.ts 与其两份测试、tauriChannel.ts 与其测试——官方桌面端与本仓自家壳之外没有第三家会兑现那条通道，留着它等于让 localBackendStatus 继续把诊断推给一条已经不存在的桥。同批把 web.ts、runtime.ts、localBackendConfig/Status、runtimeConnectionInfo 与 appConfigSections、nodeOperationControl 改成只认这一条通路。\n\n配套 packages/ui-host/tests/dsh-desktop-adapter.spec.ts 覆盖有适配器与官方壳（xaihiWindow 缺席）两种形状。","tree":{"sha":"d1d8e5c96ac0d3426113aab340c30f98c633bd14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/d1d8e5c96ac0d3426113aab340c30f98c633bd14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/a6c918b9ee6808aa760af3b6b236de68f7ad42e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/