/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/bc38f6c99beded72e576c7aa7a883d6f8afe1c29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:40:00Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:41:43Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"refactor(packages): Elysia/Eden 半边摘除、说明符收口，节点注册表补上副作用回收缝\n\npackages/api：整份 REST 面（index.ts 的 createXiraniteApp 与 nodeApp.ts、nexusCaptureInbox 及其测试）按 cordis 分诊那一刀删掉，client.ts 不再 import @elysiajs/eden 的 treaty；那两个 @xiranite/file-operations 的纯类型换成仓内垫片 src/file-deletion-dtos.ts（抄上游 file-operations/src/types.ts），包名从 @xiranite/api 改成 @hibernalglow/xaihi-api，依赖换成 xaihi-contract 与 xaihi-shared。\n\npackages/contract 与 packages/shared：@xiranite/shared 的裸说明符改成本仓真名；shared 里那份 nodeMemoryProtectionPolicySettingsSchema 随 REST 面一起退（配置走 DSH 标准面，ADR-0013）。\n\npackages/node-sdk：NodeToolContext 补 ctx.effect 那条副作用回收缝——nodeRegistry 是进程级单例、不挂在任何 fiber 上，没有这条缝则插件卸载/热更后节点永久留在表里，本地 Runner 仍能调到一个已死实例（症状是停用的节点还在跑）。签名刻意写宽松：node-sdk 的 peer 只有 dsh-tools，按 cordis 那套 Effect 联合精确声明反而让真 Context 过不了赋值。配套 NodeRegistry.register 的注销器改成按身份判——热更顺序是先装新的再卸旧的，无条件按 key 删会把新实例一起摘掉（ABA）。四份测试跟着补。","tree":{"sha":"ff2a941e252f43a2834deabccfb13846539748d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/ff2a941e252f43a2834deabccfb13846539748d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/bc38f6c99beded72e576c7aa7a883d6f8afe1c29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifie