tarred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/8b55759d78e3cec60b0b6dc23d0de447feb46be5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:37:57Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:41:43Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"build(workspace): api/cli-runtime/contract/shared 四包入表，react 19 覆盖落地，根入口脚本与开发/验尺脚本同批接上\n\npnpm-workspace.yaml 从排除名单里删掉 !packages/api、!packages/cli-runtime、!packages/contract、!packages/shared 四条：api 里最后那两个 @xiranite/* 是纯类型依赖，落点是 packages/api/src/file-deletion-dtos.ts 这份垫片（抄上游 file-operations/src/types.ts）加上改指 contract 已移植好的 NodeConfigVersion*，依赖图里再无 @xiranite/*。仍在表外的只有 cli（聚合 CLI，本次不需要）、logging（只被 cli 用）与目录已不存在的 tui。\n\npnpm-workspace.yaml 另加两格：sharp: true（cli-runtime 入表带来的原生包，terminal 的图片预览要它，不放行就 ERR_PNPM_IGNORED_BUILDS 判整次 install 失败），以及 minimumReleaseAgeExclude 那六个 @babel 8.0.7 与 react/react-dom 19.2.4 的 overrides；pnpm-lock.yaml 是这三条的生成物，与生产者同批。\n\npackage.json 的 scripts 与根依赖同批，是因为那 11 个新键（dev、dev:ui、build:ui、serve:workspace、host:web、desktop:profile|check|launch|stop|verify、live:workbench|nodeface|realm|remotes、global:install）指向的脚本就在这份提交里：scripts/dev.mjs、serve-workspace.mjs、check-workbench-live.mjs 是新落的第一版，check-nodeface-live.mjs 与 global-install.mjs 跟着改口径；verify-browser-theme.mjs 是浏览器侧主题那条尺。拆开提会让 tip 上出现指向不存在文件的 npm 脚本。","tree":{"sha":"aa52a5a052c1e56ba26c4e885f1c1d9a129aacee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/aa52a5a052c1e56ba26c4e885f1c1d9a129aacee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/8b55759d78e3cec60b0b6dc23d0de447feb46be5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"veri