ment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:51:17Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"feat(terminal): 25 个节点的终端面把两条交互腿接上，帮助与开关表改由清单推导\n\nNodeCliFaceOptions 多了 runGd 与 runUi 两个可选钩子：gd 是交互引导流（默认 Clack），ui 是全屏终端控制台（OpenTUI）。此前这两个位置在 25 份 cli-support 里都写死成退出码 2 的明确拒绝，现在按节点各自接；接不了的仍要点名原因，不许静默回落成非交互跑法（ADR-0011 决定 4 那条退化可读的铁律）。\n\n同批：sleept 补上它一直缺的执行内核（runtime.ts 177 行照上游 platform.ts 逐字搬，schedule.ts 49 行是三面共用的一份 powerMode 词表，旧的 interaction.ts 里那份手写 4 值表由此作废）；enginev 与 encodb 的 Config 声明收进各自的 schema 类型；smartzip 的 platform 与契约补上子进程那一条腿，并带 platform.integration 与 local-subprocess 夹具；bandia、classq、sleept 各补自己的 tsconfig（含 types: node 那一条，缺了干净检出编不动）。\n\nbin 形状带来的装饰品 bug、上游 kebab 拼法的规范形别名表、以及 (also --x) 打进屏上描述这三件，都在 check-cli-parity 那条尺的台账里对得上号。","tree":{"sha":"13f77eabf47efebc56e7f43637b5a4e8cd9a422d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/13f77eabf47efebc56e7f43637b5a4e8cd9a422d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/7fa6670b31909c50173b270e303721033483b607","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https