三项，不认识的版本拒绝装载而不是降级跑一半。不走 c-shared 的理由写进了代码头：Go 的 cgo 边界 panic 不可恢复，陪葬的是使用者的宿主与整条会话。\n\n文件：20 个 .go（含 5 份上游自带测试，是保真门禁的本体）、go.mod/go.sum、README、两份探针脚本（probe-host.py 17 项判据、probe-bench.py 量 ADR-0004 后果第 2 条）。跨平台那两条腿各带自己的 file_identity（darwin/linux 与 windows）。实测读数与构建命令在 README：CGO_ENABLED=1 go build -o dist/findz-host .，那份产物按上一条规则不进仓。","tree":{"sha":"f410617c8e56d08ead964489e3c52c8a3a34d2a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/f410617c8e56d08ead964489e3c52c8a3a34d2a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/fb75a3a08f6c01a67f3b3248c566a945154c4fbd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/fb75a3a08f6c01a67f3b3248c566a945154c4fbd","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKGZiNzVhM2EwOGY2YzAxYTY3ZjNiMzI0OGM1NjZhOTQ1MTU0YzRmYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/53df2e1711fdea9273c54f28b4e8dfdbd813e190","sha":