low/Xaihi/commits/ed6b7f81dcd801dd20e5b17ec605e10a47b94b64"}],"sha":"8def5780b12f3e52704141f23a93de33c49e1267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/8def5780b12f3e52704141f23a93de33c49e1267"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/ed6b7f81dcd801dd20e5b17ec605e10a47b94b64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:48:22Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:51:17Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"feat(runner): 接通本地插件执行通道，解耦 DSH Agent 依赖\n\n- 实现 NodeRegistry 与 createLocalRunner，管理本地节点注册与纯 Node.js 动作分发\n- defineNode 自动注册到 NodeRegistry，捕获并透传 run.resultView 结构化数据\n- 宿主桥 host-routes 接入 runner 能力，移除硬编码 Agent 拒绝拦截，并提供 /xaihi/runner 路由\n- UI 客户端外壳透传 runner 桥，使工作台面板按钮可直达本地插件执行\n- 适配 linedup 与 sleept 动作分发，新增端到端集成测试并通过全套门禁","tree":{"sha":"76cb021358f7583201cd72e20266e1960cc6976e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/76cb0