ollowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/8b9405bd538633fa729255c99cbffaf95b4478b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:05:56Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:51:17Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"配置历史走派生快照：REST 配置面整块拆除\n\n- 服务半边新增 settings-history.ts：脱敏快照仓（storage domain `xaihi_settings_history`，内存可退化并说出原因）；采集两条腿 = 桥路由写点即采（withHistoryCapture 套住宿主设置面，volatile 的 xaihi-core 跳过）+ 列表前对账（reconcile）；快照带密钥叶路径（脱敏/明文两份读数的差），恢复只走 mutate path op 且含密钥的顶层字段整段跳过——把脱敏标记写回真值等于销毁密钥。新路由 /xaihi/settings-history.json：列表/单份/恢复，命名空间闸与 /xaihi/host 同档。\n- 客户端：NodeSettingsFaceContext（xaihi-<node> 命名空间的桥读写缝，ModuleRenderer 装配递进）；derivedConfigAdapters（history 走快照路由，transfer 走设置面，backup 整组明示\"已并入历史/远端同步是配置文件时代的机器\"）；NodeConfigButton/CenterButton 改走设置面，TOML 导入导出裁掉只留 JSON（DSH 设置文档没有 TOML 形态），源码面板改 JSON 高亮。\n- 拆 REST：lib/nodeConfigApi.ts 删除；externalNodeGateway 配置缝改注入设置面（无 face 抛读得回的原因）；i18n 词典 config.* 的 TOML 文案全部换成设置文档口径。\n- 验证：core 快照仓 7 断言（含\"拆闸必红\"正控）；ui-host 全量 50 文件 393 断言绿；core build 通过。","tree":{"sha":"e8c2d4ce89c91841bcbbdd605e