3885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/dafbfb0d7679a64cac55ee25ea4f57d4d3928db9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:12:00Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:51:17Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"节点界面偏好走 DSH 桥：restore-on-startup 从已裁的 REST 迁到 xaihi-core.nodeUi\n\n- 新增 backend/nodeUiConfig.ts：载体经 config.getUi 整格读 + config.save 窄补丁写 xaihi-core.nodeUi[nodeId]（core Config 声明的 volatile 格），与 appConfigSections.ts 同一套纪律。不走 host.getNodeUiConfig——文档面握手 settingsNs 恒为 xaihi-core，扁名回的是整格值，写回会覆盖 appConfig/nodeState。\n- 新增 nodes/shared/NodeUiConfigContext.tsx：载体接口 + provider/hook；nodes/** 不 import backend，由装配侧按结构递进。\n- ModuleRenderer 用 useDocumentBridge 造载体包进 provider；bridge 为空不编空载体，消费方走可见退化。\n- NodeConfigPopover 的开机恢复读/写/迁移改走载体；无载体退回本地遗留键（writeLegacyAutoRestorePreference，键名不动），不再每帧打注定失败的 REST——即 2026-10-07 控制台 \"Xiranite local backend is not configured\" warn 的出处。\n- 测试改 store mock 三条腿（存取/迁移/无载体退化）8 断言绿；vitest 白名单条目因与另一 lane 未提交工作同 hunk，暂留工作区未提交。","tree":{"sha":"3a11ae3a83611b1bef7902243c189acc1da23d57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/3a11ae3a83611b1bef7902243c189acc1da23d57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/dafbfb0d7679a64cac55ee25ea4f57d4d3928db9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/dafbfb0d7679a64cac55ee25ea4f57d4d3928db9","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKGRhZmJmYjBkNzY3OWE2NGNhYzU1ZWUyNWVhNGY1N2Q0ZDM5MjhkYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/670f47e8d7c97f43b6cef892416cd554a5e08645","sha":"670f47e8d7c97f43b6cef892416cd554a5e08645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/670f47e8d7c97f43b6cef892416cd554a5e08645"}],"sha":"dafbfb0d7679a64cac55ee25ea4f57d4d3928db9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/dafbfb0d7679a64cac55ee25ea4f57d4d3928db9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/670f47e8d7c97f43b6cef892416cd554a5e08645/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:54:09Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:51:17Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"新增 global:install：节点终端面以 tarball 快照装进 npm 全局\n\n背景（2026-10-07 实测）：npm i -g file:plugins/<id> 装的是指向仓库工作树的\n软链，本地一改全局当场跟着变，起不到保险作用；npm pack 又把\npackages/cli-runtime 当 GitHub owner/repo 简写，须带 ./ 前缀。\n\n脚本流程：pnpm pack 四个运行时底座（cli-runtime/api/contract/shared，\npnpm pack 会把 workspace:* 改写成真版本）+ npm pack 各插件（files 白名单\n只带 lib/dist/locale）→ 一条 npm i -g 全装上。装进去的都是解包实体，\nimport.meta.resolve 实测锁在 prefix 内、prefix 内零外指软链；更新 = 重跑。\n\n验证：sleept 经脚本装进 scratch 前缀，bin --help rc=0 完整 1150B 输出；\ncli-runtime 的 dist/help.js 引 contract，故四个底座随闭链一起装、不做删改。\n注意：npm 全局无 store 去重，单插件 ~170MB；ui/gd 要 Node ≥ 26（node:ffi）。\n\n根 package.json 的 global:install 一行与其他 lane 的未提交 scripts 增改混在\n同一 hunk，按归属留在未提交区。","tree":{"sha":"30ed4bcf10150c9db187d981612318bb4ae053e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/30ed4bcf10150c9db187d981612318bb4ae053e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/670f47e8d7c97f43b6cef892416cd554a5e08645","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/670f47e8d7c97f43b6cef892416cd554a5e08645","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDY3MGY0N2U4ZDdjOTdmNDNiNmNlZjg5MjQxNmNkNTU0YTVlMDg2NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/7001b3c7e1528d043431722a3fb4f5740d813ecc","sha":"7001b3c7e1528d043431722a3fb4f5740d813ecc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/7001b3c7e1528d043431722a3fb4f5740d813ecc"}],"sha":"670f47e8d7c97f43b6cef892416cd554a5e08645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/670f47e8d7c97f43b6cef892416cd554a5e08645"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/7001b3c7e1528d043431722a3fb4f5740d813ecc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:31:17Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:51:17Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"修复节点 CLI 自执行闸门：npm bin 软链下静默不跑\n\nnpm i -g 装出的 bin 是以节点 id 命名的软链（bin/<id>），原闸门用\n/\\\\bcli\\\\.[cm]?[jt]s$/ 正则匹配裸 argv[1]，链下不匹配导致 bin 静默 rc=0\n（实机 npm i -g file: 复现，--help 零字节）。改为 argv[1] 与本模块\nimport.meta.url 的 realpath 比较：bin 软链直跑点亮；聚合 CLI 引本模块时\nargv[1] 是它自己的入口，不点亮；argv[1] 缺省不点亮。比较形状出处为上游\nsleept 原写的 pathToFileURL(argv[1]).href 一条，本仓此前抄了正则那条。\n\n25 份 plugins/<id>/src/cli.ts 同批修改；cleanf/sleept/smartzip 三份与\n未提交的搬运 hunk 混在同一文件，留待搬运批次一并提交。\n\n验证：22 份 typecheck 绿（cleanf/linedup/hello 的红是在飞搬运与待删包的\n既有问题）；单测红全部为 createCliRenderer 在 Node 22 的既有环境问题\n（bandia 基线 A/B 证明与本改无因果）；sleept 实机 file: 全局安装后\nbin/sleept --help 正常输出，Node 26 下 ui 经 bin 软链真渲染，Node 22 下\n可读降级 rc=3，聚合 import 保持熄灭。","tree":{"