message":"feat(desktop): 桌面端启动默认进入 Xaihi 工作台主视图并补齐文档装配","tree":{"sha":"675af70d462046b8688236b0708b615cfc417ca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/675af70d462046b8688236b0708b615cfc417ca8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/a1fa1f0e254ca395e83576b855424e8f4a0202d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/a1fa1f0e254ca395e83576b855424e8f4a0202d9","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKGExZmExZjBlMjU0Y2EzOTVlODM1NzZiODU1NDI0ZThmNGEwMjAyZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/8f79d7d1e9e3d495e97f9e6115b5d97b1b386de6","sha":"8f79d7d1e9e3d495e97f9e6115b5d97b1b386de6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/8f79d7d1e9e3d495e97f9e6115b5d97b1b386de6"}],"sha":"a1fa1f0e254ca395e83576b855424e8f4a0202d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/a1fa1f0e254ca395e83576b855424e8f4a0202d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/8f79d7d1e9e3d495e97f9e6115b5d97b1b386de6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:10:08Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:10:08Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"扁名 getNodeConfig 之前读的是整份设置文档，这条类型账查出来的是个真缺陷；折叠层同时收到它真保证得了的声称范围。查到的：toNodeHostApi 的 getNodeConfig 直接转 host.config.get，而那条动词在对面映射到 ctx.settings.describe()——活体读数写着回的是 {\"namespaces\":[{\"autoGenerate\":true,\"ns\":\"xaihi-co…，也就是所有插件的行。25 个节点在用这个扁名，它们要的\"我这个节点的配置\"于是每次把整份文档搬过桥，而同一条桥上 200 KiB 撑爆 256 KiB 上界是 10-06 量过的。现在 getNodeConfig 与 getNodeUiConfig 都走 config.getUi(settingsNs)，只读装配带进来的那一格，形状 { config }——不给 path：路线 (A) 的对面从没说过配置文件路径（DSH 标准面没这个概念，ADR-0013 正是拿掉它的那条），编一个就是伪造宿主没给的数据；那 4 处 setConfigFilePath(response.path)（dissolvef/Component.tsx:60、bandia/Component.tsx:73,82、cleanf/Component.tsx:53、formatv/Component.tsx:55）今天念出来是空，这一格等一个真定位符。第二件是声称本身：toNodeHostApi 不再返回字面意义上的上游 NodeHostApi，改成 Omit<…, contract/config/getNodeConfig/getNodeUiConfig> 并补上本仓那三处的真形状，contract.name 保 xaihi.node-host（ADR-0010 自称；现读整棵搬来的树里没有一条组件读这个名字，只有 frontendHost.ts:168 转发与两条测试按它比），差异逐条写进类型注释；接缝上谁要一份真 NodeHostApi 由装配侧显式决定，不在折叠层用 as 抹平。判据跟着加第 ⑨ 条（getNodeConfig 的读数不许含 namespaces，也不许冒出 path 键），两份阳性对照各只红 ⑨：一份回整份 describe()、一份带编出来的 path。加这条时自己撞出第二个错：⑧ 的 groupOf 按名字第一段归组，把 getNodeConfig 判成\"没人兑现却回了 resolved\"，于是改归组（getNodeConfig→config、getData/patchData→state），⑧ 一条没放宽。读数：check-types 的 own 桶我这批=0（node-host-bridge.ts 从 9 条红到 0；整包剩 2 条在搬运 lane 的 src/client/workspace.tsx:262 与 tests/workspace-app-render.spec.tsx:2，没碰）、vitest 四个 spec rc=0（32 条，扁名那条钉 Object.keys(read) 逐字是 config 一项且值里含 nodeState）、check-nodeface-live --self-check rc=0（11 份手写对照）、活体 rc=0（九条判据 + 覆盖表 12 条，rev 867372cfb0d8，getNodeConfig resolved 且读的是那一格）、rspack realm 与 nodeface 各 rc=0、check-realm-live rc=0（四条，工作台清单 → 已接线（0 个））。收尾：core.uiBundleDir 留 dist-realm，隔离宿主与无窗口浏览器都停，port3199=0 port9339=0。","tree":{"sha":"25d6ca47ca10d8e0f9445014eadae329abff75ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/25d6ca47ca10d8e0f9445014eadae329abff75ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/8f79d7d1e9e3d495e97f9e6115b5d97b1b386de6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com