ype":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/d49d39bbe7b88687c50186019ea6c385e10a931a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:09:05Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:09:05Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"runner 那一格从\"待办\"改成量出来的拦路，宿主可用性也变成读得回的一格。先量：把 agents 加进 OPTIONAL_SERVICES，跑隔离宿主读到 commands=…,execute,find,list,register,… 与 agents=create,ctx,currentInitiator,disposeInitiators,enter,…（两侧都在，/xaihi/debug.json 的 services 里因此多了 agents 这一格，verbose 那行打印真实成员）；再读 0.2.0-rc.2 的声明：dsh-commands/lib/types/index.d.ts 是 execute(agent: Agent, line, submittedAttachments, signal)，服务端同样要先有一个 Agent，而注释写着调用方是\"human-facing UI surface dispatching a human-typed line\"；程序化那侧只有 dsh-agent 的 createAgent(ownerCtx, CreateAgentOptions)，其 meta 注释自己写着\"This is durable session data\"⇒ 接它等于让界面上每按一次\"运行\"就在使用者的会话库里留一条真会话（会话按 cwd 落 $DSH_HOME/sessions/<cwd-slug>/，换 profile 不换库，这条本机早就量过）。所以不自开那个口：HOST_REFUSAL_REASONS.runner 现在说的是这个原因并点名提案 P1，P1 里补了\"服务端那一侧也量过了\"整段与最小改法第 4 条（一个非持久的执行上下文）；packages/core/tests/host-routes.spec.ts 一条用例钉住那句必须含 P1 与\"会话\"、且不许退回旧措辞\"没接到这条路由上\"；discover.spec 钉 agents 缺席读成 false、在场读成 true。归属点名：packages/core/src/index.ts 里那条讲 ADR-0018 的头注释 hunk（txn:f）是搬运 lane 的，这次没提交它，只提交我那条 OPTIONAL_SERVICES 的 hunk（txn:d）。同批全仓 core test:unit 有 2 条红，都在 tests/routes.spec.ts 的 uiBundleHandler 那两条——routes.ts mtime 06:04:47Z、routes.spec.ts 06:05:21Z，正是他们此刻在写的两个文件（but status 里 loz / spz），按失败测试名做差集不是我引入的；我这批三个 spec 文件 vitest rc=0（37 条）、core build rc=0、投递两侧 cmp 逐字相同、core tsc 只剩那 1 条错也在他们的 routes.spec.ts 里。收尾：从隔离 profile 撤掉我这轮加的 verbose（不给别的 lane 增加日志量），uiBundleDir 恢复 dist-realm，3199 / 9339 监听数各 0。","tree":{"sha":"40a298c884b3b55f6adc754d59ebd503df02edc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/40a298c884b3b55f6adc754d59ebd503df02edc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/d49d39bbe7b88687c50186019ea6c385e10a931a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/d49d39bbe7b88687c50186019ea6c385e10a931a","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKGQ0OWQzOWJiZTdiODg2ODdjNTAxODYwMTllYTZjMzg1ZTEwYTkzMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/f6b48a45c2028a104082109835ea4fbb1235bc6f","sha":"f6b48a45c2028a104082109835ea4fbb1235bc6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/f6b48a45c2028a104082109835ea4fbb1235bc6f"}],"sha":"d49d39bbe7b88687c50186019ea6c385e10a931a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/d49d39bbe7b88687c50186019ea6c385e10a931a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/f6b48a45c2028a104082109835ea4fbb1235bc6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:08:32Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:08:32Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"ADR-0018：文档产物的地址固定的是入口，不是哈希（HMR 那条能力保留）\n\n改了什么：\n- 我上一版把 rev 冻在启动时（`createUiRevFreezer`），使用者一句「保留 HMR 能力」把它否了，\n  这一笔按否掉的方向重做：`packages/core/src/index.ts` 的 `uiSource.rev()` 回到每条请求现算，\n  冻结器与它的判据整块删掉（不留半套）。\n- `packages/core/src/routes.ts`：`uiBundleHandler` 自己记一份\"这个进程发出过哪些 rev\"\n  （窗 10 分钟、上限 16 条）。被新构建超过之后旧地址仍解析得出来，但那批产物从 `immutable`\n  降级成 `no-store`，文档壳 boot 里念一句 `revState:\"superseded\"`；当前 rev 自己不合 12 位\n  十六进制时仍然 404 说 `current unreadable`（只比 `requested !== rev` 不够，两边可以相等，\n  然后 200 一份什么都装不出来的 HTML——这条老闸原样保住）。\n- 裸路径 302 那条（上一笔 `ons`）在这套设计里从\"补丁\"变成\"正题\"：固定的是 `/xaihi/ui/`。\n\n为什么：症状是一次页面加载跨两个 rev——HTML 按 A 出门，浏览器回头要 A 的 chunk 时目录已经\n重建到 B，整批 404，而 Chrome 对 404 的 text/plain 报成「Refused to apply style … (text/plain)」，\n看着像 MIME 坏了（`.css` 在表里一直是 text/css，`routes.ts:25`）。实测读数：同一分钟内\n`ui.rev` 从 8d4ed81e8393 变成 687d583bc830。冻哈希能治症状，代价是\"改完产物刷新就吃到\"这条\n开发回路本身，所以治的是\"发出去过的地址会腐烂\"这一半。不做文件快照：那等于在 DSH 之外再起\n一份产物存储。\n\n判据：`packages/core/tests/routes.spec.ts` 三条新的（发出过 A → 换到 B → A 的产物 200 且 no-store、\n新 rev 仍 immutable、HTML 永远 no-store、`revState` 只落在被超过那一代），阳性对照两条\n（从没发出过的 rev 必须 404；注入 clock 推到 11 分钟后同一地址必须重新 404，证明窗口有界）。\n读数：`pnpm --filter @hibernalglow/xaihi-core test:unit` rc=0、104 passed（+3）；\n`build` rc=0 且产物 `lib/routes.js` 里读得到 `superseded`/`revState`/`REV_GRACE_CAP` 三串。\n没跑：真宿主里的宽限行为——在跑那台 3199 用的是启动时组合好的模块表，改产物要重启宿主才算数，\n而那台正被另一侧用着，所以这条留给下一次重启后按 curl 读回。","tree":{"sha":"609e0c40ccb27c8e37c8302fb749ce1b3b4d4c12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/609e0c40ccb27c8e37c8302fb749ce1b3b4d4c12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/f6b48a45c2028a104082109835ea4fbb1235bc6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/f6b48a45c2028a104082109835ea4fbb1235bc6f","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKGY2YjQ4YTQ1YzIwMjhhMTA0MDgyMTA5ODM1ZWE0ZmJiMTIzNWJjNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/a6905564214399d29c32e1d8ceed4f36a657181f","sha":"a6905564214399d29c32e1d8ceed4f36a657181f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/a6905564214399d29c32e1d8ceed4f36a657181f"}],"sha":"f6b48a45c2028a104082109835ea4fbb1235bc6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/f6b48a45c2028a104082109835ea4fbb1235bc6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/a6905564214399d29c32e1d8ceed4f36a657181f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:54:52Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:54:52Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"路线 (A) 第一次服务了一个真节点组件：节点界面读的是带 compId 的扁名（host.getData / patchData / config?.get / downloadText，contract/src/index.ts:507-540 那份 @deprecated 兼容层），而桥给的是九组分组面——components/modules/hostApi.ts:320-345 已经在折这份扁表面，但它折的是本进程那套（Xiranite 的 configRpcClient 与 store，正是 ADR-0013 明令不接的通路）。新层 packages/ui-host/src/client/node-host-bridge.ts 的 toNodeHostApi 做同一条折叠、换个来源：分组按 getter 转发、扁名照 hostApi 那份映射折、compId 丢弃（那是这一格卡的身份，与节点不是同一层），不造桥没给的任何能力。验证载体 src/document/node-face-entry.tsx + rspack.nodeface.mjs 出 dist-nodeface（.gitignore 的 dist-* 那条已覆盖）。我自己那条错当场量到：第一版写 { ...host }，而 XaihiNodeHost.env 是\"没快照就抛 refused\"的取值器 ⇒ 折叠本身在装配时就抛，真浏览器里的症状是协商板一切正常而 #xaihi-ui-root 空着（bodyLen 1134、__XAIHI_NODEFACE__ 不在）；改成逐个 getter 之后 tests/node-host-bridge.spec.ts 四条过，减法跑测把折叠改回展开 ⇒ 四条全红，报的就是那句 BridgeError: refused: 宿主没随握手带环境快照。实机七条（无窗口 Chromium + 隔离宿主 3199 + 真 DSH 设置服务）：data-xaihi-nodeface=host=bridge node=xaihi-linedup granted=[contract,state,config] 且 linedup 的界面真画出来（DOM 36,908 B、它自己的按钮 复制保留结果/清空状态/粘贴源文本/运行过滤 与 textarea 在场）；host.getData 从对面读回落盘那份 marks；组件级 patchData 同步即可读；第一次 flush 被 expectedRevision 挡下（同一份文档里 realm 自己那条 state 探测在写同一格，那是围栏在正常工作不是断路），第二次写 syncError:null 且标记落进 profiles/xaihi/cordis.patch.yml（realm 自己那条写在同一文件里，run@ 命中 2 行）。归属点名：packages/ui-host/src/client/node-mount.tsx 里那份 makeNodeHostApi 是搬运 lane 的本地折叠（state 用内存卡、config 故意不给），与我这层不同来源，我没动它也没替它决定；交给他们的落点只有一行——useNodeHostApi 那份分组面的来源换成 toNodeHostApi(createDocumentHost({ bridge, state, workspace }))，组件与判据都不改。读数：那四个 spec 文件 vitest rc=0（33 条）、check-doc-bridge --dist packages/ui-host/dist-nodeface rc=0、rspack build -c rspack.nodeface.mjs rc=0（874,180 B）、ui-host 类型检出的 10 条错全在搬运 lane 的文件里（我这批 0 条）。收尾把 core.uiBundleDir 恢复成 dist-realm，3199 / 9339 监听数各 0。","tree":{"sha":"ef2e5a26eb7eedcf965850ef60c0754c20d753d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/ef2e5a26eb7eedcf965850ef60c0754c20d753d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/a6905564214399d29c32e1d8ceed4f36a657181f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/a6905564214399d29c32e1d8ceed4f36a657181f","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKGE2OTA1NTY0MjE0Mzk5ZDI5YzMyZTFkOGNlZWQ0ZjM2YTY1NzE4MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/16eef56de29da4370b54ceb83bd40e6463280214","sha":"16eef56de29da4370b54ceb83bd40e6463280214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/16eef56de29da4370b54ceb83bd40e6463280214"}],"sha":"a6905564214399d29c32e1d8ceed4f36a657181f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/a6905564214399d29c32e1d8ceed4f36a657181f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/16eef56de29da4370b54ceb83bd40e6463280214/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:54:33Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:54:33Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"/xaihi/ui 的裸路径改成 302 到当前 rev：那条哈希每次重建都换，人不该回清单抄\n\n现场读到的（2026-10-07 使用者原话：\"3199 不会自动跳转啊\"）：`ui.rev` 在两次请求之间从\n8d4ed81e8393 变成 687d583bc830（那侧正在重建 dist-nodeface，rev 是按产物目录现算的），\n于是手里那份哈希 URL 整批 404 —— Chrome 对 404 的 text/plain 响应报的是\n「Refused to apply style ... MIME type (text/plain)」，看着像 MIME 坏了，其实是没这个文件。\n`MIME` 表里 `.css` 一直是 text/css（`packages/core/src/routes.ts:25`），这条不是 MIME 的账。\n\n改了什么：`uiBundleHandler` 在 rev 可用时把 `/xaihi/ui`、`/xaihi/ui/`、`/xaihi/ui/index.html`\n302 到 `/xaihi/ui/<当前 rev>/index.html`，`?node=` 带过去（不合形状的丢掉，由目标页自己报 400），\n响应 `no-store`。三条边界写在注释里：rev 不可用不跳、写到 rev 没写文件名的仍算缺段留 404、\n被缓存的 302 会让这条修复下一次失效。\n\n判据：`packages/core/tests/routes.spec.ts` 加两条（三种裸路径逐个断 302 + Location + no-store；\n`?node=` 保留与越形状丢弃），阳性对照一条（rev 是注入串时不许出现 Location 头、目录没配时仍是 503）。\n同块里那条\"缺段被拒\"的老尺原本把 `/xaihi/ui/` 也钉成 404 —— 那是当年的 UX 决定而不是安全闸\n（同块守的是穿越与 405，两条都没动），按新理由改成断 302 并写明改判依据。\n\n读数：pnpm --filter @hibernalglow/xaihi-core test:unit rc=0，100 passed（原 97 + 新 3）；\npnpm --filter @hibernalglow/xaihi-core build rc=0。没跑：真宿主里的 302 —— 在跑的那台 3199 用的是\n启动时组合好的模块表，改产物要重启宿主才算数，而那台现在正被另一侧用着（清单 rev 一分钟里换了两次），\n所以这条留给下一次重启后按 curl -i 读回。","tree":{"sha":"f6eb548565286ca501baf2473a20dc2773fc1ae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/f6eb548565286ca501baf2473a20dc2773fc1ae5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/16eef56de29da4370b54ceb83bd40e6463280214","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/16eef56de29da4370b54ceb83bd40e6463280214","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDE2ZWVmNTZkZTI5ZGE0MzcwYjU0Y2ViODNiZDQwZTY0NjMyODAyMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/5478bb9c8ef672ffeb534df602c521573246093e","sha":"5478bb9c8ef672ffeb534df602c521573246093e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/5478bb9c8ef672ffeb534df602c521573246093e"}],"sha":"16eef56de29da4370b54ceb83bd40e6463280214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/16eef56de29da4370b54ceb83bd40e6463280214"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/5478bb9c8ef672ffeb534df602c521573246093e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:39:33Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:39:33Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"装载点这条退化搬进了产品界面，判据只留一份：detectHostMount 与那对字面串住进 packages/core/src/host-routes.ts，清单的 ui 那格因此带 hostMount=present|absent|unreadable（旧宿主没发就当没说，不猜 present）；界面那一格在缺席时不换面——iframe 保留，上方补一句 data-xaihi-host-mount=absent（用一个诊断把能用的界面顶掉是我第一版的冲动，那样使用者既看不见工作台也看不见为什么）。实机两向都在无窗口 Chromium 上对着隔离宿主取：dist-ui ⇒ 清单 absent 且那句在屏上、iframe.src 仍是 23d316f7d813 那份；换 dist-realm ⇒ 清单 present 且那句消失、iframe 还在。fetchSurface 是重建对象不是透传，第一版漏了按值收这个字段，jsdom 里只渲染出 iframe——服务端说了而界面没听见，现在两条例子分别钉住\"穿过来\"与\"认不出的按没说\"。scripts/check-doc-bridge.mjs 改成 import 那份生产判据的 CLI 外壳，self-check 多一条 lib 与 src 不许漂移；这条对照第一次跑是无效的（perl 不带 /g 只替换首处，而首处在我写的源码注释里，数组没动照绿），扰动落到数组那一行才红并点名 lib=[\"…\",\"host-XX\"] src=[\"…\",\"host-http\"]。tsdown 的 entry 是显式清单，src/host-routes.ts 不写进去就没有 lib/host-routes.js，症状是脚本一跑 ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND（与当年 src/routes.ts 同一条理由，这条教训第二次命中）。装配两条：plugin:install rc=1（别人删掉的那个包在 bundleManifest 里炸）但拷贝确实落地了，判投递只比 sha（client.js 两侧 cf865dcd 一致）；客户端表 boot 时组合⇒换了 client.js 必须重启宿主，第一次探针没有那句话就是这个。读数：core test:unit rc=0（97 条，含新增 4 条）、ui-host 那两个文件 25 条 rc=0、tsc 在 core 与 node-sdk 各 0 条，ui-host 那 10 条全在搬运 lane 的文件里（src/actions/icons.ts×5、../api/src/client.ts×4、../logging/src/jsonl.ts×1），我这批文件 0 条。收尾 3199 / 9339 监听数各 0、headless chrome 残留 0；带令牌入口只从这条隔离宿主自己的 stdout 取，没用使用者的凭证。","tree":{"sha":"013a6371fcb14cd99876297d3f69827b3e202364","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/013a6371fcb14cd99876297d3f69827b3e202364"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/5478bb9c8ef672ffeb534df602c521573246093e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/5478bb9c8ef672ffeb534df602c521573246093e","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDU0NzhiYjljOGVmNjcyZm