385,125 B、xaihi.bridge/1 与 host-http 两个串在 135 份 .js 里命中 0，而 build:document 两种状态都 rc=0——差的 28 KB 就是整座桥，症状既不在构建期也不在界面上，所以判据只能落在产物字节上。新尺 scripts/check-doc-bridge.mjs 带三条阳性对照（都在=绿、只留契约号=红、目录里只有 .css=红），并拿真产物做减法跑过（复制那份 1.4 MB 换掉两串 ⇒ rc=1 且点名入口要调用 realm 装载）；故意没接进 pnpm test，它读的是搬运 lane 正在重写的入口。同一轮另一条假绿：dist-realm 被整份拷成 dist-ui 的副本（两边 sha256 逐字节相同 d395978cd3b0 / 826691b63cace，145 文件里 135 份 .js），rm -rf 后按 rspack.realm.mjs 重建才回到 1 份 .js / 218,366 B。live-check 的 Q 段当场被抓出两条自己的错：判据源从探针专属板换成两份入口都有的协商板，而第一版 text.slice(0, 900) 把要等的两行截掉导致恒红；顺序改成先等板再写，否则脚本与页面自己那半边抢同一个 nodeState 格，板上落成「刷后=失败 … changed since it was read (expected revision 1, now 2)」——那是 expectedRevision 围栏在正常工作，不是路由不通。改完把判据代码从 live-check.mjs 原文抽取再求值，在冷加载真页面里 7 条 OK + 1 条 Electron 侧 SKIP。纠正一条此前写反的装配事实：uiBundleDir 换目录要重启宿主，改目录里的文件才不用（rev 请求期现算，亲眼看着 e21b08875b29 → 3532c60b771d）。main.tsx 那一格不覆盖（搬运那刀 12:54 与 13:05 两次重写，第二次连我补回去的两行一起没了），撞车与后果记进 ADR-0011 与 desktop/README。收尾读数 3199 / 9339 / 19387 / 9229 监听数各 0，chrome-headless-shell 残留 0。","tree":{"sha":"2f4077f993b8efae2e52dba8aecbb08eec011c48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/2f4077f993b8efae2e52dba8aecbb08eec011c48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/cffc93b55aa0cbe3686c6e265db3bf4b5e5a3450","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/