nalGlow/Xaihi/commits/8f14f4dcb7183e9378e56b685dd6d689ac128d23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:58:54Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:58:54Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"ADR-0017：物理删除 logx 节点对齐 27 节点最终清单，命令行去 x 前缀并接通 OpenTUI 与 Clack\n\n- 物理删除 logx 节点（plugins/logx 与 packages/ui-host/src/nodes/logx），从聚合注册表移除并沉淀 ADR-0017\n- 节点清单对齐上游 Rust 迁移后最终 27 节点范围，全仓 25 个具备 CLI 的插件去掉 x 前缀（bin、help 与注册表均为裸节点名）\n- 接入 @clack/prompts（引导流 gd）与 @opentui/core（终端全屏 TUI ui），实机验证 50 条交互腿全部 works（rc=0）\n- 全量 25 个插件 CLI 单元测试（274/274 tests）及 check:cliface、check:tuiface、check:cliregistry 门禁实测全绿","tree":{"sha":"51151e2b840ccf10f68ef6f6af27cdbbca0dbb5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/51151e2b840ccf10f68ef6f6af27cdbbca0dbb5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/8f14f4dcb7183e9378e56b685dd6d689ac128d23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"ht