e":"step-4 补上这一刀的三段式记录，并把内存保护那一格登记进设置落点的尺\n\n改了什么：docs/stages/step-4.md 追加一节（改了什么/为什么/与 DSH API 的关系带 file:line/后续扩展），\npackages/core/tests/settings-row.spec.ts 的落点清单从 [nodeState, nodeUi] 扩到带\nnodeMemoryProtection，并给它补一条同形的阳性对照（把那行的 .volatile() 摘掉，尺必须看不见这一格）。\n\n为什么：那条尺是\"过桥的写必须落在某一格声明过的 volatile 字段上\"的唯一automated 落点检查\n（2026-10-06 真浏览器里量到过缺它时稳定撞 DSH 第二道写闸）。新加的这一格若不登记进去，\n就是又一处\"两侧各自自洽、合起来读不回\"的分叉。\n\n读数：pnpm --filter @hibernalglow/xaihi-core test:unit rc=0、93 passed（settings-row 那 4 条在内）。\n界面侧的判据与装配线在上一条提交（wsv）里，那侧三个文件 17 passed、build:document rc=0。","tree":{"sha":"b41ad06e46e9df1c0ceca0bc4eeac5033a6f5c71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/b41ad06e46e9df1c0ceca0bc4eeac5033a6f5c71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/6c358548d2e32f583696d3d38af3661cebfd6d11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/6c358548d2e32f583696d3d38af3661cebfd6d11","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDZjMzU4NTQ4ZDJlMzJmNTgzNjk2ZDNkMzhhZjM2NjFjZWJmZDZkMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/87e69020eefa64e397787c3e66b5ddfd183dbc65","sha":"87e69020eefa64e397787c3e66b5ddfd183dbc65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/87e69020eefa64e397787c3e66b5ddfd183dbc65"}],"sha":"6c358548d2e32f583696d3d38af3661cebfd6d11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/6c358548d2e32f583696d3d38af3661cebfd6d11"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/87e69020eefa64e397787c3e66b5ddfd183dbc65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:55:19Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:55:19Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"设置面这一段接到真桥的包法上：装配点落地，写完靠回读确认\n\n三段里\"UI 接到那个代理\"这最后一厘米，顺带修掉一条会把每次正常写都报成失败的错。\n\n- `src/backend/localBackendControl.ts`：`ConfigFace.save` 的回包**不再假设带着值**。\n  读 `packages/node-sdk/src/bridge-shell.ts` 的 `config.save` 分支量到：那条桥的写应答是特意\n  投影成 `{ revision }` 的（同文件记着\"写 `xaihi-core` 时整份命名空间视图带着 `nodeState`，\n  200 KiB 的写落盘成功却回 too-large\"）。上一版把\"回包里读到这一格\"当成功判据，\n  真桥下面每一次正常写都会抛\"写之后没在回包里读到\"。现在改成**写完再读一次**确认，\n  版本号优先取写应答里那条，取不到再取回读那条。\n- 新增 `configFaceFromDocumentConfig()`：把 host 的 `getUi()`（回 `{ ns, value, revision }`，\n  见同文件的 `readNamespace`）与 `saveUi()`（回 `{ revision }`）拆成这一格要的两片；\n  包法认不出时把 config 报成 null，让读那一侧明说\"读不到这一格\"，不把形状不明的东西当 Config 用。\n- 装配点：`src/backend/settings-face.ts` 的 `attachSettingsFace(bridge, node)`（握手没落地或\n  握手没带 `settingsNs` 时**什么都不装**——不拿节点短名也不拿 `xaihi-core` 兜底，那是把\n  \"没接线\"伪装成一次合法写入），`src/document/settings-face.ts` 的 `mountSettingsFace()` 起 realm\n  并在有界重试里等握手，`main.tsx` 加四行调它。搬运树里那格设置界面因此第一次真打到设置面。\n  这一层的 `workspace`/`state` 是空壳并在注释里写明理由；等搬运那刀的\"工作台装载 host 的那一层\"\n  落地，这两行的调用点应挪过去换成那层给的 `host`（`docs/adr/0011-*.md` 路线 (A) 那行记的就是这件事）。\n- 判据：`tests/local-backend-control.spec.ts` 从 9 条到 12 条（新加\"回包只带版本号也算成功\"\n  这条正是上面那个错的回归、\"写完回读时那一格不见了按没确认处理\"、适配层真包法/假包法两条）；\n  新 `tests/settings-face.spec.ts` 3 条钉\"没握手不装 / 没带命名空间不装 / 装好后读写真的过\n  `config.getUi`/`config.saveUi` 且整份里别人的字段一个不少\"。假桥的包法照真那侧抄，\n  别的动词一律抛错，防止判据悄悄多用一条面。\n\n读数（都是现跑）：`vitest run` 那三个文件 rc=0、17 passed；`pnpm run build:document` rc=0 且\n`mountSettingsFace`/`attachSettingsFace` 在 `dist-ui/main.js` 里（不是只编过没进产物）；\n`pnpm run build` rc=0，`check-client-bundle` 绿。两份 tsc 里我这几个文件零条错\n（own 程序 1318、ported 222，是搬运那侧的账；我特意量过加不加我那条判据读数逐字相同，\n所以没把别人的 document 文件登记进我的编译面）。没跑的：全仓 `pnpm test`（别人在飞，不可归因）、\n以及起真宿主后的上屏验证——那需要 `pnpm host` 起 DSH 再开 `/xaihi/ui/<rev>/index.html`。","tree":{"sha":"aa1ea2ea0a8cc0989b6ccfc615e8834d6d8a1cc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/aa1ea2ea0a8cc0989b6ccfc615e8834d6d8a1cc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/87e69020eefa64e397787c3e66b5ddfd183dbc65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/87e69020eefa64e397787c3e66b5ddfd183dbc65","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDg3ZTY5MDIwZWVmYTY0ZTM5Nzc4N2MzZTY2YjVkZGZkMTgzZGJjNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/321d76f82e344439c6440fcea2c13492ec693071","sha":"321d76f82e344439c6440fcea2c13492ec693071","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/321d76f82e344439c6440fcea2c13492ec693071"}],"sha":"87e69020eefa64e397787c3e66b5ddfd183dbc65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/87e69020eefa64e397787c3e66b5ddfd183dbc65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/321d76f82e344439c6440fcea2c13492ec693071/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:51:00Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:51:00Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"路线 (A) 的验收搬到无窗口浏览器里跑通了，并记下这条验证渠道本身：Playwright 缓存里的 chrome-headless-shell 加 --virtual-time-budget=15000 --dump-dom 打隔离开发宿主的 /xaihi/ui/<rev>/index.html?node=xaihi-linedup，DOM 里读回 data-xaihi-host-roundtrip=\"crossed\" 与 caps=contract,state,config，板上写着 config.getUi 从对面拿到的 ns/revision、state 往返 crossed=true 写侧读侧都 ok，以及没给的每一组带原因。浏览器侧还第一次有了负控：?node=Not-A-Node 连文档都出不来，对面回 node must be a manifest id matching [a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}——与桥上 state.* 同一份 NODE_ID_PATTERN，两道门一份词表这件事在浏览器里也读得回来。结论写进 README：以后凡是「文档 + 自己服务面」这条链的改动先走 headless，桌面时间窗只留给壳特有的那一格。跑完宿主与浏览器全停，9229/19387/3199 监听数各 0，无 GUI 进程残留（判残留用 [D]evelopment 这种带字符类的模式，否则 rg 会自匹配）。","tree":{"sha":"4d127f0960c72b933f02ffbe95db31131e225f99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/4d127f0960c72b933f02ffbe95db31131e225f99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/321d76f82e344439c6440fcea2c13492ec693071","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/321d76f82e344439c6440fcea2c13492ec693071","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDMyMWQ3NmY4MmUzNDQ0MzljNjQ0MGZjZWEyYzEzNDkyZWM2OTMwNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/1d5626339d7203aec7af48f85d4750f9f8135aa8","sha":"1d5626339d7203aec7af48f85d4750f9f8135aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/1d5626339d7203aec7af48f85d4750f9f8135aa8"}],"sha":"321d76f82e344439c6440fcea2c13492ec693071","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/321d76f82e344439c6440fcea2c13492ec693071"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/1d5626339d7203aec7af48f85d4750f9f8135aa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:48:30Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:48:30Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"Q 段跟上这块板：等它从 pending 落地（页内轮询 12 秒上限）再断 roundtrip=crossed、能力里含 config/state，读的是产物里的板而不是脚本造的对象。无 GUI 侧另记一条硬证据：起隔离开发宿主、按 manifest 的 rev 取 /xaihi/ui/<rev>/main.js（218,366 B），data-xaihi-host-roundtrip 与 data-xaihi-host-capabilities 各 1 处、config.getUi 那句在——发出去的产物确实带上了这个消费点（源码里有定义≠落进产物那条老规矩，这次连「服务侧那份」一起取）。跑完把宿主停掉，3199 监听数 0。","tree":{"sha":"6fb3376d476360ea59196da094c2595e7f288773","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/6fb3376d476360ea59196da094c2595e7f288773"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/1d5626339d7203aec7af48f85d4750f9f8135aa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/1d5626339d7203aec7af48f85d4750f9f8135aa8","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDFkNTYyNjMzOWQ3MjAzYWVjN2FmNDhmODVkNDc1MGY5ZjgxMzVhYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/74bb04deb8bdb6d498b54a5444d20c49bc645baf","sha":"74bb04deb8bdb6d498b54a5444d20c49bc645baf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/74bb04deb8bdb6d498b54a5444d20c49bc645baf"}],"sha":"1d5626339d7203aec7af48f85d4750f9f8135aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/1d5626339d7203aec7af48f85d4750f9f8135aa8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/74bb04deb8bdb6d498b54a5444d20c49bc645baf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:47:28Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:47:28Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"节点内存保护这一格接到 DSH 的设置面：三段里的第二、三段落地\n\n按 ADR-0013，这一格的数据通路整块换掉，界面本身逐行搬上游那 303 行那一版。\n\n- `packages/ui-host/src/backend/localBackendControl.ts`：不再打 Xiranite 的 HTTP 后端，\n  只做\"读整份 Config → 只换 nodeMemoryProtection 这一格 → 带回刚读到的 revision 写回去\"。\n  先读后写是刻意的，否则这一格会把 verbose/uiBundleDir/nodeState/nodeUi 抹掉。\n  返回形状保持上游的 `{ supported, settings }` 且失败靠抛，因此搬来的组件与搬来的那份\n  mock（ThemeSettings.test.tsx:124-133）调用面一个字都不用改；多出来的一条 `reason`\n  用来分\"面还没装配\"和\"服务端没声明这一格\"。设置面由 `setNodeMemoryProtectionFace()`\n  在装配点注入——文档侧的 createDocumentHost 还没落地，所以不猜单例。\n- `NodeMemoryProtectionSettings.tsx`：真正的搬运（卡片、POLICY_FIELDS 的区间与步进、\n  StatusMessage、校验时机、按钮禁用条件、i18n 全走 `settings:memoryProtection.*`，\n  这些键在本仓词典 zh.json/en.json 各自 720-762 早就齐了，不需要新写句子）。\n  没装配时显示退化而不装数值（ADR-0011）。上一版我写的是照类名重写的那一路，已作废。\n- 默认数字是本包的镜像，真源是 core 那一行；`tests/core-defaults-parity.spec.ts`\n  从 core 源码文本现读四个 `.default(…)` 逐条比对，阳性对照是喂给它一份改过一个数字的\n  文本副本并断解析器读到那个改值（证明这把尺看得见漂移）。\n- `tests/local-backend-control.spec.ts` 9 条：读/没装配/没声明、整份表里别的字段一个不能少、\n  版本号默认带走刚读到的那条、显式给的优先、形状不合时桥上零痕迹、冲突留住服务端那句并\n  标成 settings_conflict、读不回整份时拒写、回包里没这一格时按\"没确认\"处理。\n\n读数：`vitest run` 那两个文件 rc=0（11 passed）；`tsc -p tsconfig.ported.json --noEmit` 与\n`-p tsconfig.json --noEmit` 里我这四个文件零条错（全量基线 ported=225、own 程序 976 行错，\n都是搬运那侧的账）；`build:document` rc=0 且 `settings:memoryProtection.title` 与\n`memory-protection` 确实在 `dist-ui/4196.js` 里（不是只编过没进产物）；`pnpm run build` rc=0，\n`check-client-bundle` 绿。没跑的：全仓 `pnpm test`（别人在飞的搬运文件不可归因），\n以及界面实机（文档侧装配点还没把面递进来，所以现在上屏只能到\"退化可读\"那一档）。\n另外 `localBackendControl.ts` 与 `Webview2ExperimentsPanel.tsx` 曾被记成\"待提交删除而\n消费点还活着\"，这一批把前者的新形状补上了；后者仍是别人的账。","tree":{"sha":"b951e5650f12f7702ef3e9e268bd01ec3087c13a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/b951e5650f12f7702ef3e9e268bd01ec3087c13a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/74bb04deb8bdb6d498b54a5444d20c49bc645baf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/74bb04deb8bdb6d498b54a5444d20c49bc645baf","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDc0YmIwNGRlYjhiZGI2ZDQ5OGI1NGE1NDQ0ZDIwYzQ5YmM2NDViYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/ba4d771fab71e4d1d8d94581d5a3a6f286f6c26b","sha":"ba4d771fab71e4d1d8d94581d5a3a6f286f6c26b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/ba4d771fab71e4d1d8d94581d5a3a6f286f6c26b"}],"sha":"74bb04deb8bdb6d498b54a5444d20c49bc645baf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/74bb04deb8bdb6d498b54a5444d20c49bc645baf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/ba4d771fab71e4d1d8d94581d5a3a6f286f6c26b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:47:20Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:47:20Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"给路线 (A) 一个真进产物的消费点：runHostRoundTrip 在 realm 装载器握手之后跑一次九组 host 面的往返，板子上念得出能力、config.getUi 从对面拿到的 ns 与 revision、state 写后读回的 crossed，以及没给的每一组带一句原因（决定 4 要的就是这个可读回，不是控制台）。纯数据那一格外故意不碰 DOM：判据与界面读同一份，起不了浏览器也能复算。配套 4 条测两侧都是生产代码（createDocumentBridge + createShellBridge，只假 DSH 设置面）：通了的那条断到对面 rows 里真有标记；阳性对照拿掉设置面 ⇒ 必须报 refused 且写侧读侧各留原因，不许绿；未握手报 version:null + not-ready 而不是抛；对面回的格子缺 ns 报 bad-shape 不猜值。rspack.realm.mjs rc=0，产物里搜得到 data-xaihi-host-roundtrip 与 data-xaihi-host-capabilities。现读 ui-host 全套 41 个文件过、2 个文件红，红的是搬运 lane 自己的 node-mount.spec.tsx 与 workspace-app-render.spec.tsx（按导入图证：两个文件都不 import 我改的东西）。","tree":{"sha":"f5da48803e9d218c21d823b1a667220baadb2058","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/f5da48803e9d218c21d823b1a667220baadb2058"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/ba4d771fab71e4d1d8d94581d5a3a6f286f6c26b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/ba4d771fab71e4d1d8d94581d5a3a6f286f6c26b","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKGJhNGQ3NzFmYWI3MWU0ZDFkOGQ5NDU4MWQ1YTNhNmYyODZmNmMyNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/1135cd6aebfa798e2444e8b057a9f8f31a4b940b","sha":"1135cd6aebfa798e2444e8b057a9f8f31a4b940b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/1135cd6aebfa798e2444e8b057a9f8f31a4b940b"}],"sha":"ba4d771fab71e4d1d8d94581d5a3a6f286f6c26b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/ba4d771fab71e4d1d8d94581d5a3a6f286f6c26b"},{"author":{"avata