om/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/f015987a94e4db9e63eaf1fcd6ec918bf1d0aab2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:55:37Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:55:37Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"① 的两条边分类定档：都不是 proposal，一条等锁落定钉版安装、一条催 lane 搬 56 行\n\n取证结果写进 ADR-0009：\n@xyflow/react 上游 pin 是 ^12.11.2 且上游没有 pnpm-lock.yaml 可抄，registry 现读\nlatest=12.12.0、^12.11.2 会浮上去 ⇒ 要装就钉 12.11.2（上游代码照这版写），消费者只有\nmarku 的 WorkflowEditor.tsx 一处（上游同样只这一处）。不现在装是因为 pnpm-lock.yaml 正\nMM（lane 在重生成），任何 pnpm add 会重写 importers，而这台机有\"一条死 file: 行让每次\ninstall 全红\"的先例，红了归因会算到我头上。\nclassf/deletion-history 是纯移植欠账：本仓 plugins/classf/src 零命中（不是换了形状），\n上游那份 56 行、两个导出，只拖 ./blacklist.js（本仓已有）与 csv-parse——而 csv-parse 只\n声明在 packages/shared（那份 @xiranite/* 按实测不能当 workspace 依赖引）。我不打桩：\n空返回会让历史分析面板\"画得出但算错\"，与拒绝给 sleept 的 duration/interaction 打桩同一条纪律。\n两条都还活着：marku 17D+17 新份、classf 11D+11 新份，新份仍各引着这两处。","tree":{"sha":"1beb889898296d16f00c4173b5dbff93997e2661","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/1beb889898296d16f00c4173b5dbff93997e2661"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/f015987a94e4db9e63eaf1fcd6ec918bf1d0aab2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}",