w/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/dfe4eeb0f22dab4effd31f6597f2216c2b757c34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:45:01Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:45:01Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"补上真正该记的两行，并顶掉我上次插错的那一份\n\n上一条提交里我把行文本读错了文件（该读 row3 读了 row2），于是\n「两条空缺」那行被插了两遍、而「出处换成我们自己那一行」那行根本没进去。\n这次按内容把重复份顶掉、把两行都放回该在的位置（顺序：浏览器读数 → 出处更正 → 复验完成），\n并断言三份各只出现一次。\n新增的两行内容是：(1) 出处为什么从 ctx.fiber.entry.options.id 换成 STATE_SETTINGS_NS\n（那一行刻意不声明 Config ⇒ 不可配置的行不进 describe()，广播它等于每条设置读写稳定失败），\n以及为什么补在 core 而不是给 xaihi-ui 补 schema（不为这一格去动别人在重写的 pnpm-lock.yaml）；\n(2) 复验读数：ready.settingsNs=\"xaihi-core\"、getUi 的 valueKeys 含 nodeUi、\n写入探针 saveUi(ns,{nodeUi:{…}},1) ⇒ 应答 {revision:2} 且原样回读 ⇒ 第二道写闸对新字段放行；\n外加那条环境坑：file: 副本只拷 lib/index.js 漏分片 ⇒ 宿主 rc=0 起来但 /xaihi/** 整条 404\n且 stdout 无错，判法是整份 lib 覆盖并比 index.js 的 sha。","tree":{"sha":"2be94ce43a8b36eb80b8e8c614eff18be4cde1b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/2be94ce43a8b36eb80b8e8c614eff18be4cde1b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/dfe4eeb0f22dab4effd31f6597f2216c2b757c34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_u