events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/58650645e74782042fabb44d39ffdf3c104bf554/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:43:54Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:43:54Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"加 ADR-0016：模型不是节点动作的必需调用方——面板/终端/工具执行管线三条调用面共用同一个 invoke()，计划里第 5 项「agent 真调一次 tool」是被读成了「必须让模型跑一次」，那是把巧合的调用方当必需判据，一条本可马上跑的验收因此挂在等授权的外部条件上。替代判据写清楚（CLI 两条尺现跑 rc=0、面板那条缺的是命令通道而非模型，node-mount.tsx:229 给的是可见拒绝），并回改 CONTEXT.md 里「只有 agent 的工具路径能到」那句和 step-3 / live-remotes 两处旧表述","tree":{"sha":"88e46877b5d56530f322246ddcc9cc222b803419","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/88e46877b5d56530f322246ddcc9cc222b803419"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/58650645e74782042fabb44d39ffdf3c104bf554","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","rep