26916d662eb071b3cc7d6b2a346e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:39:47Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:39:47Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"命名空间出处换成我们自己那一行，并给 UI 设置补上可写落点\n\n浏览器读数把错处定在\"出处\"而不是\"通道\"：ctx.fiber.entry.options.id 在这台宿主上\n回 8f3ca9e1（本次装配的实例行名），而 xaihi-ui 那一行按纪律刻意不声明 Config，\n不可配置的行不进 describe()，于是每条设置读写稳定落在 config-namespace-missing。\n同一支只读探针实测到：describe() 20 行里我们那行确实叫 xaihi-core\n（revision 7，value 有 verbose/nodeState），config.getUi(\"xaihi-core\") 当场读通。\n\n改三处：外壳广播 STATE_SETTINGS_NS（编译期常量，与 state.* 同一格）；core 的 Config\n补 nodeUi 一条 volatile（界面上有真读者：nodes/enginev/Component.tsx:226 就在\nhost.config.saveUi），把\"UI 设置的可写字段全仓不存在\"那格填上；新增\npackages/core/tests/settings-row.spec.ts 把\"广播的那格必须有落点\"钉成跨文件尺，\n配阳性对照（摘掉 .volatile() 就看不见 nodeUi；整块缺失返回空清单也是可见的瞎）。\n没顺手给 xaihi-ui 补 schema 的原因：那要动 pnpm-lock.yaml，别人正在大面积重写它。\n\n证据：core 68 passed / core typecheck rc=0 / ui-host 315、node-sdk 113 全绿（后两档\n含 lane 刚落下的文件，不全归我）。check:brand rc=1 的命中全在别人在途文件\n（smartzip 的 __XIRANITE_NO_PASSWORD__ 哨兵、linedup 的 x-xiranite-token），按 ADR-0010\n\"改哨兵=数据迁移先问使用者\"，我没动。宿主需重启才组新配置表，所以 ready.settingsNs\n的浏览器读数还是旧的 8f3ca9e1，这条明写在 ADR 里。","tree":{"sha":"2176cb935c15eeca2bc5e0d008bcb0871903ec39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/2176cb935c15eeca2bc5e0d008bcb0871903ec39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/bf2ae2343af126916d662eb071b3cc7d6b2a346e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist