rnalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/332acb5ee1809fb4371f5a9ac3f85641f7e77323/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:08:20Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:08:20Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"补 P9：桌面端把宿主凭证只发给主窗那一个 webContents，次级窗因此拿不到任何带作用域的 Peer。这是量出来的断路，三条读数同刻逐窗对照——次级窗里 dshDesktopBoot.ready 成立并给出 streamBaseUrl（门牌读得到），同一个窗里 mux 握手失败 readyState 3，同一时刻主窗同一段代码 opened true；机制在 main.ts:1008 那句按 webContentsId 的分发与 rpc-host.ts:104-113「过闸即 operator」没有中间档。顺带写清一条容易搞错的：同源不等于同通道——scheme 转发的 /api 与 mux 在两只窗里都 404，自家 /xaihi/* 反倒处处通（F 段已钉）。建议三档改法按优先级排，并把「直接放宽给所有窗」明确标成安全退化而不是修复；等上游只写清立场也行（第 3 条）。同一份文件级改动里还带着先前 P5/P6 那两处「我们现在怎么绕开」的措辞修正——同级独立仓那句早已作废，改成本仓 desktop/ 与 patch 清单。","tree":{"sha":"cb49388f7bf30291f1e65702257de461254bd49b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/cb49388f7bf30291f1e65702257de461254bd49b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/332acb5ee1809fb4371f5a9ac3f85641f7e77323","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url