路里第二条量死了，并给出第三条的落点：桌面壳的网关流面只发给主窗那一个 webContents（main.ts:1008 判完就 callback 空对象，只有主窗被改写成 origin/cookie/same-origin），而 rpc-host.ts:110 的 admit 一旦过闸就整个发 operator Peer，没有中间档。实机三条一起取：顶层自家文档窗里 dshDesktopBoot.ready 成立（keys=injections+streamBaseUrl，值 http://127.0.0.1:19387）——门牌读得到；同一个窗里 new WebSocket(ws://127.0.0.1:19387/api/remote.mux) 直接握手失败（readyState 3）；同一时刻主窗同一条 URL opened:true——差别只在 webContentsId，不在 CSP 也不在网络。同源那条也顺手量了：/api、/api/remote.mux 与编出来的路径在两只窗里都 404，dsh-app://app 这个 origin 从来不是 RPC 通路。于是「顶层窗的 host 走同源或网关」判死；剩下的可走那条不用新 patch——自家服务面在任何 app 窗里都通（F 段那条 200 就是它），而 Xaihi 的服务跑在 Host 进程里、服务端半边握着 ctx.remote，把节点界面的 host 动词落到我们自己的路由上既不动壳也不伸手拿 operator 范围。代价写清楚了：那一层 host 语义要我们自己实现。要不要走它、还是回头做壳内中继，归使用者拍。全程 GET 与握手，一条 RPC 都没 invoke；探针是一次性脚本，没进判据。","tree":{"sha":"920b9fcd6e0c24afc1b331dc96db5c044c14443d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/920b9fcd6e0c24afc1b331dc96db5c044c14443d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/2f4332db2c2de69e46e6a76d563344af72dca6e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hi