3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"F 段从三条长成五条（91 条 OK、rc=0）：把顶层自家文档窗里「窗自己问得到自家服务面」从一次性探针的读数钉成判据——manifest 回 200 且 rev 必须等于这个窗 URL 上那 12 位（期望从 URL 摘，不从 fetch 返回值反推），再加一条减法对照：编出来的 API 路径与编出来的 rev 都要 404。没有这后一条，整页被重写成欢迎面、任何 fetch 都回 200 的那种假象照样报绿；而服务面真没挂上时 Promise.all 直接 reject，F 段整个红，不会静默跳过。window.opener === null 那一半故意不进判据：钉死它等于替使用者否掉一条还没拍的路（节点界面的 host 换来源有三条候选，见上一条 ADR 行）。","tree":{"sha":"d8e1c8243d1efeba98cb5582411c98af3b687516","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/d8e1c8243d1efeba98cb5582411c98af3b687516"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/4cfed045c30656fd1a021d130913a724d3f09230","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commit/4cfed045c30656fd1a021d130913a724d3f09230","node_id":"C_kwDOU9m3htoAKDRjZmVkMDQ1YzMwNjU2ZmQxYTAyMWQxMzA5MTNhNzI0ZDNmMDkyMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/X