r}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/commits/112903b3b6b97067108ddef95828f898e8e91e06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:24:15Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:24:15Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"sync-dsh 的 --reset 不再漏出 git 的 致命错误：execFileSync 默认把子进程 stderr 接到父进程，而那两处 am --abort 本来就是「可能没在 am 中」的预期失败——读的人会在一条成功的 reset 后面看见一行致命错误，分不清是真坏了还是噪声。给 git() 加 muteStderr 把 stderr 收进管道，reset 与 applyPatches 两处一起改。实测 reset 只剩一行 sync-dsh: reset 到 639ed015（sparse 已关）、rc=0；随后第三次重放仍然 head=64683866 tree=b55efa8c1286 patches=16/16 dirty=0。","tree":{"sha":"5af516197ce1d6f58ebdebacecfd76c88c7b8f84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/trees/5af516197ce1d6f58ebdebacecfd76c88c7b8f84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xaihi/git/commits/112903b3b6b97067108ddef95828f898e8e91e06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a