/api.github.com/users/aleexst99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aleexst99/financial-dashboard/commits/35100910368270f0dcc40c6454cbfcd76063eea6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:42:23Z","email":"alexsateru@gmail.com","name":"aleexst99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:42:23Z","email":"alexsateru@gmail.com","name":"aleexst99"},"message":"test(api): fix NestJS dependency injection in auto-generated specs\n\n- All 6 Nx-generated .spec.ts files failed with ''Nest can''t resolve dependencies'' — never run until now (backend was always tested via curl, not nx test)\n- Fix pattern: mock each injected dependency with { provide: Token, useValue: mockObject }\n- TypeORM Repository mocked via getRepositoryToken(Entity); plain services mocked by class reference\n- Add real behavior tests alongside the fixes: password hashing in UsersService.create, userId always server-injected in TransactionsService/TransactionsController (never trusted from client), sensitive fields stripped from UsersController.updateProfile response, AuthService.login returns identical generic error for nonexistent user vs wrong password\n- Verified: all 8 api spec files pass (12 tests)","tree":{"sha":"80a9367d32cc1b3235b986d54b5bfa3322179c71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aleexst99/financial-dashboard/git/trees/80a9367d32cc1b3235b986d54b5bfa3322179c71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aleexst99/financial-dashboard/git/commits/35100910368270f0dcc40c6454cbfcd76063eea6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62480616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleexst99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleexst99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleexst99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleexst99/gis