19:43Z","email":"sreehari.ms@iwaresolutions.net","name":"sreehari-ms-iware"},"message":"Add root scripts, README and CLAUDE.md\n\n- Root package.json runs dev, lint, typecheck, build and install for\n  all three apps; dev uses concurrently. It holds tooling only, so\n  each app still installs and runs on its own.\n- Override shell-quote to a patched version (GHSA-pqg4-j6r4-53mv),\n  which concurrently pins to a vulnerable release.\n- README.md documents setup, scripts and how the apps fit together.\n- CLAUDE.md records architecture and conventions for Claude Code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e8acc27be68d40ef7dae1c928c926ba8f68955f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreeharims98/mini-shop-micro-frontend/git/trees/4e8acc27be68d40ef7dae1c928c926ba8f68955f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreeharims98/mini-shop-micro-frontend/git/commits/9a08759902c5055fecf7d7a9c92fb0d2477e7cf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250069883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreehari-ms-iware","id":250069883,"login":"sreehari-ms-iware","node_id":"U_kgDODufDew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/subscriptions"