07T09:08:26Z","email":"sreehari.ms@iwaresolutions.net","name":"sreehari-ms-iware"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:08:26Z","email":"sreehari.ms@iwaresolutions.net","name":"sreehari-ms-iware"},"message":"Make cart work end to end with shared types\n\nShell now owns cart state and passes it to the remotes as props:\nproducts gets addToCart and the ids already in the cart, cart gets\nthe items plus quantity-change and remove callbacks.\n\n- Add shared/types.ts with Product and CartItem, used by all three apps\n- Type the remotes in shell/src/declarations.d.ts instead of `any`\n- Product card button reads \"Added to Cart\" once the product is in the cart\n- Header cart link shows the total quantity\n- Cart rows show image, brand, description, rating and stock, with a\n  quantity dropdown and a Remove button\n- Cart keeps cents in prices and shows a message when empty\n- Remote props are optional so products and cart still run standalone\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"565d6c19689dc2bce9c9b6a2ebbc8f3a8bcc2558","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreeharims98/mini-shop-micro-frontend/git/trees/565d6c19689dc2bce9c9b6a2ebbc8f3a8bcc2558"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreeharims98/mini-shop-micro-frontend/git/commits/57e46ea98ffe2ca426bc6d17ad3641a2c51de663","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250069883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreehari-ms-iware/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreehari-ms-iware","id":250069883,"login":"sreehari-ms-iware","node_id":"U_kgDODufDew","organizations_url