"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianSchindler/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianSchindler","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChristianSchindler/ioBroker.alphaess-local/commits/5a338fe3b3665780ec986dfd53a7e976c8db4c71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:44:38Z","email":"chris-schindler@outlook.com","name":"Christian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:44:38Z","email":"chris-schindler@outlook.com","name":"Christian"},"message":"Fix VIS-2 editor crash on VIS-2 < 2.15 (React error #31)\n\nThe automatic JSX runtime bundled react/jsx-runtime of React 19, whose\nelements are rejected by the React 18 of VIS-2 2.14 and older - dropping\nthe widget into the editor crashed it. The classic runtime creates all\nelements with the React shared by VIS-2, so it works with React 18 and 19.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2633940ee70e640e48f9df03e2f90dd633acf2a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChristianSchindler/ioBroker.alphaess-local/git/trees/2633940ee70e640e48f9df03e2f90dd633acf2a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChristianSchindler/ioBroker.alphaess-local/git/commits/5a338fe3b3665780ec986dfd53a7e976c8db4c71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52111837?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianSchindler/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianSchindler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianSchindler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianSchindler/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChristianSchindler","id":52111837,"login":"ChristianSchindler","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTExODM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianSchind