r":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:23:47Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"message":"feat(kafka): legacy classification importer (ADR 0003)\n\nConsumes warehouse.inventory.events under a group passed in from LEGACY_IMPORT_CONSUMER_GROUP; acts only on the full type com.warehouse.wms.inventory-storage.product.ProductClassified, ignores every other type, WARN-skips (and commits past) non-CloudEvents, malformed payloads and invalid classifications, retries transient failures with capped backoff on the SAME message, FetchMessage + CommitMessages after success. Unit tests with a fake reader (incl. a flat legacy message rejected); testcontainers end-to-end test: legacy event in -> product row + ProductRegistered/ProductClassified out through the relay.","tree":{"sha":"1acec20cff83f33a5b660a0e4983fc44cbe73b2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/product-master/git/trees/1acec20cff83f33a5b660a0e4983fc44cbe73b2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/product-master/git/commits/076fa4b8d25829f4d680039e7cfe64667f17f915","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/product-master/commit/076fa4b8d25829f4d680039e7cfe64667f17f915","node_id":"C_kwDOU-013doAKDA3NmZhNGI4ZDI1ODI5ZjRkNjgwMDM5ZTdjZmU2NDY2N2YxN2Y5MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/product-master/commit/ee0f63e78bec75e843268711e4948214b0377065","sha":"ee0f63e78bec75e843268711e4948214b0377065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/product-master/commits/ee0f63e78bec75e843268711e4948214b0377065"}],"sha":"076fa4b8d25829f4d680039e7cfe64667f17f915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/product-master/commits/076fa4b8d25829f4d680039e7cfe64667f17f915"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/product-master/commits/ee0f63e78bec75e843268711e4948214b0377065/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:20:25Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:20:25Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"message":"feat(http): REST adapter for every apis/openapi.yaml route\n\nchi router with otelchi spans/metrics and CORS, strict JSON decoding (DisallowUnknownFields, no trailing data), one RFC 7807 catalogue (https://errors.product-master.warehouse-systems.dev/<slug>, slugs from .claude/rules/rest-api.md; a 500 never leaks its cause), /healthz, /readyz (503 while draining), optional /metrics. Handler tests cover every status code the spec declares, incl. every classification invariant.","tree":{"sha":"9b277810d921a22baa1e70e3e55daa04baa3a492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/product-master/git/trees/9b277810d921a22baa1e70e3e55daa04baa3a492"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/product-master/git/commits/ee0f63e78bec75e843268711e4948214b0377065","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/product-master/commit/ee0f63e78bec75e843268711e4948214b0377065","node_id":"C_kwDOU-013doAKGVlMGY2M2U3OGJlY