r and the memory adapter. Save is two-branch: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING for version 0, UPDATE ... WHERE version = loaded otherwise; no affected row = ErrConcurrentModification (proven with testcontainers). Outbox mirrors warehouse-planning incl. UNIQUE(event_id, topic); relay + LogSink copied from it. Integration tests: version guard, round trip, list paging, atomic product+outbox, relay to a real broker.","tree":{"sha":"be70521714f46957a613362c68050b4a170d2ccd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/product-master/git/trees/be70521714f46957a613362c68050b4a170d2ccd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/product-master/git/commits/c7b662c882b64b86dfb5801559f3f0f784e396d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/product-master/commit/c7b662c882b64b86dfb5801559f3f0f784e396d1","node_id":"C_kwDOU-013doAKGM3YjY2MmM4ODJiNjRiODZkZmI1ODAxNTU5ZjNmMGY3ODRlMzk2ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/product-master